<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="MAT" style="id">-Yemsa New Testament</book>
  <para style="h">Matiwos</para>
  <para style="toc1">Matewosni Misirachchuni Kaama</para>
  <para style="toc2">Matewos</para>
  <para style="toc3">Mat.</para>
  <para style="mt1">Matiwos Tichina</para>
  <para style="mt2">Daamni Yesus Kiristoosni Misirachchuni Kaama</para>
  <para style="imt1">Gachgiru</para>
  <para style="ip">Matiwosni misirachchuni kaama: Yesus yoobaasi abdi zeemma maktena fatunir sinbaasonnawa Ha'oos kur'u teyyaassi daraasik imna abdini kaamaason koi'sinaas barki kamo sinbaason makefa misirachchuni kaamaason ephowa. Es misirachchuni kaamaas Yesus baasso ganeyaassi koontere dichna Ayhudnik koi'ba sinnoynaron daa zuuttambaase asiknengwa.</para>
  <para style="ip">Matiwosni misirachchuni kaamaas ma'a hoorok tichche matsafawa; Yesusni koontoostan kabifaat basa haphuktoosi chowanonnawa basa fattantoosi chowanonna kotta makenanneen orfo Galiilak zagina kaambaasi makonon; assuusonnawa merosin fatubaasi wostononnatu besifa. Estan tusira dey Yesus Galiilan Yerusalem zagina kutuuson han daasta feena neyaasi koi'ni torbaniissi sina wuzasikitonon isarba isarbaasik makefa. Es wuzaasikito dey suuttobaason, kitubaasonnawa kitun kabubaasonna koor'uba zagifa.</para>
  <para style="ip">Han Misirachchuni kaamaas Yesusnin: Ha'oosi tumanon kotte makok ha'suni hugnaba faana dey Ha'oosi taatoni chowanon assuni arto assinynya sinnamato zagiratu besifa. Basa assusi ganesin arki sinaas showo gitok hoore uuch kifilitu maddabtefa:</para>
  <para style="ili">1. Ha'oosi taatoni asuni meeni amala, wosto, mabti, zagsonek sholsusewa koi'ni ixabesiise asin assifa aamaastaki kaambaassi make; (Edde 5-7).</para>
  <para style="ili">2. Asire heppe nawoni meya Misirachchuni kaamaasi makok wostesere hamefe kabaasik baassok imte zoonsiyaasikito; (Edde 10).</para>
  <para style="ili">3. Ha'oosi taatoni chowak imte showo tesa beso; (Edde 13).</para>
  <para style="ili">4. Nawo sinni wuzaas awu sinnamato assifa assu; (Edde 18)</para>
  <para style="ili">5. Hashti fa neyaasi koi'newa Ha'oosi taatoni yoone asik imte assu; (Edde 24-25).</para>
  <para style="iot">Matsafaasi Koor'uba</para>
  <para style="io1">Yesus Kiristoosni zalaasi tuznewa koontone; <char style="ior"><ref loc="MAT 1:1-2:23">1:1—2:23</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Haphquni Yohannisni wosto; <char style="ior"><ref loc="MAT 3:1-12">3:1-12</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Yesusni haphuktonewa fattantone; <char style="ior"><ref loc="MAT 3:13-4:11">3:13—4:11</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Yesus wostobaason Galiilak jammarobaas; <char style="ior"><ref loc="MAT 4:12-18:35">4:12—18:35</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Galiilan Yerusalem; <char style="ior"><ref loc="MAT 19:1-20:34">19:1—20:34</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Koi'ni torbaniis Yerusalemniissinawa biratobaastana; <char style="ior"><ref loc="MAT 21:1-27:66">21:1—27:66</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Daamniisa kitun kabunewa ammanon bestobaase; <char style="ior"><ref loc="MAT 28:1-20">28:1-20</ref> </char></para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="MAT 1"/>
  <para style="s1">Yesusni Koontoni Tuza</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 3:23-38">Luqa. 3:23-38</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 1:1"/>Dawitni zalaassin; Abrahamni zalaassin koonte Yesus Kiristoosni koontoni tuzaas haniiswa: <verse eid="MAT 1:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 1:2"/>Abraham Yisaqnin kooni. Yisaq Yaqobnin kooni. Yaqob Yuudanawa Aybaasakitoninna kooni. <verse eid="MAT 1:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 1:3"/>Yuuda Faaresninnawa Zaaraninna Tiimar sinfa asuskin kooni. Faares Esromnin kooni. <verse eid="MAT 1:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 1:4"/>Esrom dey Aaramnin kooni. Aaram Aminadabni kooni. Aminadab dey Ne'asonnin kooni. Ne'ason dey Selimonnin kooni. <verse eid="MAT 1:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 1:5"/>Selimon Rakeb yistefa asuskin Boyeznin kooni. Boyez Rut yistefa asuskin Iyyobednin kooni. Iyyobed Isseynin kooni. <verse eid="MAT 1:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 1:6"/>Issey dey taato sina Dawitnin kooni. Taato Dawit Ooriyonni asuskin Solomonnin kooni. <verse eid="MAT 1:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 1:7"/>Solomon dey Robiyamnin kooni. Robiyam Abiyanin kooni. Abiyan Asafnin kooni. <verse eid="MAT 1:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 1:8"/>Asaf Iyyosafixnin kooni. Iyyosafix Iyyuramnin kooni. Iyyuram Ooziyanin kooni. <verse eid="MAT 1:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 1:9"/>Ooziyan Iyyuatamnin kooni. Iyyuatam Akaaznin kooni. <verse eid="MAT 1:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 1:10"/>Akaaz Izqiyasnin kooni. Izqiyas Minasenin kooni. Minaase Amosnin kooni. <verse eid="MAT 1:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 1:11"/>Amos Iyyusiyasnin kooni. Iyyusiyas Baabilonni boojoni neyaasik Ikoniyonnawa Aybaasakitoninna kooni. <verse eid="MAT 1:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 1:12"/>Baabilonni bochoneen orfo Ikoniyon Selatiyalnin kooni. Selatiyal Zerubabelnin kooni. <verse eid="MAT 1:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 1:13"/>Zerubabel Abiyudnin kooni. Abiyud Eeliyakemnin kooni. Eeliyakem Azarnin kooni. <verse eid="MAT 1:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 1:14"/>Azar Sadoknin kooni. Sadok akimnin kooni. Akim Eeliyudnin kooni. <verse eid="MAT 1:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 1:15"/>Eeliyud Alazarnin kooni. Alazar Maatanin kooni. Maatan Yaqobnin kooni. <verse eid="MAT 1:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 1:16"/>Yaqob Kiristoos yiste Yesusnin kooni Maaraminon teege Yosefnin kooni. <verse eid="MAT 1:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 1:17"/>Ese Abrahamniistan kabira Dawitniista kar'ananneen asire acheechche koonto. Dawitniistan kabira Baabilonni boojo kar'ananneen asire acheechche koonto. Baabilonni boojoostan kabira Kiristoosni koontoosta kar'ananneen asire acheech koontowa.<verse eid="MAT 1:17"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesus Kiristoosni Koonto</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 2:1-7">Luqa. 2:1-7</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 1:18"/>Yesus Kiristoosni koontoni tochoos haniiswa; intoba Maarami Yosefnik teegtera diis girunoy Korto Ayyanak naanertera beste. <verse eid="MAT 1:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 1:19"/>Teegere duusi Yosef ooko asu sinna boor'a Maaraminon asuni sina kisire makok aane sholowe. Baak aachok beyanak shole. <verse eid="MAT 1:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 1:20"/>Sinuntano bar ekka safarefeen Daamiisa wosiya miitok bestera: «Dawitni naa Yosefno! Teegera duusita nawaas naanertenaas Korto Ayyanakin sinna boor'a Maaraminon ephak digotaatawa. <verse eid="MAT 1:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 1:21"/>Bar naanin tanonir; es naas darabaasin boor'besiissin fatunir sinna boor'a sunbaason ‹Yesus› yiratu sunsuta.»<verse eid="MAT 1:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 1:22"/>Es bar dey sinnaas Daamiis raajjusik: <verse eid="MAT 1:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 1:23"/>«Esenu durbaas naanertona; naanin dey tanona; Sunbaason dey ‹Amanuel› usone yiste bar sinanaktu han bar zuuttera sini. Kotbaas dey: ‹Ha'oos innoneen anetu fawa› uwa»<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 7:14">Isay. 7:14</ref>. </char></note> yi. <verse eid="MAT 1:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 1:24"/>Yosef afay'nitan guzire Daamiisa wosiya makenaasimato zagi. Teegere duusina Maaraminon ephphe keeba hami. <verse eid="MAT 1:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 1:25"/>Uzun nawubaasin tanonanneen Yosef barneen ane aane kune. Koonte naasa sunanon «Yesus» yire sunsi.<verse eid="MAT 1:25"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="MAT 2"/>
  <para style="s1">Awkesan Yeese Aruni Meya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 2:1"/>Yesus Yuuda Betelemuk taato Herodisni neyaasik koontefena kabaasik aruni meya awakesna diman Yerusalem yeesete. <verse eid="MAT 2:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 2:2"/>Ekka yit mamussete: «Koonte Ayhudni taatoski ayinso? Baakuraason awukesan biyaat barik kaa'nonik yaaniwa» yisete. <verse eid="MAT 2:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 2:3"/>Taato Herodis es baron odenaase naye. Yerusalemuk feese asuni meya zuuttere barneen ane nayesete. <verse eid="MAT 2:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 2:4"/>Maagni gaanynye meenawa daraasa tumani assinynyani meena asin zuutire Kiristoos ay koontonamato mamsi. <verse eid="MAT 2:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 2:5"/>Baasso dey: «Yuudani daasta fa Betelemuk raajjuus ekka yire tichinar faar. <verse eid="MAT 2:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 2:6"/>‹Yuudani daastaki fa katama Betelemne! Ta dara sina Israelnon oodni ha'sinynya neekin kesnir sinna boor'a inya inya katamaassin ne aafa hatota wuza› yistera maktera faar» yisete. <verse eid="MAT 2:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 2:7"/>Esseen orfo Herodis aruni meyanon aachok teegere baakuraas baassok bestena wonaason mamsire ari. <verse eid="MAT 2:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 2:8"/>Baassotin ekka yit wosi: «Betelem hamfaat koonte naasin gasasutiwa; danefaatine taak dey yaara makoti. Ta dey hamma barik kaa'nona» <verse eid="MAT 2:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 2:9"/>Baasso dey taatoosa kaamanon odere hamete. Awakesna diman biyete baakuraas naas feena dimaasta hamma yeronanneen zoonsit faar. <verse eid="MAT 2:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 2:10"/>Baakuraason biyeteese akama gira girsete. <verse eid="MAT 2:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 2:11"/>Keer girsere daag naas intoba Maaramineen ane feen biyete. Barki sina sinbesiisik sagadesere saxinibesiison gachche warqe, ixaananewa kumbine asi ima imesete. <verse eid="MAT 2:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 2:12"/>Aruni meya wolsere Herodisniki hamonoytemato baassok Ha'o miitok makena boor'a ooma ugnak daabesi hamete.<verse eid="MAT 2:12"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Daag Naasin Ephere Giphtsi Guuzete</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 2:13"/>Aruni meya hametenneen orfo Daamiisa wosiya miitok Yosefnik bestera: «Herodis daag naasin worunak sholedifer sinna boor'a kabira naasin intobaasneen ane ephpha Giphtsi hamma; ta neek makonanneen esta fowa» yi. <verse eid="MAT 2:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 2:14"/>Yosef dey kabire daag naasin intobaasneen ane ephphe waalak Giphtsi hami. <verse eid="MAT 2:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 2:15"/>Daamiis raajjubaasik: «Naataasin Giphtsin teegengwa» yina bar sinanaktu Giphtsi hamete. Herodis kitunanneen esta diisete.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HOS 11:1">Hos. 11:1</ref>.</char></note><verse eid="MAT 2:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 2:16"/>Esseen orfo Herodis aruni meya barin eshere aatte hamobesiison araat akamanon gi'tere aruni meyakin odena neyaasik Beetelemnewa biratobaastana fa daastaki neeba hepnewa esseen daakalo fa garo garo naanggotaason zuutire wortonak zagi. <verse eid="MAT 2:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 2:17"/>Es kabaasik raajju Ermiyasnik makte raajiis siniwa. <verse eid="MAT 2:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 2:18"/>«Rahel naanggotbaasik waasi; waasnewa akama soosone asi kaama Ramak odte. Naanggotbaas aafa sinna boor'a fakuk aane chima» yiste bar sini.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 31:15">Ermi. 31:15</ref>.</char></note><verse eid="MAT 2:18"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Giphtsin Wolle Naaziret Yoo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 2:19"/>Herodis kitinanneen orfo Daamiisa wosiya Giphtsik Yosefnik miitok bestera: <verse eid="MAT 2:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 2:20"/>«Daag naasa kaanon tishkuk shole bar kitiwa. Kabira daag naaneesin intobaasneen ane ephpha Israelni daa hamma» yi. <verse eid="MAT 2:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 2:21"/>Yosef kabire daag naasin intobaasneen ephphe Israelni daa hami. <verse eid="MAT 2:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 2:22"/>Herodisni naa Arkelawos ababaasa edde Yuudaki daasta taattenamato odere esta hama dige. Sinuntano orfo miito biire Galiilani daa hami. <verse eid="MAT 2:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 2:23"/>Raajjunik: «Naazirawi ustona» yiste bar sinanak Naaziret yiste katamaassi hamme di.<verse eid="MAT 2:23"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="MAT 3"/>
  <para style="s1">Haphqife Yohannisni Misirachchuni Kaamaasi Mako</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 3:1"/>Es kabaasik haphqife Yohannis Yuudani daastaki ichma daassi maket ye. <verse eid="MAT 3:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 3:2"/>Es maket yeenaas dey: «Samani taatoos tai'se sinna boor'a harmutiwa» yifar. <verse eid="MAT 3:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 3:3"/>Raajju sina Isayyasni matsafaassi: « ‹Daamiisa ugnanon hoossuti; sapsira dey zeephti› iyaafe ichma daassi chaaget fe asuni kaama» yistera makte bar haniiswa. <verse eid="MAT 3:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 3:4"/>Yohannis mayfena mayaas Gaalani esak wiche maama. Geshobaasta dey googoni talfa taar'et feer. Muubaas dey bilnganewa zaboni eesne. <verse eid="MAT 3:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 3:5"/>Es kabaasik Yerusalemun, Yuudani daa zuuttambaase asiissin, Yordanosni biratoosta fa daas zuuttambaase asiissi fe asuni meya zuuttere barki yeet feeseter. <verse eid="MAT 3:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 3:6"/>Boor'besiison harmifaafe Yordanoski akaassi barik haphuktet feeseter. <verse eid="MAT 3:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 3:7"/>Yohannis showo Ferisawini meenawa Seduqawini meena haphuktok barki yeesefeen biyaat: «Nitto ufoni naanggota; yoonak fa Ha'oosi gi'sin kesatik oonso nittok makeri? <verse eid="MAT 3:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 3:8"/>Ese harmuntiison besifa wosto wostoti. <verse eid="MAT 3:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 3:9"/>Nibnitiissi: ‹Abraham inno abawa› yifetimatotawa. Nittok makefawungwa; Ha'oos han shu'aaskitosin kabgira Abrahamni naanggota zagunak chimanawa. <verse eid="MAT 3:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 3:10"/>Hash anfala i'oosi diisi kunfarwa; ma'a gaana gaannoy i'oosikito zuuttera katerna geesi ha'tona. <verse eid="MAT 3:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 3:11"/>Ta harmiyaasik akaktu haphquna; ta chaa'mabaasi taar'anon kotanak chimnoynar tayistan akamanon denalo sina bar ta orfoosta yoonir. Bar Korto Ayyanaknawa geyaknatu haphquna. <verse eid="MAT 3:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 3:12"/>Meyaason sama ha'una manshiis kushubaassitu fa; oodaason mai'sire kaynuna; zagooson botobaassi gaagana; sinuntano ufaason tishunoy geesi kiichuna» yi. <figure style="fig" alt="Winnowing grain" file="HK00097B.tif" size="span" ref="3:12">Oodaastan meyaason sama ha'u </figure><verse eid="MAT 3:12"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesusni Haphuqto</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 1:9-11">Mar. 1:9-11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:21-22">Luqa. 3:21-22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 3:13"/>Es kabaasik Yesus Yohannis barin haphqunak Galiilan Yordanoski akaaski ye. <verse eid="MAT 3:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 3:14"/>Sinuntano Yohannis: «Taan ne haphqutak sholsu sinna feen ne taaki yaafatoso?» yit kali. <verse eid="MAT 3:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 3:15"/>Yesus wolgire: «Taan kalataatawa; ooko sina baron zagunak sholsu sinna boor'a beywa» yin es kabaasik Yohannis «ma'i» yi. <verse eid="MAT 3:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 3:16"/>Yesus haphuktenanneen orfo geregere akaassin kesi. Estan samaas gachchen Ha'oni Ayyana nakalone faar sinna basaasta kerefeen bi. <verse eid="MAT 3:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 3:17"/>Kaama dey saman yaara: «Haniis ta shunfana naaswa; bariktu girefawungwa» yi.<verse eid="MAT 3:17"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 3"/>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="MAT 4"/>
  <para style="s1">Yesusni Fattanto</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 1:12-13">Mar. 1:12-13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:1-13">Luqa. 4:1-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 4:1"/>Esseen orfo Ha'oni Ayyana Yesus dabulosnik fattantonak zoonsira ichma daassi hami. <verse eid="MAT 4:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 4:2"/>Estak Yesus acheechasir wonnewa waalne soomenanneen orfo makte. <verse eid="MAT 4:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 4:3"/>Fattanoni bar tai'sere: «Ne Ha'oni naa sinfaatane han shu'aasikito tusha sinanak ajajebbo» yi. <verse eid="MAT 4:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 4:4"/>Sinuntano Yesus wolgire: « ‹Asu Ha'oosi noonosin kesfa kaama zuuttambaase asiktano muu muuk aane feefe› yistera tichchewa» yi. <verse eid="MAT 4:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 4:5"/>Esseen orfo Daabulos Yesusnin Yerusalem ephphe taamme betemeqdesiisi tukta yeetaat: <verse eid="MAT 4:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 4:6"/>Eeka yi: « ‹Wochonees shu'aasta tuusa'onoymato neen oodanak Ha'oos wosibaason ajajonawa. Kushubesiisik dey neen kabugsonewa› yistera tichchewa; ese ne Ha'oni Naa sinfaatane yeet golo teetneeson ha'uwa» yi. <verse eid="MAT 4:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 4:7"/>Yesus dey wolgire: « ‹Daama Ha'oneeson fattanotaata› yistera dey tichchewa» yi. <verse eid="MAT 4:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 4:8"/>Hepsa dey Daabulos Yesusnin akama dicha aamta kisire yeetaat han daasi taatoni ulfinanon zuutire besaat: <verse eid="MAT 4:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 4:9"/>«Ne taak gandera sagadefaatane han baron zuutira neek imanawa» yi. <verse eid="MAT 4:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 4:10"/>Es kabaasik Yesus: «Hantan kes! Ne Sexana; ‹Daama Ha'oneesik kaa'no. Bar baron shiipho› yistera tichchewa» yi. <verse eid="MAT 4:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 4:11"/>Es kabaasik Daabulos barin beyi; Ha'oosi wosiya dey tai'sera barin argasit faaser.<verse eid="MAT 4:11"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesus Misirachchuni Kaamaason Galiilak Mako Ephi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 1:4-15">Mar. 1:4-15</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:4-15">Luqa. 4:4-15</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 4:12"/>Yesus Yohannis taatoni keer girubaason odenayse Galiila hami. <verse eid="MAT 4:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 4:13"/>Naaziretnon beyfaat Zabiloonnewa Niftalemne asi awurajja Galiilani baarisi ha'ta fa Kifirnahom yistefa katamaassi hamme di. <verse eid="MAT 4:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 4:14"/>Es bar dey sinnay raajju Isayyas ekka yit makena kaamaas sinanakwa.<verse eid="MAT 4:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 4:15"/>«Zabulonni daas, Niftalemni daas,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 4:15">Yordanosni yesalo baarisi ha'ta fa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 4:15">Aazabni meenir sina Galiila;<verse eid="MAT 4:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 4:16"/>Talmaassi fe daraas;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 4:16">akama chaarefa bi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 4:16">kituni yirara faana daasta diise baassok;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 4:16">chaarefa kessa beste.»<verse eid="MAT 4:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 4:17"/>Es wonaastaneen kabire Yesus: «Ha'oosi taato tai'sewa; Harmutiwa» iyaafe mako ephi.<verse eid="MAT 4:17"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesus Kurxummi Eshefe Meyanon Teege</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 1:16-20">Mar. 1:16-20</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:1-11">Luqa. 5:1-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 4:18"/>Yesus Galiilaki baarisi tesha aatfet hep ayni meya Phexiros yistefe Simoonninnawa ayba Indiriyasninna kurxummi eshak yugudobesiison akaassi ha'sefeen bi. Baasso wostoos dey kurxummini esha. <verse eid="MAT 4:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 4:19"/>Yesus dey baassok: «Taneen ane yaafaat asuni meyanon Ha'oosi taatosi wolgutik nittotin zagunawa» yi. <verse eid="MAT 4:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 4:20"/>Baasso dey geregere yugudobesiison beyfaat barneen ane hamete. <verse eid="MAT 4:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 4:21"/>Estan aatte oom hep ayna ayna Zebdewosni naanggot sina Yaqobnawa Yohannisna asin bi. Ababesi Zebdewosneen ane goonuusta diisefaat yugudobesiison mai'sifeen biyaat teege. <verse eid="MAT 4:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 4:22"/>Baasso dey geregere goonuusewa ababesiisna asin beyfaat Yesusneen ane hamete. <figure style="fig" alt="Fishing" file="HK00207B.tif" size="span" ref="4:18-22">Qurxummini eshshe epha </figure><verse eid="MAT 4:22"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Mettanni Meeni Faru</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 6:17-19">Luqa. 6:17-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 4:23"/>Yesus baasso Ayhudni shiiphoni keyaasikitosi assit Ha'oosi taatoni misirachchuni kaamaason maket daraasasi fa showo tesa meroson zuutire fatit Galiilani daa zuuttambaase asiissi biratet feer. <verse eid="MAT 4:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 4:24"/>Yesus zagina chowaasi wolla Soriyani daa zuuttambaase asiissi odte. Showo tesa merok mette asuni meyanonnawa rakkokna oottere fe asuni meyanon, dey kiina ayyana ephna baassotin, akataki merobesi faana baassotinnawa laafani meyanonna zuuttire ephphe Yesusniki teshshesete. Bar dey zuuttambesiise asin fati. <verse eid="MAT 4:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 4:25"/>Galiilani daastaki, asir katamaassin, Yerusalemun, Yuudan, dey Yordanosni yeesalon showo dara Yesusneen ane hamete.<verse eid="MAT 4:25"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 4"/>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="MAT 5"/>
  <para style="s1">Yesus Aamaasta Assina Assu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 5:1"/>Yesus showo dara barki yeefeen biyaat aamaasta kesse di. Nawobaasakito dey barki yeeseten <verse eid="MAT 5:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 5:2"/>Ekka yit assu ephi:<verse eid="MAT 5:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 5:3"/>«Ha'oosi taato baassor sinna boor'a;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 5:3">amantobesiison Ha'oosta zagsefaat;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 5:3">teetbesiison daa ephefe baasso suustowa.<verse eid="MAT 5:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 5:4"/>Ha'o baassok chima imnir sinna boor'a;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 5:4">suumet feesefe baasso suustowa.<verse eid="MAT 5:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 5:5"/>Teetbesiison daa ephefe baasso;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 5:5">han daason warasosoner sinna boor'a suustowa.<verse eid="MAT 5:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 5:6"/>Ooko sina wostooson;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 5:6">maktere iktet feesefe baasso;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 5:6">gawusoner sinna boor'a suustowa.<verse eid="MAT 5:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 5:7"/>Feeshun yisefe baasso;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 5:7">baassok feeshun ustonir sinna boor'a suustowa.<verse eid="MAT 5:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 5:8"/>Nibbesi kayim sina baasso;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 5:8">Ha'ooson biyoner sinna boor'a suustowa.<verse eid="MAT 5:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 5:9"/>Asunin gansit feesefe baasso;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 5:9">Ha'oni naanggot yistere;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 5:9">teegtosoner sinna boor'a suustowa.<verse eid="MAT 5:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 5:10"/>Ooko sina wuzaasi boor'a kabugtesefe baasso;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 5:10">Ha'oosi taato baassor sinna boor'a suustowa.<verse eid="MAT 5:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 5:11"/>«Ta boor'a asuni meya nittotin me'efe kabaasiknawa kabugsefe kabaasikna dey eshak sunnitiison mangsisefe kabaasik nitto suustowa. <verse eid="MAT 5:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 5:12"/>Waagnitiis den samak akama sinna boor'a girotiwa. Dey akamanon giroti. Nittoostan zeemme fe raajjuni meyaasta esiisimatotu shana katisetewa» yi.<verse eid="MAT 5:12"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Kawonewa Chaarefne</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 9:50">Mar. 9:50</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 14:34-35">Luqa. 14:34-35</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 5:13"/>Dey Yesus: «Nitto han daasi kawowa. Sinuntano kawoos kaar'ba tishifaanane aakkagira kaar'nirinso? Ek gero hai'tera asuni wochosi yetonaastano ke'ana wuzaba aafawa. <verse eid="MAT 5:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 5:14"/>Nitto han daasik chaarefawa. Aamaasta keetera di katamaas aachonak aafawa chimanawuza. <verse eid="MAT 5:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 5:15"/>Asu tona tonire waashshi duusifewoso? Tega dimtatanoso duusaan keyaassi fe asusik zuutira chaarefanari? <verse eid="MAT 5:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 5:16"/>Esiisimato asuni meya nitto ma'a wostooson biyere samaki abantiisin ulfinsusonek chaarefnitiis asu zuuttambaase asi sina chaarongwa» yi.<verse eid="MAT 5:16"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Tumaasi Chowa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 5:17"/>Dey Yesus: «Ta Museni tumaasonnawa raajjuni meeni kaamaasonna shaarok yaanarne faar sinna nittok bestonaatawa. Ta yaanaas zagunakwa. <verse eid="MAT 5:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 5:18"/>Ta futok nittok makefawungwa; samaasewa daase aatananneen tumaassin millu duktonu wostota feeshnoy aafawa aatana wuza. <verse eid="MAT 5:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 5:19"/>Ese han ajajiissin ater sina isaason shaarefe barnawa esiisimato dey asunik assife barna samaki taatoossik zuuttambaase asiistan daakalotu sinana. Sinuntano zagife bar wedey assife bar oonu sinfaanane samaki taatoossi arkir yisteretu teegtona. <verse eid="MAT 5:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 5:20"/>Nittok makefawungwa; nitto ooko sinaas Museni tumaasi assinynyaasatannawa Ferisawini meyaastanna denalo sina shakaanane samaki Ha'oosi taatosi isanne aafawa giruti wuza.<verse eid="MAT 5:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 5:21"/>«Zeemoti baassok ‹Kaa worutiita› wori basaasta mangsu kater yistenamato odetiwa. <verse eid="MAT 5:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 5:22"/>Sinuntano ta nittok makefawungwa; aybaasata gi'tefe basaasta mangsu katerwa. Dey aybaasin: ‹Ne ke'nor› yire me'a basaasta mangsu katerwa. Oonu dey: ‹Ne odo oyo› yife bar zuuttambaase geeni tir'maassi giruni mangsutu katonirwa. <verse eid="MAT 5:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 5:23"/>Es bari boor'a Ha'oosik imata imneeson shoo'aasta teshshefata kabaasik ayneesin tugita chowa foobaason yaadatefaatane; <verse eid="MAT 5:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 5:24"/>Es Ha'oosik imata imneeson shoo'aasi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5:24 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Israelni meeni dubbiyoossi shoo'a shu'aktu oochera maa'a imtefa. [Suura girifaanane ma'ar]</char></note> tesha kunsaat zeemma hamma ayneesneen ane ganowa. Estan wolla yaara imneeson imma. <verse eid="MAT 5:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 5:25"/>Gumanees neen malaten mangsuni kar'ni keer hamfata kabaasik zeemma uguntak taptera ganowa. Ekka zagu shakaatane gumanees neen aatire gaanynyanik imin gaanynyaas dey aatire meya taar'osik imin taatoni keer girutawa. <verse eid="MAT 5:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 5:26"/>Futo neek makefawungwa; koi'ni duudeeson kaasutanneen isanne taatoni keyaassin aafa kesata wuza» yi.<verse eid="MAT 5:26"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Gerkesa Aane Sholsifa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 5:27"/>Dey Yesus: « ‹Gerkesatiita!› yistenasimato odetiwa. <verse eid="MAT 5:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 5:28"/>Sinuntano ta nittok makefawungwa; mashkasuki biire ane kunanak shole bar zuuttere es kabaasik barneen ane nibbaassik gerkesiwa. <verse eid="MAT 5:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 5:29"/>Hoi'ta aafnees neen tuusa'sifaanane woi'ira kisuwa; atune zuuttera geeni tir'maassi ha'tobaasneen atuneessin isaron turkifaatane wayyawa. <verse eid="MAT 5:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 5:30"/>Hoi'ta kushunees neen tuusa'sifaanane kar'a ha'uwa; atunees zuuttera geeni tir'maassi ha'tobaasneen atuneessin isaron turkifaatane wayyawa.<verse eid="MAT 5:30"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Asuni Teetni Kotni Chowa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 19:9">Mat. 19:9</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:11-12">Mar. 10:11-12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 16:18">Luqa. 16:18</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 5:31"/>«Asubaason gafkife bar zuuttambaase gafkuni tichaason imowa» yistena baron odetiwa. <verse eid="MAT 5:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 5:32"/>Sinuntano ta nittok makefawungwa: «Asubaas gerkesfeen dannoy baak gafkife bar zuuttambaase hamma gerkesanaktu zagifewa. Esiisimato dey gafukte baron ephpha bar dey gerkesiwa.»<verse eid="MAT 5:32"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Teyyani Chowak Imte Assu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 5:33"/>«Esha tewutiita; sinuntano teyiti baron Daamiisik zagutiwa» yistena baron odetiwa. <verse eid="MAT 5:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 5:34"/>Sinuntano ta nittok makefawungwa; isanne tewutiita; Den samaas Ha'oosi zigimu sinna boor'a samaasiknu sinfanak tewutiita. <verse eid="MAT 5:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 5:35"/>Han daas dey Ha'oni wocho yer'na dima sinna boor'a han daasik tewutiita. Yerusalem dey arkitto taatoosa katama sinna boor'a Yerusalemuk tewutiita. <verse eid="MAT 5:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 5:36"/>Somneesi fashaassin isaron foro wedey kara zaguk aafa chimata wuza sinna boor'a teetneesik tewutaata. <verse eid="MAT 5:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 5:37"/>Sinuntano nitto wollaas «Aa» sinfaanane «Aa» sinun wedey «Indaane» sinfaanane «Indaane» uti. Es baristan oomaas manguskingwa.<verse eid="MAT 5:37"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Gumani Kaasto Aane Sholsifa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 5:38"/>« ‹Aafaasik aafa; ay'aasik ay'a› yistenamato odetiwa. <verse eid="MAT 5:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 5:39"/>Ta nittok makefawungwa; mangu wuza nittoosta zagife asusin guma kaastotiita. Sinuntano hoi'ta gachneeson bocha barik alda gachneeson dey shelgira besuwa. <verse eid="MAT 5:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 5:40"/>Sikaloki gaag mayoneeson ephphetoonak neen malatefe barik tukaastaki gaag mayooson daysira imma. <verse eid="MAT 5:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 5:41"/>Isa asu; isa kiilo meetiri<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5:41 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Girikni matsafaassi isa kiilo meetiri yini bar isa mayili utu yifa. Es bar dey Roomni meya taar'oni meya asunin ba'a wor'e hamanak giddisisefe ugnawa.</char></note> hamatak neen giddisifaanane hep kiilo meetiri daysira barneen ane hamma. <verse eid="MAT 5:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 5:42"/>Neekin shiiphefe barik imma; neekin liqonak sholefe barik kalataatawa.<verse eid="MAT 5:42"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Gumaasin Shunni Chowa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 5:43"/>« ‹Asunin shungwa; gumaneesin oomto› yiste baron odetiwa. <verse eid="MAT 5:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 5:44"/>Sinuntano ta nittok makefawungwa; gumantiisin shunti; nittotin kabugsefe baassok shiiphoti. <verse eid="MAT 5:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 5:45"/>Es baron zagaatine samak fe abantiisik naanggota sinati. Ha'oos manguni meyaastanawa ma'a asuni meyaastana awa ichanak zagir. Ookoni meyaastanawa boor'ni meyaastana iro ichanak zagir. <verse eid="MAT 5:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 5:46"/>Nittotin shunfe baasso baassotin shunfaatine awu ke'atirinso? Girbo zuutife baassonu esiisontanoso zagseferi? <verse eid="MAT 5:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MAT 5:47"/>Ayniti aynitiisakitonik naga ooshshesefaatine aro gaddo wuza zagitiso? Aazabni meyanu esiisontanoso zagseferi? <verse eid="MAT 5:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MAT 5:48"/>Es bari boor'a samak fe abantiis kayim sinnamato nitto dey kayim sinti» yi.<verse eid="MAT 5:48"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 5"/>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="MAT 6"/>
  <para style="s1">Tukamnik Imni Chowa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 6:1"/>«Asuni meya biyotowa iyaat ma'a wostontiison asuni sina zagustan teetnitiison oodtiwa. Es baron zagaatine samak fe abantiiskin danati waagniti aafawa. <verse eid="MAT 6:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 6:2"/>Es bari boor'a tukamni meyak imfeti kabaasik sinnoy sinne bestesefe baasso asuni meya ulfinsusonek Ayhudni shiiphoni keyaassinawa ugnaastana zagsefeesimato biistok zagutiitawa. Ta futok makefawungwa; waagbesiison ephpheteesetewa. <verse eid="MAT 6:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 6:3"/>Sinuntano ne tukamni meyak imfata kabaasik hoi'ta kushunees zagifana baron alda kushunees arunaata. <verse eid="MAT 6:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 6:4"/>Tukamni meyak imfata imnees aachok sinun. Aachok zagte baron biife abanees neek kaasuna.<verse eid="MAT 6:4"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ha'o Shiiphoni Chowa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 11:2-4">Luqa. 11:2-4</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 6:5"/>«Ha'o shiiphefeti kabaasik sinnoy sinne bestesefe baassosimato sinatiita. Baasso asu taan biyo iyaat Ayhudni shiiphoni keyaassinawa ugnaasi ha'tana yerefaat Ha'oni shiipho shuneter. Futo nittok makefawungwa; waagbesiison ephpheteesetewa. <verse eid="MAT 6:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 6:6"/>Sinuntano ne Ha'o shiiphefata kabaasik keeneeson kulfaat biistonoy abaneeski shiiphowa. Aachok zagte baron biife abanees neek kaasunawa. <verse eid="MAT 6:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 6:7"/>Aazabni meya wolumbesiisi aatamak odtoninne faar sinnatu baassok bestefa. Sinuntano nitto shiiphefeti kabaasik baassosimato shimaasik heppa heppa wolgaat shiiphotiita. <verse eid="MAT 6:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 6:8"/>Ese nitto baassosimato sinatiitawa. Abantiis nitto shiiphonoy faani nittok sholsu wuzason arirwa. <verse eid="MAT 6:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 6:9"/>Ese nitto ekka yira shiiphsoti:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 6:9">« ‹Den samak fe abaniiso;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 6:9">Korto sunnees tegifawungwa;<verse eid="MAT 6:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 6:10"/>Taatonees yoonwa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 6:10">ne shunfata bar;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 6:10">den samak sinfanaasimato;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 6:10">han daastak dey sinun.<verse eid="MAT 6:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 6:11"/>Hawungti muuniison;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 6:11">hawung imma.<verse eid="MAT 6:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 6:12"/>Innotin miir'efe baassotin;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 6:12">feeshun yifeniisimato;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 6:12">mangsuniison feeshun uwa.<verse eid="MAT 6:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 6:13"/>Manguussin oodtano;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 6:13">fatanasi innotin gedataata.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 6:13">[Taatoos, hugnaasewa ulfinaase;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 6:13">koi'ba foontonon neerwa; aamin.›]<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6:13 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Han faadba 13 fa bar zeemoti Girikni matsafaasta aafa.</char></note><verse eid="MAT 6:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 6:14"/>«Asuni meya nittoosta katisete miir'aason feeshun iyaatine den samak fe abantiis nittooson feeshun una. <verse eid="MAT 6:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 6:15"/>Sinuntano asuni meya nittoosta katisete miir'aason feeshun uu shakaatine abantiis nitto boor'aason aafa feeshun unawuza.<verse eid="MAT 6:15"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Soomoni Chowa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 6:16"/>«Soomera shiiphefeti kabaasik sinnoy sinne bestesefe baassosimato suumotiita. Baasso soomere shiiphobesiison asu arunak sinbesiison aliqsisefe. Futo nittok makefawungwa; waagbesiison ephpheteesetewa. <verse eid="MAT 6:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 6:17"/>Sinuntano ne soomera shiiphefata kabaasik aafneessi masera fochowa. <verse eid="MAT 6:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 6:18"/>Ekka zagaatane aachok fe abaneesteno soomere shiiphoneeson oom asu aafa aruna wuza. Aachok biife abanees neek kaasuna.<verse eid="MAT 6:18"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Han Daasta Otumni Zuutu Aane Sholsifa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 12:33-34">Luqa. 12:33-34</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 6:19"/>«Konymar muunaasta shiira dey mangunaasta wiis dey yiishshe wiisona han daasta waaga zuututiitawa. <verse eid="MAT 6:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 6:20"/>Sinuntano konymar muunoynar dey shiira mangunoynar wiisi dey yiishshe wiisonoyna dimta den samak waagnitiison zuututiwa. <verse eid="MAT 6:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 6:21"/>Waagnees faanaasta nibnees dey esta foonawa. <verse eid="MAT 6:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 6:22"/>Atuni tonaas aafawa; es bari boor'a ne aafaas fayya sinfaanane atunees zuuttera chaarefatu sinana. <verse eid="MAT 6:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 6:23"/>Sinuntano aafnees mettana sinfaanane atunees zuuttera talmatu sinana. Ese neyista fa chaarefaas talma sinnanneen talmaas dey awune faaron arkira talmonirinso?<verse eid="MAT 6:23"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Fook Rakkato Aane Sholsifa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 16:13">Luqa. 16:13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 12:22-31">12:22-31</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 6:24"/>«Isa asu hep daamnik wostinynya sinanak aafa chimanawuza. Isaasin oomtefaat hepsaasin shunar sinana wedey isaasin ulfinsaat hepsaasin kashshuna. Esiisimato isa asu Ha'oknawa waagakna wostinynya sinanak aafa chima wuza. <verse eid="MAT 6:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 6:25"/>Es bari boor'a nittok makefawungwa; foontiisik awu muunittaaso? Awu ushanittaaso? Awu mayanittaaso? yira rakkatotiitawa. Kaa muustan atu mayaastan denalotanoso? <verse eid="MAT 6:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 6:26"/>Samaasta fulifa kasaasikitonon biitiwa; aane bukfa, aane kar'fa; gombissi dey aane gaagfa. Samaki fe abantiistu maasifer. Nitto barikitoniistan akamanon denalowa. <verse eid="MAT 6:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 6:27"/>Nittoossin duudere woggabaasta isa wona daysuk chimnir oonso? <verse eid="MAT 6:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 6:28"/>Eekin mayni boor'a awuniron rakkatefetiso? Bakkeesta diise fur'aasikito aakkak dichfanamato gasasira biitiwa. Aane hopsefa; aane sukfa. <verse eid="MAT 6:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 6:29"/>Sinuntano nittok makefawungwa; Solomonnu fa ulfinba zuuttambaase asik fur'aasikitosin isaasne faaron aane mayewa. <verse eid="MAT 6:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 6:30"/>Amantonti yo'ina nitto! Ese Ha'oos hash hawung biistefaat wono geyaassi ha'toni bakkeestaki fur'aason ekka maysir sinnanneen nittotin aakkak arkissira maysu beynirinso? <verse eid="MAT 6:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 6:31"/>Ese awu muunittaaso? Awu ushanittaaso? Awu mayanittaaso? Uuk rakkatotiitawa. <verse eid="MAT 6:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 6:32"/>Es baron zuuttire Aazabni meyanu sholseterwa. Es bar zuuttera nittok sholsifanamato samaki abantiis arifewa. <verse eid="MAT 6:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 6:33"/>Sinuntano nitto zeemma Ha'oosi taatononnawa ooko sina baronna sholoti. Es wuzaasikito zuuttera nittok daytera imtona. <verse eid="MAT 6:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 6:34"/>Es bari boor'a wonotiison safarok rakkatotiita. Wonotiisik wonoti wonaas barik rakkaton. Wonaasik mangubaas hooronawa» yi.<verse eid="MAT 6:34"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 6"/>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="MAT 7"/>
  <para style="s1">Oomiisata Mangsuni Kar'a Aane Sholsifa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 6:37-42">Luqa. 6:37-42</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 7:1"/>«Nittoosta mangsu katonoynamato ooniistanu mangsu kar'atiita. <verse eid="MAT 7:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 7:2"/>Nitto oom asusata mangsu kar'fetiisne fa mangsuni kar'a nittoosta dey katona. Esiisimato dey nitto oomiisik safarefeti safareesik wolla nittok safartona. <verse eid="MAT 7:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 7:3"/>Ne aafaassi kuni tuchaason biinoy ayneesa aafsi kuni diimaason aakkak biitso? <verse eid="MAT 7:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 7:4"/>Wedey ne aaffaassi kuni tucha feen ayneesin ‹Aafneessi kuni diimaason kisunawa› aakkak yifasso? <verse eid="MAT 7:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 7:5"/>Sinnoy sinne bestefe ne; zeemma ne aafaassi kuni tuchaason kisaat esseen orfo ayneesa aafsi kuni diimaason kisutak gasasira biyatawa. <verse eid="MAT 7:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 7:6"/>Korto sina wuzason kanaasik imatiita. Inquntiison mukoosi sina ha'utiita. Mukoosikito wochobaasiktu yer'ana. Kanaasikito dey wolla nittotin saar'ana.<verse eid="MAT 7:6"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Shiiphoni Gaana</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 11:9-13">Luqa. 11:9-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 7:7"/>«Shiiphoti nittok imtona; Sholoti danati; Gamalaason ki'ti nittok gachchona. <verse eid="MAT 7:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 7:8"/>Shiiphe bar zuuttere ephphetoona; Sholefe bar danana; Gamalaason ki'fe barik gachchona. <verse eid="MAT 7:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 7:9"/>Nittoossin naabaas daabbo mamsin shu'a imni aba oonso? <verse eid="MAT 7:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 7:10"/>Kurxummi mamsifaanane zawa imnir oonso? <verse eid="MAT 7:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 7:11"/>Ese nitto mangu asu sinfaat naanggotnitiisik ma'a wuza ima aritinneen eekin den samak fe abantiis shiiphefe baassok futoosik aakka daysire ima beynirinso? <verse eid="MAT 7:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 7:12"/>Ese asuni meya nittok zagsonek sholefeti baron zuutira nitto dey oomiisik esiisimato zaguti. Tumaasewa raajjuni meeni kaamaase esiisontu makefa.<verse eid="MAT 7:12"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Tugo Finynyisi Chowa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 7:13"/>«Tugo finynyiissi kamo giruti; Tishuni finynyiis ugunbaas akama taga; es finynyiissi kamo girife baasso dey showo. <verse eid="MAT 7:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 7:14"/>Kaani keer taamfa ugnaasi finynya tugowa. Ugunbaas dey tiir'owa. Es baron danni asuni meya dey kiiskuwa.<verse eid="MAT 7:14"/></para>
  <para style="s1">I'o Gaanbaastaktu Artefa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 6:43-44">Luqa. 6:43-44</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 7:15"/>«Sikalobesiissi bo'inynya iririkane feer sinefaat fantuni koma mayye nitto ganeyaassi yoosonek fe esh raajjuni meyakin teetnitiison oodtiwa. <verse eid="MAT 7:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 7:16"/>Baassotin dey arsotiis gaanbesiistakwa; seer'akin wayinini gaana wedey asewaaskin belesini gaana kephteroso? <verse eid="MAT 7:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 7:17"/>Esiisimato ma'a i'oos zuuttera ma'a gaanatu gaanfa. Mangu i'oos dey mangu gaanatu gaanfa. <verse eid="MAT 7:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 7:18"/>Ma'a i'oos mangu gaana gaananak wedey mangu i'oos ma'a gaana gaananak aafa chimanawuza. <verse eid="MAT 7:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 7:19"/>Ma'a gaana gaannoy i'oosikito zuuttera katera geyaassi ha'tona. <verse eid="MAT 7:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 7:20"/>Es bari boor'a esh raajjuni meyanon gaanbesiistaktu aruti.<verse eid="MAT 7:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 7:21"/>«Den samak fe abataasa fiqadinon zagife barteno taan: ‹Daamiiso! Daamiiso!› yife bar zuuttere Ha'oni taatoossi aafa giruna wuza. <verse eid="MAT 7:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 7:22"/>Mangsuni kar'ni wono showobesiis: ‹Daamiiso! Daamiiso! Ne sunaasik raaji aane makoweninoso? Ne sunaasik kiina ayyanaason aane kisuweninoso? Ne sunaasik showo biistera artonoy wuza aane zaguweninoso?› usone. <verse eid="MAT 7:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 7:23"/>Es kabaasik: ‹Ta nittotin aane arifat; nitto mangu meya tayistan wokti› una.<verse eid="MAT 7:23"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Kaa'ota Wedey Fuututa Keete Keya</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 6:47-49">Luqa. 6:47-49</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 7:24"/>«Ese han kaamnaason odere wostota feeshife bar zuuttambaase keebaason kaa'oni kaputta keer'a nibbare yere asune feerwa. <verse eid="MAT 7:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 7:25"/>Iroos ichi, omaraas dey wori. Sirus dey sirira es keyaason tugi. Sinuntano es keyaas kaa'ota kaputta keetera diir sinna boor'a aane gandowa. <verse eid="MAT 7:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 7:26"/>Han kaamnaason odere wostota feeshunoy bar zuuttere keebaason fuututa keer'a gowwa asune feerwa. <verse eid="MAT 7:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 7:27"/>Iroos ichi; omaraas dey ya. Sirus dey sirira es keyaason tugin geregere gande. Gandobaas dey akama mangu sini» yi. <verse eid="MAT 7:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 7:28"/>Yesus es wuzasikitonon makere koi'sinanneen orfo darani meya bar makena assusik diinqesete. <verse eid="MAT 7:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 7:29"/>Es darani meya diinqesetees Museni tumaasi assinynyanimato sinnoynamato isa ha'suni hugnaba feena asunimato assit feer sinna boor'awa.<verse eid="MAT 7:29"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 7"/>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="MAT 8"/>
  <para style="s1">Yesus Awataatoni Mettaniisin Fati</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 1:40-45">Mar. 1:40-45</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:2-16">Luqa. 5:2-16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 8:1"/>Yesus aamaastan kerefena kabaasik showo dara barneen ane hamete. <verse eid="MAT 8:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 8:2"/>Isa awataatoni mettan barki tai'sere: «Daamiiso! Taan shunfaatane fatuk chimatawa» yit sagade. <verse eid="MAT 8:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 8:3"/>Yesus kushubaason shongere ta'ifaat: «Shunfawungwa kayimma» yin geregere merobaassin fari. <verse eid="MAT 8:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 8:4"/>Estan Yesus: «Faruneeson ooknu makotaatawa. Sinuntano hamma teetneeson maagnik besuwa. Baassok zaala sinanak faruneeson besifa Muse ajajena maa'aason imma» yi.<verse eid="MAT 8:4"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesus Tii Meya Taar'oni Meeni Gaanynyaasa Wostinynyanin Fati</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 7:1-10">Luqa. 7:1-10</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 8:5"/>Yesus Kifirnahomni katamaassi kar'fena kabaasik isa tii meya taar'oni meeni gaanynya barki yeere ekka yit shiiphe. <verse eid="MAT 8:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 8:6"/>«Daamiiso! Wostinynyataas laafa sinne akamanon mettere keer kunferwa» yi. <verse eid="MAT 8:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 8:7"/>Yesus dey: «Ta yaara wostinynyaneesin fatunawa» yi. <verse eid="MAT 8:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 8:8"/>Tii meya taar'oni meeni gaanynyaas wolgire: «Daamiiso! Ne taaki keer girutak ta sholsu asutewa. Sinuntano isa kaamnin makefaatane wostinynyataas farunawa. <verse eid="MAT 8:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 8:9"/>Ta dey oom gaanynye meeni ha'suusi sikalositu ha'ifawungwa. Ta dey ta sikaloossi ha'sifana meya taar'oni meya feeseterwa. Isaasin ‹Ek hamma› iyaanane hamar. Oomiisin dey ‹yowa› iyaanane yeer. Wostinynyataasin dey: ‹Han baron zaguwa› iyaanane zagir» yi. <verse eid="MAT 8:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 8:10"/>Yesus es baron odenayse diinqere barneen ane feese baassok: «Futo nittok makefawungwa; Israelni meeni ganeyaassinnu effatena amantobare yere asunin aane danutwa. <verse eid="MAT 8:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 8:11"/>Nittok makefawungwa; showobesiis awkesannawa awgirunna yeesere Abrahamneen Isaqneen Yaqobneen isarik Ha'oosi taatoni maddita ane muusone. <verse eid="MAT 8:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 8:12"/>Sinuntano han Ha'oosi taatosi girsonek teegtere fe baasso ek gerakalo talmaassitu ha'tosone. Estak waasnewa ha'ni koyet foone baassok sinana» yi. <verse eid="MAT 8:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 8:13"/>Yesus tii meya taar'oni meeni gaanynyaasin: «Hamma, amantoneesimato neek sinfawungwa» yi. Wostinynyabaas dey es kabaasik fari.<verse eid="MAT 8:13"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesus Showo Mettanni Meyanon Fati</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 1:29-34">Mar. 1:29-34</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:38-41">Luqa. 4:38-41</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 8:14"/>Yesus Phexirosni keer girifena kabaasik Phexirosni asusi into gumtanni mero mettera kunfeen bi. <verse eid="MAT 8:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 8:15"/>Asusi kushunon ta'in meroos dey ma'i. Kabira dey barin irbasi. <verse eid="MAT 8:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 8:16"/>Waalfana kabaasik kiina ayyana ephna showo asuni meyanon Yesusniki ephphe yeeseten bar es kiina ayyanaason kaambaasik kisi. Dey mettaniisin zuuttire fati. <verse eid="MAT 8:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 8:17"/>Es baron zagubaasik raajju Isayyasni matsafaassi: «Bar hopiniison ephphe tee; meroniison dey innoostan kabgi» yire makena raajiis sini.<verse eid="MAT 8:17"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Aakkak Yesusneen Ane Hamanimato</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 8:18"/>Yesus showo asuni meya biratobaasta zuuttosobesiison biyaat baarisi yesalo finonek nawoni meyanon ajaje. <verse eid="MAT 8:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 8:19"/>Estan isa Museni tumaasi assinynya Yesusniki yeere: «Assinynyano, ne hamfata dima zuuttambaase asiissi neneen ane hamanawa» yi. <verse eid="MAT 8:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 8:20"/>Yesus wolgire: «Bowasikito ha'ifana dooi'ba faarwa. Samak fulifa kasaas diifana keeba faarwa. Sinuntano Asuni Naa teetbaasonnu teesuna dimba aafawa» yi. <verse eid="MAT 8:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 8:21"/>Nawobaasasin oomiis «Daamiiso, zeemma hamma abataas kititen kabbaronak ma'i uwa» yi. <verse eid="MAT 8:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 8:22"/>Yesus wolgire: «Taneen hamniwa, Kitubesiison kabbarsonek kituni meyak beywa» yi.<verse eid="MAT 8:22"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesus Akaasi Guubonon Ke'i</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 8:23"/>Estan Yesus goonuussi girin nawobaasakito dey barneen ane hamete. <verse eid="MAT 8:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 8:24"/>Baariistak akama akani guuboos kabira goonuuson koor'anak kar'i. Sinuntano es kabaasik Yesus kunfer. <verse eid="MAT 8:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 8:25"/>Nawoni meya Yesusniki yeesere: «Daamiiso tishunirwa, innotin fu'aywa» yiset nuskisete. <verse eid="MAT 8:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 8:26"/>Yesus dey: «Amantontiis yo'ina nitto awuni boor'a digefetiso?» yi. Estan kabire sirusewa baariise asin ke'in akama naga sini. <verse eid="MAT 8:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 8:27"/>Asuni meya diinqesere: «Sirusewa baariise ajajamena han bar aro asunso» yisete.<verse eid="MAT 8:27"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesus Kiina Ayyana Ephna Hep Asunin Fati</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 8:28"/>Baariison finne Gergesenon sinfa daasta kar'fena kabaasik kiina ayyana ephna hep asu moogaassin kesse Yesusneen uphesete. Es hep asuni meya akamanon mangu sinete boor'a asu es ugnaasik aata aane chimfe. <verse eid="MAT 8:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 8:29"/>Es hep asuni meya dey: «Ne Ha'oni naa Yesusno, inno neneen ane awuni isarni faarinso? Wonaas kar'noyfeen innotin rakkisutak yaatoso?» yit chaagete. <verse eid="MAT 8:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 8:30"/>Baassostan woksok akama showo mukoni wodo feesh dimta maadifar. <verse eid="MAT 8:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 8:31"/>Kiina ayyanaas dey: «Innotin kisutar sinfaanane ek mukoosi wodosi hamanik zaguwa» yit shiiphse. <verse eid="MAT 8:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 8:32"/>Yesus dey: «hamoti» yi. Kiina ayyanaasikito dey kessa hamma mukoosi wodosi girse. Estan mukoosi wodo zuuttera kumaastan yeet baariissi taptera eella akaassi girira kitise. <verse eid="MAT 8:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 8:33"/>Mukooson keemfe kezzoosakito dey katamaassi hamme kiina ayyana ephna asuni meeni chowaasonnawa sina wuzasonna maksete. <verse eid="MAT 8:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 8:34"/>Katamaassi fe asuni meya zuuttere Yesusnin biyonek kesete. Daabesiison gafkire hamanak shiiphsete.<verse eid="MAT 8:34"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 8"/>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="MAT 9"/>
  <para style="s1">Yesus Laafa Asusin Fati</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 2:1-12">Mar. 2:1-12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:17-26">Luqa. 5:17-26</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 9:1"/>Esseen orfo Yesus goonuussi diire baariison finne daabaastaki katamaassi hami. <verse eid="MAT 9:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 9:2"/>Estak asuni meya oppota kuni isa laafa asunin Yesusniki ephphe yeesete. Yesus amantobesiison biyaat: «Ne han naataaso! Harewa, boor'neesi feeshun unon danitwa» yi. <verse eid="MAT 9:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 9:3"/>Museni tumaasi assinynyaasasin isa isaas nibbesiissi «Han bar Ha'oosta mei'ni kaama makewa» yisete. <verse eid="MAT 9:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 9:4"/>Yesus dey baasso safaraason arifaat: «Awuni boor'a nibnitiissi effatena mangu wuza safarefetiso? <verse eid="MAT 9:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 9:5"/>Boor'nees feeshun usingwa wedey kabira hamma uusinso kashoyi? <verse eid="MAT 9:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 9:6"/>Sinuntano Asuni Naa han daastak boor'aason feeshun uni ha'suni hugnaba faanamato arutikwa» iyaat laafa asusin: «Kabira opponeeson wor'a keene hamma» yi. <verse eid="MAT 9:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 9:7"/>Asus dey kabire keeba hami. <verse eid="MAT 9:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 9:8"/>Daraas dey es baron biyaat diinqesete. Han effatena ha'suni hugnaason asunik ima Ha'ooson dey galattesete.<verse eid="MAT 9:8"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesus Maatiwos Ystefe Lewinin Teege</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 2:13-17">Mat. 2:13-17</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:27-32">Luqa. 5:27-32</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 9:9"/>Yesus es dimaastan kabire hamfeen Maatiwos yiste isa asu girbo zuuttefana dimaasta diifen biyaat: «Taneen ane hamniwa» yi. Bar dey kabire barneen ane hami.<verse eid="MAT 9:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 9:10"/>Yesus Maatiwosni keer muu muunak tai'sere feen showo girbo zuutife baassotnawa boor'ni meena esta yeesere Yesusneen nawobaasakitoneen ane isarik maddita muuk tai'sete. <verse eid="MAT 9:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 9:11"/>Ferisawini meya es baron biyefaat nawobaasakitonin: «Assinynyantiis awuni boor'a girbo zuutife baassoneen boor'ni meya neen ane muu meediferinso?» yisete. <verse eid="MAT 9:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 9:12"/>Yesus es maksete baron odefaat: «Hetni asu sholsifenaas mettanni meyaktano fayyani meyaktawa. <verse eid="MAT 9:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 9:13"/>Hamfaat: ‹Ta sholefanaas fakiyaasontano maa'aasontawa› yistera tichche bar awu sinnamato feretira gasasutiwa. Ta yaanaas ookoni meyak sinnoynaron boor'ni meya harmiya zagsonek teegokwa» yi.<verse eid="MAT 9:13"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Soomere Shiiphoni Chowaasik Mamuste Mamsu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 2:18-22">Mar. 2:18-22</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:33-39">Luqa. 5:33-39</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 9:14"/>Es kabaasik Yohannisni nawoosakito Yesusniki yeesere: «Innotnawa Ferisawini meena showo wona soomera shiiphenirwa. Sinuntano ne nawoosakito soomere shiipho beyefees awuni boor'anso?» yisete. <verse eid="MAT 9:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 9:15"/>Yesus baassok ekka yire wolgi: «Mariis baassoneen ane feen mozgituni meya suumok chimoneroso? Sinuntano mariis baassostan oor kesse hamana wona yoonawa. Es kabaasiktu soomere shiiphsonewa» <verse eid="MAT 9:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 9:16"/>Kur'u maamaata gaddo erbe kunsire zoorife asu oonu aafewa. Ekka zagaanane gaddo erbees kur'u maamaason kongsirwa. Karatobaas dey tagir. <verse eid="MAT 9:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 9:17"/>Esiisimato kur'u ha'matoossi gaddo wayinini usha gedfe asu oonu aafewa; Sinuntano ekka zagaanane ha'matoos karatera wayiniisi usha dey wuukterwa. Ha'matoos dey ke'nor sinar. Es bari boor'a gaddo wayinini ushaason gaddo ha'matosi geda sholsuwa. Hepobaase dey ma'arik duuna.<verse eid="MAT 9:17"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Iyyarosni Nawaasewa Yesusni Maamaason Ta'i Asuse</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 9:18"/>Yesus es baron makefeen isa gaanynya barki yeere sinba kaa'nere: «Naanaas kitiwa, yaara kushuneesik ta'ifaatane farunawa» yi. <verse eid="MAT 9:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 9:19"/>Yesus dey kabire asusneen ane hami. Nawobaasakito dey ane hamete.<verse eid="MAT 9:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 9:20"/>Estak asire heppe wogga harinba wuuktet faana isa mashkasu Yesusni orfo kamo yaara maambaason ta'i. <verse eid="MAT 9:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 9:21"/>Bar dey nibbaassi: «Maambaasi fashanonnu ta'ifaanane farunawa» yit faar. <verse eid="MAT 9:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 9:22"/>Yesus yerqere barki biyaat: «Harewe naanaase! Amantonees neen fatiwe» yi. Asus dey es kabaasik fari. <verse eid="MAT 9:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 9:23"/>Yesus gaanynyaasa keer kar'fena kabaasik waasit, markata fugetnawa sasetna yere darani bi. <verse eid="MAT 9:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 9:24"/>Yesus dey: «Nawaas afay'nintu kunitano aane kituwa; Hantan shaatotiwa» yin barin kanyere mi'esete. <verse eid="MAT 9:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 9:25"/>Daraasin kisinanneen orfo keer girire nawaasi kushunon zatin daakun kabi. <verse eid="MAT 9:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 9:26"/>Es chowaasi wolla es daa zuuttambaase asiissi zi'i.<verse eid="MAT 9:26"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesus Hep Aaftishuni Meyanonnawa Nibtaatoninna Fati</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 9:27"/>Yesus es dimaastan kabire hamfeen hep aaftishuni meya: «Dawitni naaso! Innotin fakifaywa» yit chaaget basa orfoose hamete. <verse eid="MAT 9:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 9:28"/>Aaftishusakito Yesus girina keyaassi girsete. Bar: «Ta aafnitiison gachak chimanamato amanefetiyoso?» yire mamsi. Baasso dey: «Aa, amanefeniwa, Daamiiso!» yit wolgisete. <verse eid="MAT 9:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 9:29"/>Estan Yesus kushubaasik baasso aafaason ta'ifaat: «Amantontiisimato nittok sinfawungwa» yi. <verse eid="MAT 9:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 9:30"/>Aaffesiis dey gachche. Yesus dey: «Han wuzason ooniknu makotiita» yit chinire ajaje. <verse eid="MAT 9:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 9:31"/>Sinuntano baasso estan kesere es daa zuuttambaase asiista basa chowaason maksete. <verse eid="MAT 9:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 9:32"/>Es aaffesiis gachchena baasso kesse hamefe kabaasik kiina ayyana ephna isa nibtaato asunin ephphe Yesusniki teshshesete. <verse eid="MAT 9:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 9:33"/>Kiina ayyanaas asusasin kesnanneen orfo nibtaatoos dey wolle. Daraas dey: «Effatena wuza Israelni daastak isanne aane biistera artowawa» yiset diinqesete. <verse eid="MAT 9:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 9:34"/>Sinuntano Ferisawini meya: «Kiina ayyanaason asusasin kisifenaas kiina ayyanaasi gaanynyanikwa» yisete.<verse eid="MAT 9:34"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesus Daraasik Kenashte</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 9:35"/>Yesus Ayhudni shiiphoni keyaassi assit Ha'oosi taatoni misirachchuni kaamanon maket daraasasi fa merosonnawa rakkobesiisonna zuutire fatit katamaassinawa ke'e zuuttambaase asiissina kutit feer. <verse eid="MAT 9:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 9:36"/>Daraas kezzoba foonto fantunimato rakkatesefeennawa tiir'o baassotin ephaan feesetenna biyaat baassok kenashte. <verse eid="MAT 9:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 9:37"/>Estan nawobaasakitonik: «Foshaas akamawa; sinuntano wostinynyaas garowa. <verse eid="MAT 9:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 9:38"/>Ese foshaasi Daam foshaasta wostoni wostinynyanin wosunak shiiphotiwa» yi.<verse eid="MAT 9:38"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 9"/>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="MAT 10"/>
  <para style="s1">Asire heppe wosini meeni wostere hama</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 3:13-19">Mar. 3:13-19</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 6:12-16">Luqa. 6:12-16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 10:1"/>Yesus asire heppe nawobaasakitonin teegere kiina ayyanaason asusasin kissonek; merosonnawa rakkoosonna fatusonek ha'suni hugna baassok imi. <verse eid="MAT 10:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 10:2"/>Asire heppe wosini meeni sunaas haniiswa: Phexiros yistefe Simonnawa ayba Indiriyasna, Zebdewosni naanggot Yaqobnawa ayba Yohannisna, <verse eid="MAT 10:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 10:3"/>Filiphoos, Bertelemewos, Tomas, girbo zuutife Matewos, Ilfiyosni naa Yaqob, Tadewos, <verse eid="MAT 10:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 10:4"/>Koonefe<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10:4 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Simoonnik han dayto sunaas imtenaas isa isa matsafaason kotfe meya: «Yerena amantobaasik koone asuwa» yiseter. Oomni meya dey «Birmadumma kisuk kabsefe asuni meyaassin isaaswa» yiseter.</char></note> Simon, Yesusnin aatire ima Askorotki Yuuda.<verse eid="MAT 10:4"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Asire Heppe Wosini Meeni Assuk Wostere Hama</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 6:7-13">Mar. 6:7-13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:1-6">Luqa. 9:1-6</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 10:5"/>Yesus es asire heppe wosini meyanon ekka yit wosi: «Aazabni meyaki hamatiita. Dey Samirawini meeni katamaassi girutiita. <verse eid="MAT 10:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 10:6"/>Sinuntano fantunimato tishire fe Israelni daraaski hamti. <verse eid="MAT 10:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 10:7"/>Hamfaat: ‹Samaki taatoos tai'sewa› yira makotiwa. <verse eid="MAT 10:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 10:8"/>Mettanni meyanon fatuti. Kitiisin kitun kabguti. Awataatoni mettaniisin fatuti. Kiina ayyanaason asusasin kisuti. Baak ephti baron baak imti. <verse eid="MAT 10:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 10:9"/>Warqekin wedey birrikin wedey naasikin wosuste waaga tach'amantiista koor'ira ephatiita. <verse eid="MAT 10:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 10:10"/>Wostinynyanik muuba sholsu sinna boor'a ugunnitiisik ha'mato wedey hep gaagtera mayte maama wedey chaa'ma wedey haaro ephatiita. <verse eid="MAT 10:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 10:11"/>Isa katamasi wedey ke'esi girifeti kabaasik nittotin ephniis oo sinnamato gasasuti. Es daason gafkira kesatinneen esta footi. <verse eid="MAT 10:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 10:12"/>Asuni keer girifeti kabaasik naga ooshshosoti. <verse eid="MAT 10:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 10:13"/>Nitto nagaason ephpheteesefaatene nagantiis baassok kar'ana. Sinuntano ephphetoo beyfaatene nagantiis nittok woluna. <verse eid="MAT 10:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 10:14"/>Nitto maketi kaamaason ephphetoo wedey odo beyefaatene es keyaassin wedey es katamaassin kesfeti kabaasik wochontiisi tulonon esta tebuti. <verse eid="MAT 10:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 10:15"/>Ta nittok futok makefawungwa, mangsuni kar'ni wonoti ke'oos es katamaastan Sedomiknawa Gamoraknatu kasho sinana.<verse eid="MAT 10:15"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Shanaas Yoonamato Make</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 13:3-13">Mar. 13:3-13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:12-17">Luqa. 21:12-17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 10:16"/>«Ese! Ta nittotin fantunimato iririkaasi ganesi wosuna. Es bari boor'a nitto zawunimato nibnitire yerer; nakalonimato garam sinti. <verse eid="MAT 10:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 10:17"/>Asuni meya nittotin mangsuni kar'ak shonggosta aatire imone. Ayhudni shiiphoni keyaassik dey nittotin ichosone. Es bari boor'a asusatan teetnitiison oodtiwa. <verse eid="MAT 10:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 10:18"/>Ta chowaasik daa ha'sife baassokinawa taate meyakina oottera hamatir sinna boor'a baasso sinaknawa Aazabni meeni sinakna ta zaal sinati. <verse eid="MAT 10:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 10:19"/>Asuni meya nittotin shongoosta aatire imefe kabaasik baassok makoti bar es sa'atiistak imtona sinna boor'a: ‹Aakka wedey awu makonittaaso?› yife safara nittotin ephanaatawa. <verse eid="MAT 10:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 10:20"/>Nittoossi faara makoniis samaki Abantiisa Ayyanatano nittotewa. <verse eid="MAT 10:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 10:21"/>Ayiis aybaasin, Abaas naabaasin kituk aatire imana. Naanggotaas dey ababaasatanawa intobaastana guma sinna kabira kituk aatira imana. <verse eid="MAT 10:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 10:22"/>Ta boor'a asu zuuttambaase nittotin oomtona. Sinuntano koi'ba kar'ananneen chimme yere bar faruna. <verse eid="MAT 10:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 10:23"/>Isa katamaassi shana nittoosta arkissisefe kabaasik ooma katamasi shaatoti. Ta futo nittok makefawungwa; Asuni Naa yoonanneen Israelni daa zuuttambaase asiissi aafawa kar'a koi'suti wuza. <verse eid="MAT 10:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 10:24"/>Arinynyaas assife basaastan, wostinynyaas daambaasatan aafa denalo sinanawuza. <verse eid="MAT 10:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 10:25"/>Arinynyaas assinynybaasamato; Wostinynyaas dey daambaasamato sinfaanane hooronawa. Keeni Abaasin: ‹Beelzebulwa› yisetenneen keerki asuni meyanon aakkak mangu suna sunsu beyonerinso?<verse eid="MAT 10:25"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Oonin Digo Sholsinamato</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 12:4-7">Luqa. 12:4-7</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 10:26"/>«Ese asuni meyanon digotiita; Geepto wuzaas ammanon kessa aafa besto beyana wuza. Aacho wuzaas ammanon kesa aafa beyana wuza. <verse eid="MAT 10:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 10:27"/>Ta talmaassi nittok makena baron chaarefaasta makoti. Saaksok odeti baron tega dimaasta yerefaat awasuti. <verse eid="MAT 10:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 10:28"/>Ashaason woraat kesse kaason woruk chimnoy asuni meyanon digotiita. Sinuntano ashaasewa kaase woraat kessa geeni tir'maassi tishkuk chimni Ha'ooson digoti. <verse eid="MAT 10:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 10:29"/>Hep mejmariis uuch duudesi waagtertanoso? Es kasaasikitosin isarnu abantiisa fiqadi sinnoyfeen daasta kere wor'a aafa tishuna wuza. <verse eid="MAT 10:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 10:30"/>Nitto somaasi fashanu zuuttambaase faadtowa. <verse eid="MAT 10:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 10:31"/>Ese nitto showo meejmaristan denalo sinti boor'a digotiitawa.<verse eid="MAT 10:31"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Kiristoosni Chowaasik Zaala Mako Sholsu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 12:8-9">Luqa. 12:8-9</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 10:32"/>«Ta chowaason asuni sinak zaala makefe bar zuuttambaase asik den samak fe Abataasa sinak ta dey barik zaala makona. <verse eid="MAT 10:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 10:33"/>Asuni sinak taan mormefe barin zuutira ta dey den samak fe Abataasa sinak mormona. <verse eid="MAT 10:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 10:34"/>Ta yaanay han daasta naga ephpha yaanar zagira safarotiitawa. Ta faassotano naga ephpha yoonak aane yootwa. <verse eid="MAT 10:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 10:35"/>Ta yaanay arqa naasin ababaasata; mashka nawaason intobaasta; naasa asunon naasa intota guma sinne kabsonektu yaangwa. <verse eid="MAT 10:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 10:36"/>Es bari boor'a asunik gumabaas keebaassi fe asustu sinnirwa. <verse eid="MAT 10:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 10:37"/>Tayistan denalo ababaasin wedey intobaason shunfe bar taar sinanak aane sholsifawa. Tayistan denalo arqa naabaasin wedey mashka nawubaason shunfe bar taar sinanak aane sholsifawa. <verse eid="MAT 10:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 10:38"/>Basa teetni mesqeliison wor'e taneen ane yoonoy bar taar sinanak aane sholsifawa. <verse eid="MAT 10:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 10:39"/>Kaabaason fu'ok sholefe bar zuuttambaase tishkuna. Ta sunaasik kaabaason tishkife bar zuuttambaase fu'ona. <verse eid="MAT 10:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 10:40"/>Nittotin ephphe tee bar taan dey ephphetoona. Taan ephphete bar taan wosi Abaasin dey ephphetoona. <verse eid="MAT 10:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 10:41"/>Raajjuusin raajjuni meeni sunak ephphete bar raajjuni meeni waagaason danana. Ookoosin ookoni meeni sunak ephphete bar ookoni meeni waagaason danana. <verse eid="MAT 10:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 10:42"/>Futo nittok makefawungwa; ta nawo sinna boor'a han garo garoosasin isaasik koocho aka kubbayyak ima bar waagbaas aafa tishuna wuza.»<verse eid="MAT 10:42"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 10"/>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="MAT 11"/>
  <para style="s1">Haphquni Yohannisnikin Yesusniki Wostere Hama Asuni Meya</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 7:18-35">Luqa. 7:18-35</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 11:1"/>Yesus asire heppe nawobaasakitonik es ajajiison makere ko'sinayse estan kesse tai'soosta fa katamaasikitosi assuknawa makokna hami. <verse eid="MAT 11:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 11:2"/>Haphqife Yohannis taatoni keer feegedo Kiristoosni wostooson odere nawobaasasin barki wosire: <verse eid="MAT 11:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 11:3"/>«Es yoonir yiste Kiristoos nengwa wedey oomnin oodanirinso?» yi. <verse eid="MAT 11:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 11:4"/>Yesus dey wolgire: «Hamfaat biiti baronnawa odeti baronna zuutira Yohannisnik makoti. <verse eid="MAT 11:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 11:5"/>Aaftishuni meya biyosoner. Engitni meya kutusoner. Awataatoni mettanni meya farsoner. Odo oyoni meya odosoner. Kituni meya kitun kabsoner. Tukamni meyak misirachchuni kaamaas maktonir. <verse eid="MAT 11:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 11:6"/>Ta chowaasik tuusa'onoy bar zuuttere suustowa» yi.<verse eid="MAT 11:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 11:7"/>Yohannisni wosiisakito wolle hamobesiise Yesus daraasik Yohannisni chowaasik ekka yit mako ephi: «Awu biyatikinso ichma daassi kesetiri? Sirus shorkifana sobboqoosonnoso? <verse eid="MAT 11:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 11:8"/>Wedey awu biyatikinso kesetiri? Gada maya maye asuninnoso? Esenu gada maya maye baasso taate meeni keertu feesetewa. <verse eid="MAT 11:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 11:9"/>Wedey awu biyatikinso kesetiri? Raajjuninnoso? Nittok makefawungwa; raajjusatan denalo sina baringwa. <verse eid="MAT 11:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 11:10"/>‹Ese ugunneeson sabsuni wositaasin ne sinaasta zeemma wosunawa› yistera tichchenaas barikwa. <verse eid="MAT 11:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 11:11"/>Futo nittok makefawugwa; mashkasukin koonte asuni meeni ganeyaassin haphqife Yohannisniistan denalo aane kabuwewa. Sinuntano samaki taatoossi ater sina bar Yohannisniistan arkuna. <verse eid="MAT 11:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 11:12"/>Haphquni Yohannisni neyaastan kabira hash hawung kar'ananneen samaki taatoos akamanon tugtettu fa. Sir giruk kabefe baasso danone.<verse eid="MAT 11:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 11:13"/>«Raajjuni meeni assusewa Museni tumaase haphqife Yohannisni neyaasta kar'ananneen raaji make. <verse eid="MAT 11:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 11:14"/>Ese dey ephphetook sholefaatine yoonir yiste Eeliyas han Yohanniswa. <verse eid="MAT 11:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 11:15"/>Odoni odoba feena bar odowowa.<verse eid="MAT 11:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 11:16"/>«Eekin han wonni koontooson awuneen hoossunarinso? Gabata diisefaat zomobaason teegsefaafa; <verse eid="MAT 11:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 11:17"/>‹Ululle nittok fugni, aane suruweti. Sooso soosoni aane waasuweti› yisefa naanggotaasne feeseter. <verse eid="MAT 11:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 11:18"/>Yohannis muunoynawa wayinini usha ushnoyna yeen: ‹Kiina ayyana basaassi faarwa› yisete. <verse eid="MAT 11:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 11:19"/>Asuni Naa meetnawa wayinini usha ushetna yeen: ‹Muunewa wayinini usha shunar dey girbo zuutife baassonawa boor'ni meena asi koonwa› yisete. Sinfanaknu matsafaas futo sina wostobaasik artewa.»<verse eid="MAT 11:19"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Amano Beyobesiisik Wee'te Katamaasikito</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 10:13-15">Luqa. 10:13-15</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 11:20"/>Estan Yesus arkiron biistera artonoy wuza zagtena katamaasikitoni harmu beyaasik ekka yit wee'o ephi. <verse eid="MAT 11:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 11:21"/>«Haybunewe Korazin, Haybunewe Betesayida! Nittoossi zagte biistera artonoy wuzaas Tirosuknawa Sidonakna zagte sinfaanane suumoni maya mayere bedna teetbesiista wochire showo wona zeemme harmusone kabawe. <verse eid="MAT 11:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 11:22"/>Ese nittok makefawungwe, mangsuni kar'ni wono ke'oos nittoostan Tirosuknawa Sidonaknatu kasho sinanawe. <verse eid="MAT 11:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 11:23"/>Kifirnahomne den sama tegitose? Yeet ke'oni dimaassitu kerotarwe. Neyissi zagte biistera artonoy wuzaas Sodomuk zagte sinfaanane bar tishunoy hash hawungneen kar'a foona kabawe. <verse eid="MAT 11:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 11:24"/>Ese neek makefawungwe; mangsuni kar'ni wono neyista kar'ni ke'oostan Sodomiktu kashonawe» yi.<verse eid="MAT 11:24"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Kiristoos Imfena Beysa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 10:21-22">Luqa. 10:21-22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 11:25"/>Es kabaasik Yesus ekka yi: «Samaasewa daase asi Daam Abataaso! Han baron techumni meyakinnawa aruni meyakinna aachaat han garo garo naanggotaasik ammanon kisira besita barik neen galattefawungwa. <verse eid="MAT 11:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 11:26"/>Aa, Abataaso han baron zagutak ne ma'a safara siniwa. <verse eid="MAT 11:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 11:27"/>Abataas zuuttambaase asin taak imiwa. Abaasneen oom naasin arifer oonu aafewa. Esiisimato dey Naasneen oom Abaasin arifer oonu aafewa. Naas ammanon kisire besu shakaanane Abaasin oonu aruk aafa chimanawuza.<verse eid="MAT 11:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 11:28"/>«Nitto ba'anti fayna hopiis zuuttera taaki yootiwa. Ta nittok beysa imana. <verse eid="MAT 11:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 11:29"/>Waanjonaason wor'ti; taakin dey arutiwa. Ta garam dey kenashterwa. Kaantiisik dey beysa danati. <verse eid="MAT 11:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 11:30"/>Waanjoos kulnor, ba'anaas dey kashowa.»<verse eid="MAT 11:30"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 11"/>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="MAT 12"/>
  <para style="s1">Beysani Wonni Chowaasik Mamuste Mamsu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 2:23-28">Mar. 2:23-28</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 6:1-5">Luqa. 6:1-5</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 12:1"/>Es kabaasik Yesus beysani wonaasik zagoni foshaasi ganesi kamo aatte hami. Nawobaasakito maktesete boor'a bona zagooson mo'e koya ephete. <verse eid="MAT 12:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 12:2"/>Ferisawini meya es baron biyefaat: «Ne nawoosakito beysani wonaasik zagtonak kalto wuzason zagsedifewa» yisete. <verse eid="MAT 12:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 12:3"/>Yesus dey baassok ekka yi: «Dawitnawa barneen ane fe asuni meena maktesefe kabaasik Dawit awu zaginamato aane feretuwetinoso? <verse eid="MAT 12:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 12:4"/>Ha'oosi keer girire maagni meyaktano barik sinun barneen fe asuni meyak kalto korto daabbooson<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12:4 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Betemeqdesiissi torban torban katta shoo'a imtefana tarabbezaasta kunfa korto daabbo.</char></note> mewa. <verse eid="MAT 12:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 12:5"/>Wedey maagni meya beysani wonaason ooda beyye betemeqdesi wosto wostesefaatene boor'a sinna aane faadtefa sinnamato Museni tumaassin aane feretuwetinoso? <verse eid="MAT 12:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 12:6"/>Sinuntano ta nittok makefawungwa, betemeqdesiistan denalo sina bar hanta feerwa. <verse eid="MAT 12:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 12:7"/>‹Fakiyaasontu sholefantano Maa'aasontawa› yifa matsafaasi kaama awu sinnamato yaadateti sinfaanane boor'besi foonto baassosta mangsu kar'ati kabatawa. <verse eid="MAT 12:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 12:8"/>Ese Asuni Naa beysani wonaasiknu daamwa.»<verse eid="MAT 12:8"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesus Kushuba Laafa Asusin Fati</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 12:9"/>Yesus estan kesse hamme Ayhudni shiiphoni keyaassi giri. <verse eid="MAT 12:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 12:10"/>Estak isa kushuba laafa asu feer. Yesusnin malatok sholet feese isa isa asuni meya: «Beysani wonaasik mettannin fatu faqqadtongwa aanenso?» yit mamussete. <verse eid="MAT 12:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 12:11"/>Yesus baassok wolgire: «Nitto ganeyaassin fantuba faana isa asu beysani wonaasik gawusi gandefaanane kisunor oonso?» yi. <verse eid="MAT 12:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 12:12"/>«Ese asu fantuustan denalo aakkak sina beynirinso? Es bari boor'a beysani wonaasik ma'a wuza zagu aane kaltowawa» yi. <verse eid="MAT 12:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 12:13"/>Esseen orfo kushuba laafa asusin: «Kushuneeson zeephwa» yin zeephi. Isa kushusimato dey ma'a kushu sini. <verse eid="MAT 12:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 12:14"/>Sinuntano Ferisawini meya estan kesere Yesusnin aakkak worsonemato merkesete.<verse eid="MAT 12:14"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ha'o Korina Wostinynya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 12:15"/>Sinuntano Yesus baasso mangu safaraason araat estan shaate. Showo asuni meya dey barneen ane hamete. Mettanni meyanon dey zuutire fati. <verse eid="MAT 12:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 12:16"/>Bar oo sinnamato kisire maksonoytemato ajaje. <verse eid="MAT 12:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 12:17"/>Es bar dey sinnaas raajju Isayyasni matsafaassi tichchera kuni bar sinanakwa.<verse eid="MAT 12:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 12:18"/>Ese ta korina wostinynyataas han barwa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 12:18">barin ta shunnar dey bariktu girefan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 12:18">Ayyananaason basaasta zaguna;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 12:18">bar futoni mangsuni kar'aason daraasik awasuna.<verse eid="MAT 12:18"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 12:19"/>Bar aafa karakkarona wuza;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 12:19">dey aafa chaagana wuza;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 12:19">kaambaas gero kessa aafa odona wuza.<verse eid="MAT 12:19"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 12:20"/>Mestera eesto sobboqoosonnu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 12:20">aafa kiir'ana wuza;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 12:20">chuwet di kar'aason aafa tishkunawuza;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 12:20">es baron zagunaas;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 12:20">futoni mangsuni kar'aason meronanneengwa.<verse eid="MAT 12:20"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 12:21"/>Aazabni meya basa sunaasiktu abdi zagsone.<verse eid="MAT 12:21"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesusnawa Beelzebulna</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 3:20-30">Mar. 3:20-30</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 11:14-23">Luqa. 11:14-23</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 12:22"/>Esseen orfo asuni meya kiina ayyana ephna aaftishu nibba taato asunin ephphe yeesete. Yesus dey fatin asus biyaknawa wollokna chimi. <verse eid="MAT 12:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 12:23"/>Daraas zuuttere diinqesere: «Han asus Dawitni naateeso?» yisete.<verse eid="MAT 12:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 12:24"/>Sinuntano Ferisawini meya odesere: «Han bar Beelzebul yistefa kiina ayyanaasi gaanynyanik sina shakaanane kiina ayyanaason aafa kisuna wuza» yisete.<verse eid="MAT 12:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 12:25"/>Sinuntano Yesus baasso safaraason arifaat ekka yi: «Bare bare oor oor keset fa taatoos zuuttera tishutu tishunawa. Esiisimato dey bare bare oor oor keset fa katamaas wedey keyaas aafa chimma yerona wuza. <verse eid="MAT 12:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 12:26"/>Sexanaas sexanaason kisir sinfaanane bare bare oor oor kesiwa uwa. Ese bari taatoos aakkak chimma yeronirinso? <verse eid="MAT 12:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 12:27"/>Ese ta Beelzebulnik kiina ayyanaason kisaanane nitto zoonsifeti baasso awuk kissonerinso? Ese nitto zoonsifeti baassonu nittoosta mangsu kar'eterwa. <verse eid="MAT 12:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 12:28"/>Sinuntano ta kiina ayyanaason kisifanaas Ha'oosi Ayyanak sinnanneen Ha'oosi taato nittoki yaara kar'iwa uwa. <verse eid="MAT 12:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 12:29"/>Dey isa asu zeemme hugnaba feena barin taar'noy basa keer girire waagbaason bo'ok aakkak chimnirinso? Hugnaba feena barin taar'attu keyaassi fayiison bo'ok chimanawa. <verse eid="MAT 12:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 12:30"/>Taneen ane sinnoy bar taan tugga'er; dey taneen ane zuutunoy bar siker. <verse eid="MAT 12:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 12:31"/>Es bari boor'a ta nittok makefawungwa; asu wostefena boor'aasewa me'aase zuuttera feeshun ustona. Sinuntano Ha'oosi Korto Ayyananon me'a bar boor'baas aafa feeshun ustona wuza. <verse eid="MAT 12:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 12:32"/>Asuni Naanita mei'ni kaama maksefe bar boor'baas feeshun ustona. Sinuntano Korto Ayyanaasta mei'ni kaama makefe bar han daastak sinun yooni daasta boor'baas aafa feeshun ustona wuza.<verse eid="MAT 12:32"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ma'a I'oos Gaanbaastaktu Artefa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 6:43-45">Luqa. 6:43-45</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 12:33"/>«I'oos zuuttera gaanbaastaktu artefa sinna boor'a ma'a i'onti faafaanane ma'a gaana danati. I'oos mangu sinfaanane gaanbaas dey mangu sinana. <verse eid="MAT 12:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 12:34"/>Nitto ufoni naanggota mangu sinfaat aakkak ma'a wuza wollok chimtiso? Asu nibbaassi tuumma fu'te barontu noonobaasik wollefewa.<verse eid="MAT 12:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 12:35"/>«Ma'a asu nibbaassi zuutina ma'a mazgabiistan ma'a wuza kisifewa. Mangu asu dey nibbaassi zuutina mangu mazgabiistan mangu wuza kisifewa <verse eid="MAT 12:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 12:36"/>Futo nittok makefawungwa; asuni meya wolumsefe sinnoy mangu wolla zuuttambaase asik mangsuni kar'ni wono wolguba imonerwa. <verse eid="MAT 12:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 12:37"/>Wollefata kaamneesik neek mangsu katona. Dey wollefata kaamaasik neyista mangsu katona.»<verse eid="MAT 12:37"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Biistera Artonoy Wuza Biyak Mamuste Mamsu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 8:11-12">Mar. 8:11-12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 11:29-32">Luqa. 11:29-32</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 12:38"/>Es kabaasik isa isa Ferisawini meenawa Museni tumaasi assinynyana Yesusnin: «Ne biistera artonoy wuza zagin biyanik sholefeniwa» yisete. <verse eid="MAT 12:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 12:39"/>Sinuntano bar wolgire: «Mangu koontoosewa amanonoy koontoose biistera artonoy wuza sholer. Sinuntano raajju Yonasni biistera artonoy wuzasneen ooma biistera artonoy wuza aafa imtona wuza. <verse eid="MAT 12:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 12:40"/>Yonas inya kurxummiisi katasi keez wonnewa waalne kunnamato Asuni Naa dey moogaassi keez wonnewa waalne kunana. <verse eid="MAT 12:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 12:41"/>Neneweni katamaasik asuni meya Yonasni awasuuson odesere boor'besiisik gaabbesere harmisete boor'a mangsuni kar'ni wono han neeni koontoosneen ane kabsere baassosta mangsu kar'osone. Ese hash Yonasniistan denalo hanta feerwa. <verse eid="MAT 12:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 12:42"/>Yeeshdaaki mashka taatoos Solomonni techmaason odok daani dilan kabira yaana boor'a mangsuni kar'ni wono han neeni koontoosneen ane kabira baassosta mangsu kar'ana. Ese hash Solomonniistan denalo hanta feerwa» yi.<verse eid="MAT 12:42"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Kiina Ayyanaasi Asunisi Wolle Giru</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 12:43"/>Dey Yesus ekka yi: «Kiina ayyana asunisin kesfana kabaasik beysa sholet akaba foonto dimaassitu kutifa. Sinuntano sholena beysaason aafa danana wuza. <verse eid="MAT 12:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 12:44"/>Estan ‹Zeemoti kesna keyaassi wolla hamanawa› yifa. Wolla yeen es keyaas fa wuzba foonto sinna futtera kayimma diifen danfa. <verse eid="MAT 12:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 12:45"/>Estan dey hamma baristan denalo mangu naafun kiina ayyana ephpha yaara girira barneen ane esta faafa. Es asusik zeemoti foobaastan orfoti foobaas akamanon mangu sinfa. Esiisimato han mangu koontoosta sinniis esiisne faarwa.»<verse eid="MAT 12:45"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesusni Intoosewa Aybaasakitona</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 3:31-35">Mar. 3:31-35</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:19-21">Luqa. 8:19-21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 12:46"/>Yesus daraasik makefeen intobaasewa aybaasakitona barneen uphere wollok sholsefaat gerakalo yersefeer. <verse eid="MAT 12:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MAT 12:47"/>Esta feese asuni meyaassin isaas Yesusnin: «Intoneesewa ayneesakitona neen uphsonek sholefaat gero yerseferwa» yi.<verse eid="MAT 12:47"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="MAT 12:48"/>Yesus dey es make asusik wolgire: «Intonaas oonso? Aytaasakito dey oonotnaysinso?» yi. <verse eid="MAT 12:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MAT 12:49"/>Kushubaason nawobaasakitoniki besaat: «Ese intonaasewa aytaasakitona haniiswa: <verse eid="MAT 12:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="MAT 12:50"/>Den samaki Abataasa safaranon zagsefe baasso zuuttere ayta, eetna dey intonawa» yi.<verse eid="MAT 12:50"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 12"/>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="MAT 13"/>
  <para style="s1">Bukinynyaasa Beso</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 4:1-9">Mar. 4:1-9</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:4-8">Luqa. 8:4-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 13:1"/>Yesus es wono keerun kesse baarisi tesha di. <verse eid="MAT 13:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 13:2"/>Showo dara basa tesha zuuttena boor'a bar goonuusta kese di. Daraas dey zuuttere baarisi tesha yersefeer. <verse eid="MAT 13:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 13:3"/>Estan showo wuza besok baassok mako ephi: «Isa bulinynya zala bukanak kesi. <verse eid="MAT 13:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 13:4"/>Bukfena kabaasik isa isa zalaas ugnaasta kere wor'i. Kasaasikito dey yaara kephpha ma. <verse eid="MAT 13:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 13:5"/>Oomaas akama hoi'ba foonto kaa'oosta kere wor'i. Akama ho'a aafa sinna boor'a geregere kayi. Esiis dey zalaas ho'aassi sikalera aane giruwa. <verse eid="MAT 13:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 13:6"/>Sinuntano awa kesfana kabaasik aliqi. Tasba tishina boor'a dey ichimi. <verse eid="MAT 13:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 13:7"/>Ooma zalaas dey seer'aasi ganesi kere wor'i. Seer'aas kayira geer'a fu'e. <verse eid="MAT 13:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 13:8"/>Ooma zalaas ma'a daasta kere wor'i. Isaas tiyanon, isaas issunasiron, isaas keezasiron gaani. <verse eid="MAT 13:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 13:9"/>Odoni odoba feena bar odowowa.»<verse eid="MAT 13:9"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesus Awuni Boor'a Besok Makenamato</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 4:10-12">Mar. 4:10-12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:9-10">Luqa. 8:9-10</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 13:10"/>Estan nawobaasakito barki tai'sere: «Awuni boor'a daraasik besok makefasso?» yisete. <verse eid="MAT 13:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 13:11"/>Bar dey wolgire: «Nittok den samaki Ha'oosi aacho chowanon arutik imtewa. Sinuntano baassok aane imtowawa. <verse eid="MAT 13:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 13:12"/>Feena barik fayista dayistera imtona dey arkuna. Sinuntano garo kiisku feena barkin es barik fa barnu basaastan ootterwa. <verse eid="MAT 13:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 13:13"/>Baasso biyefet biyonorne feeseter. Odefet odonorne feeseter dey yaadatonorne feeseter sinete boor'atu besok makefawungwa. <verse eid="MAT 13:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 13:14"/>Es bari boor'a raajju Isayyasniissi:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 13:14">« ‹Odoson odetir;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 13:14">sinuntano aane yaadatefeti;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 13:14">biyason biitir</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 13:14">sinuntano nibnitiissi aane yaadatefeti.<verse eid="MAT 13:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 13:15"/>Han daraasa niba muumiwa, odobesiis oyewa; aafbesiis dey talmewa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 13:15">ekka sina shakaanane aafbesiisik biire;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 13:15">odobesiisik odesere; nibbesiissi yaadatere</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 13:15">taaki wolseten fatuna kabawa.›</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 13:15">«Yistera maktera kuni raajiis baassosta sinanawa. <verse eid="MAT 13:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 13:16"/>Sinuntano nitto aafaas biyar; odontiis dey oder sinna boor'a suustowa. <verse eid="MAT 13:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 13:17"/>Futok nittok makefawungwa; showo raajjuni meenawa ookoni meena nitto biyefeti baron biyonek eenantesere aane biyoto. Odefeti baron eenantesere aane odosoto.<verse eid="MAT 13:17"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Bukinynyaasa Besoni Kota</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 4:13-20">Mar. 4:13-20</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:11-15">Luqa. 8:11-15</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 13:18"/>«Ese nitto zalaasi bukinynyani besosi kotanon odotiwa. <verse eid="MAT 13:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 13:19"/>Ugnaasta bukte zalaas besifanaas Ha'oosi taatoni kaamanon odere yaadatonoy asusingwa. Dey geregere Sexana yaara nibaassin bukte kaamaason kephfa. <verse eid="MAT 13:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 13:20"/>Kaa'oosta bukte zalaas besifanaas kaambaason odere geregere girak ephpheteefe asusingwa. <verse eid="MAT 13:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 13:21"/>Sinuntano tasba aafa sinna boor'a Ha'oosi kaamtan kabi chowa shana wedey kabugto kar'fana kabaasik geregere tuusa'sefe. <verse eid="MAT 13:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 13:22"/>Seer'aasi ganesi bukte zalaasi besifanaas kaambaason odere ephpheteefe asuswa. Sinuntano han daastaki fooni safaraasewa otumni keeshtanaase kaambaason geer'a gaanba foonto zagifa. <verse eid="MAT 13:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 13:23"/>Ma'a daasta bukte zalaas besifanaas kaambaason odere yaadatefe asusingwa. Bar gaana gaanar. Isaas tiyanon, isaas issunasiron isaas keezasiron gaanfa» yi.<verse eid="MAT 13:23"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Kaxakaxaasi Beso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 13:24"/>Dey Yesus ooma beso ekka yit make: «Samaki taatoos foshaasta ma'a zala buka asune faarwa. <verse eid="MAT 13:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 13:25"/>Sinuntano asu zuuttere kunnanneen orfo guma yeere zagoossi kaxakaxa bukaat hami. <verse eid="MAT 13:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 13:26"/>Zagoos kayira gaanfana kabaasik kaxakaxaas dey ane kessa beste. <verse eid="MAT 13:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 13:27"/>Foshaasi abani wostinynyani meya barki hamere: ‹Daamiiso; foshneesta ma'a zalaatanoso buktari? Eekin kaxakaxa ayin yaso?› yisete.<verse eid="MAT 13:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 13:28"/>«Bar dey baassok wolgire: ‹Han baron zagiis gumaaswa› yi. Wostinynyabaasakito dey: ‹Eekin hamma es kaxakaxaason waar'anik sholefatoso?› yisete.<verse eid="MAT 13:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 13:29"/>«Sinuntano bar wolgire: ‹Kaxakaxaason waar'feti kabaasik zagooson dey waar'tir sinna boor'a aafawa sinanawuza› yi. <verse eid="MAT 13:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 13:30"/>Beyfaani katona wonaas kar'ananneen ane dichfoon. Kar'ni wono kar'ni baassok: ‹Kaxakaxaason zeemma waar'ti; geyak kiichchonamato basa basak basati. Sinuntano zagooson botonaassi gaagtiwa› una» yi.<verse eid="MAT 13:30"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Fi'fi'oni Gaanni Beso</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 4:30-32">Mar. 4:30-32</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 13:18-19">Luqa. 13:18-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 13:31"/>Dey Yesus ooma beso ekka yit make: «Samaki taatoos asu ephphe taamme buloossi bukna fi'fi'oni gaanane faarwa. <verse eid="MAT 13:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 13:32"/>Bar zala zuuttambaase asiistan hater. Sinuntano dichfana kabaasik akakilti zuuttambaase asiistan arkifa dey i'o sinfa. Kasaasikito dey yaara waa'baassi keeba keer'a diifa.»<verse eid="MAT 13:32"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Masoosi Beso</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 13:20-21">Luqa. 13:20-21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 13:33"/>Dey Yesus ooma beso ekka yit make: «Samaki taatoos isa mashkasu keez safare buwaneen tushina masone faarwa. Es masoos dey tushoos kesanak zagi.»<verse eid="MAT 13:33"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesus Awuni Boor'a Besok Assinamato</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 4:33-34">Mar. 4:33-34</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 13:34"/>Yesus es baron zuutire besok daraasik make. Beso foontonon isa wuzane aane makowe. <verse eid="MAT 13:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 13:35"/>Es barnu ekka sinnaas raajjuniki kamo:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 13:35">«Wolumnaason besoktu makona;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 13:35">han daa testenanneen kabira;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 13:35">aachera fa wuzason makona»</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 13:35">yistera tichche bar sinanakwa.<verse eid="MAT 13:35"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Qaxaqaxaasi Besonon Koti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 13:36"/>Estan Yesus daraasin geggessaat keer giri. Nawobaasakito dey barki tai'sesere: «Buloostaki kaxakaxaasi besoni kotanon innok makowa» yisete. <verse eid="MAT 13:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 13:37"/>Yesus dey ekka yit wolgi: «Ma'a zalaason bukaas Asuni Naawa. <verse eid="MAT 13:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 13:38"/>Buloos han daaswa. Ma'a zalaas Ha'oosi taatoni naanggotawa. Kaxakaxaas dey sexanni naanggotawa. <verse eid="MAT 13:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 13:39"/>Kaxakaxaason bukaas guma sina Dabuloswa. Kar'ni wonaas dey han daasi ko'awa. Kar'niis dey Ha'oosi wosiyanikitowa. <verse eid="MAT 13:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 13:40"/>Es Kaxakaxaas kephtera kiichchefanaasimato han daasi ko'ak dey esiisimatotu sinana. <verse eid="MAT 13:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 13:41"/>Es kabaasik Asuni Naa wosibaasikitonon wosuna. Barikito dey oomiisin boor'a wostosonek zagsefe mangu meyanon zuutira basa taatoossin kephpha kissona. <verse eid="MAT 13:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 13:42"/>Dey kayo geyaassi ha'sona. Estak waasnewa ay'ni koyet foone sinana. <verse eid="MAT 13:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 13:43"/>Sinuntano ookoni meya ababesiisa taatosi awanimato chaarosone. Odoni odoba feenaas odowowa.»<verse eid="MAT 13:43"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Aacho Otmaasi Beso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 13:44"/>Tusire dey Yesus ekka yi: «Samaki taatoos buloossi aachera kuni otmane faarwa. Isa asu es otmaason danne aachi. Akamanon girobaastan kabi chowa hamme fa foobaason zuutire kisire waagaat es bulooson waage.» <verse eid="MAT 13:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 13:45"/>Hepsa Yesus ekka yi: «Dey samaki taatoos keeshu Inqu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13:45 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Baariissi faafa miizzani kolaassin bestefa waagba chima wuza</char></note> waagok shole naggaddene faarwa. <verse eid="MAT 13:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 13:46"/>Es naggaddees akamanon sholsu inquuson danynaayse hamme fa wuzbaason zuutire kisire waagaat es baron waage.»<verse eid="MAT 13:46"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yugudoosi Beso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="MAT 13:47"/>Tusire dey Yesus: «Esiisimato dey samaki taatoos baariissi ha'tefaat showo tesa kurxummiison zuuti yugudone faarwa. <verse eid="MAT 13:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MAT 13:48"/>Yugudoos tuumnanneen orfo kurxummiison eshefe baasso zatte baarisi ha'ta kissefe. Estan diisere ma'a ma'aason korisere masaassi gedesefe. Mangu manguuson dey gero ha'sefe. <verse eid="MAT 13:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MAT 13:49"/>Esiisimato han daasi ko'ak ekkatu sinana. Ha'oosi wosiyanikito yaara boor'ni meyanon ookoni meyaassin koruna. <verse eid="MAT 13:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="MAT 13:50"/>Manguni meyanon dey kayo geyaassi ha'sone. Estak waasnewa ay'ni koyet foone sinana.» <verse eid="MAT 13:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="MAT 13:51"/>Dey Yesus: «Han baron zuutira yaadatetiyoso?» yi. Baasso dey: «Aa» yisete. <verse eid="MAT 13:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="MAT 13:52"/>Yesus dey: «Ese samaki taatosi aacho chowanon mai'sire arife tumaasi assinynyaas; koda kunfana keyaassin gaddo sinaaysewa kur'u sinaayse ephphe kisife waagni abane feerwa» yi.<verse eid="MAT 13:52"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesus Koontena Daastaki Asuni Meya Barin Tugga'sete</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 6:1-6">Mar. 6:1-6</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:16-30">Luqa. 4:16-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="MAT 13:53"/>Yesus es besosikitonon makere koi'sinaase estan kesse hami. <verse eid="MAT 13:53"/><verse number="54" style="v" sid="MAT 13:54"/>Koontena katama Naaziret yeere Ayhudni shiiphoni keyaassi daraasin assit feer. Asuni meya dey diinqere: «Han asus han techmaasewa biistera artonoy wuzaase asin ayin ephphe yeso? <verse eid="MAT 13:54"/><verse number="55" style="v" sid="MAT 13:55"/>Han bar kar'inynya Yosefni naastenoso? Intobaas dey Maaramitanoso? Aybaasakito dey Yaqob, Yosef, Simonnawa Yuudanatenoso? <verse eid="MAT 13:55"/><verse number="56" style="v" sid="MAT 13:56"/>Eetbaasikito dey innoneen anetanoso faasenari? Eekin han asus effatena aruuson zuutire ayin daniso?» yisete. <verse eid="MAT 13:56"/><verse number="57" style="v" sid="MAT 13:57"/>Es bari boor'a basa chowaasik tuusa'sere ephphetoo beyete. Sinuntano Yesus: «Raajju ulfina dana beyfenaas koontena daastanawa keebaassina koi'bawa» yi. <verse eid="MAT 13:57"/><verse number="58" style="v" sid="MAT 13:58"/>Baasso amano beyaastan kabi chowa estak showo biistera artonoy wuza aane zaguwe.<verse eid="MAT 13:58"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 13"/>
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="MAT 14"/>
  <para style="s1">Haphqife Yohannisni Kitu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 6:14-29">Mar. 6:14-29</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:7-9">Luqa. 9:7-9</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 14:1"/>Es kabaasik Galiilaki daason ha'sife Herodis Yesusni chowaasi wollanon ode. <verse eid="MAT 14:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 14:2"/>Wostinynyabaasakitonik: «Haniis Haphqife Yohanniswa. Bar kitun kabiwa. Es bari boor'atu han biistera artonoy wuzaas barki kamo zagtedifawa» yi.<verse eid="MAT 14:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 14:3"/>Herodis ayba Filiphosni asu sina Herodiyadani boor'a Yohannisnin ootire taatoni keer taatire feer. <verse eid="MAT 14:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 14:4"/>Yohannis Herodisnik: «Ayneesa asunon ephatak tumaassi kaltowa» yire makena boor'a. <verse eid="MAT 14:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 14:5"/>Herodis Yohannisnin woruk sholet feer. Sinuntano daraas Yohannisnin raajju zagiretu biyefe sinna boor'a dige. <verse eid="MAT 14:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 14:6"/>Herodis koontena wonaason ulfinsifena wono Herodiyadani nawaas teegtere yeese baasso ganeyaassi suru surira Herodisnin girsi. <verse eid="MAT 14:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 14:7"/>Es bari boor'a Herodis bar shiiphena wuzason zuutire imanak teyire warege.<verse eid="MAT 14:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 14:8"/>Nawaas dey intobaasik kiittera: «Haphqife Yohannisni teetaason han koranaassi gedda hash taak imma» yi.<verse eid="MAT 14:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 14:9"/>Taatoos es chowaasik suume. Sinuntano girina teyyaasik barneen ane diise baasso boor'a iichchere Yohannisni teetaas imtonak zagi. <verse eid="MAT 14:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 14:10"/>Taatoni keer wosire Yohannisni teetaason kati. <verse eid="MAT 14:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 14:11"/>Es kate teetaason koranasi gedde teshshere nawaasik imete. Bar dey taamma intobaasik imi. <verse eid="MAT 14:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 14:12"/>Yohannisni nawoosakito yeesere dugnobaason ephphe kabbarsete. Hamere dey es chowaason Yesusnik maksete.<verse eid="MAT 14:12"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesus Uuch Kum Asunin Maasi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 6:30-44">Mar. 6:30-44</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:1-17">Luqa. 9:1-17</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 6:1-14">Yoha. 6:1-14</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 14:13"/>Yesus Yohannisni kituuson odenaase goonuussi diire bar bar duuk isa shaato dimsi hami. Daraas dey es baron odeseteyse katama katamabaassin kesse wochok barki hamete. <verse eid="MAT 14:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 14:14"/>Yesus goonuussin kerere showo darani biyaat baassok kenashte. Mettanni meyanon dey fati.<verse eid="MAT 14:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 14:15"/>Waalfana kabaasik nawobaasakito barki tai'sere «Han bar zabowa, gerok dey waali. Daraas hamme ke'esikitosin muubesi waagsonek geggessuwa» yisete.<verse eid="MAT 14:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 14:16"/>Sinuntano Yesus: «Nitto baasso muusoneeson imotitano hamonek aane sholsifawa» yi.<verse eid="MAT 14:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 14:17"/>Baasso dey: «Innoki fayiis uuch muuma daabbonewa hep kurxumminetano ooma hantak aafawa» yisete.<verse eid="MAT 14:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 14:18"/>Bar dey: «Es baron hang taaki teshshotiwa» yi. <verse eid="MAT 14:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 14:19"/>Daraas shaa'aasta duusonek ajaje. Estan uuch muuma daabboosonnawa hep kurxummiisonna ephphe den sama biire galatni shiipho shiiphe. Daabbooson dey batte nawobaasakitonik imin baasso dey daraasik woshete. <verse eid="MAT 14:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 14:20"/>Zuuttambesiise meere gawuseten nawobaasakito dey fu'te battoos asire heppe masa tuumanon zuutisete. <verse eid="MAT 14:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 14:21"/>Meese asuni meya mashkasusewa naanggotaase faadtonoyfeen uuch kum arqasu sinone.<verse eid="MAT 14:21"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesus Baariista Kuti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 14:22"/>Estan Yesus geregere nawobaasakitonin: «Daraasin geggessuna kabaneen goonuussi diisera zeemma yesalo fintiwa» yit ajaje. <verse eid="MAT 14:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 14:23"/>Daraasin geggessinayse Ha'o shiiphonak bar bar den aamaasta kesi. Waalfana kabaasik Yesus bar bartu estak feer. <verse eid="MAT 14:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 14:24"/>Es kabaasik Goonuus baarisi ganeta feen ek sinaastak siru faar sinna boor'a akaasi guubo shimsi. <verse eid="MAT 14:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 14:25"/>Wassi izgin sa'atiistak Yesus baariista kutit nawobaasakitoniki ye. <verse eid="MAT 14:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 14:26"/>Nawobaasakito dey akaasta kutit hamfeen biyefaat: «Han bar kitawa» yire digak chaagesete.<verse eid="MAT 14:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 14:27"/>Yesus dey geregere: «Harewa! Digotiitawa» yi.<verse eid="MAT 14:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 14:28"/>Es kabaasik Phexiros wolgire: «Daamiiso! Ne sinfaatane akaasta kutit neeki yoonak taan ajajowa» yi.<verse eid="MAT 14:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 14:29"/>Yesus dey: «Yowa» yi. Estan Phexiros goonuussin kerere Yesusniki hamanak akaasta kuti. <verse eid="MAT 14:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 14:30"/>Sinuntano sirusi hugnanon biire dige. Baariis barin koor'anak hambaase: «Daamtaaso! Taan fu'aywa» yit chaagi.<verse eid="MAT 14:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 14:31"/>Yesus geregere shongere kushubaason zatte: «Amantone yo'inar ne, awuni boor'a nibneessi ek hang yitso?» yi.<verse eid="MAT 14:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 14:32"/>Yesusnawa Phexirosna goonuussi girsefe kabaasik sirus yere. <verse eid="MAT 14:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 14:33"/>Goonuussi diise baasso dey zuuttere: «Futok ne Ha'oni Naawa» yit Yesusnik sagadesete.<verse eid="MAT 14:33"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesus Gensaretuk Mettanni Meyanon Fati</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 6:53-56">Mar. 6:53-56</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 14:34"/>Yesusnawa nawobaasakitona baariison finere Gensaret sinfa daasta yeesete. <verse eid="MAT 14:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 14:35"/>Estak asuni meya Yesus sinbaason arseteyse biratoosta fa daa zuuttambaase asiissi wosseten mettanni meyanon zuutire barki teshshesete. <verse eid="MAT 14:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 14:36"/>Mettanni meya maybaasi fashanon ta'uk shiiphset feeseter. Ta'i baasso dey zuuttere merobesiissin farsete.<verse eid="MAT 14:36"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 14"/>
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="MAT 15"/>
  <para style="s1">Abani Meeni Tuma</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 7:1-13">Mar. 7:1-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 15:1"/>Esseen orfo Yerusalemun yeese Museni tumaasi assinynyanawa Ferisawini meena Yesusniki tai'sesere: <verse eid="MAT 15:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 15:2"/>«Ne nawoosakito awuni boor'a kur'uni meeni dubbiyooson aatefeso? Muu meesefe kabaasik kushubesiison aane masesefewa» yisete.<verse eid="MAT 15:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 15:3"/>Yesus wolgire: «Nitto dubbiyooson oodakwa iyaat awuni boor'a Ha'oosi ajajinon aatfetiso? <verse eid="MAT 15:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 15:4"/>Ha'oos: ‹Abanesinnawa intoneesonna ulfinsuwa. Ababaasin wedey intobaason me'a bar kitunak sholsifawa› yifawa. <verse eid="MAT 15:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 15:5"/>Sinuntano nitto isa asu ababaasin wedey intobaason: ‹Ta nittok imana argasuuson Ha'oosik maba zagira imingwa› iyaanane; <verse eid="MAT 15:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 15:6"/>‹Es asus ababaasin wedey intobaason ulfinsunak aane sholsifawa› yifeti. Es bari boor'a nitto dubbiyooson oodakwa iyaat Ha'oosi kaamanon aatfetiwa. <verse eid="MAT 15:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 15:7"/>Sinnoy sinne bestefe nitto raajju Isayyas ekka yire nitto chowaasik makena raajiis futowa.<verse eid="MAT 15:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 15:8"/>« ‹Han daraas noono noonobaasiktu taan ulfinsifewa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 15:8">sinuntano nibbaas tayistan wokawa.<verse eid="MAT 15:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 15:9"/>Asu tumena tumaason Ha'oni tuma zagire assifaafe;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 15:9">shima shiipho shiiphesefewa› » yi.<verse eid="MAT 15:9"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Asuni Kiinsifa Wuzaas</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 7:14-23">Mar. 7:14-23</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 15:10"/>Tusire dey Yesus daraasin hang barki teegere: «Odotiwa! Dey yaadatotiwa! <verse eid="MAT 15:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 15:11"/>Asunin kiinsifaas noonosin kesfa bartano noonosi girifa bartawa.»<verse eid="MAT 15:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 15:12"/>Estan nawoni meya barki yeesere: «Ferisawini meya han ne maketa kaamaason odesere nibbesiissi kejfaan tuusa'setemato aritoso?» yisete. <verse eid="MAT 15:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 15:13"/>Yesus wolgire: «Samaki Abataas toknoyna akakiltiis zuuttera waaterwa. <verse eid="MAT 15:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 15:14"/>Baasso aaftishu dey aaftishuni meyanon zoonsir sinete boor'a beytiwa. Aaftishu aaftishusin zoonsifaanane hepere gawusitu gandosonewa.»<verse eid="MAT 15:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 15:15"/>Phexiros dey Yesusnin: «Besoson kotta innok makowa» yi. <verse eid="MAT 15:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 15:16"/>Yesus wolgire: «Nitto dey hashneen kar'a aane yaadatowetinoso? <verse eid="MAT 15:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 15:17"/>Noonosi girifa bar zuuttera kataassi kamo aatta gero kesfanamato aane aruwetinoso? <verse eid="MAT 15:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 15:18"/>Sinuntano asuni noonosin kesfa bar nibsintu kesfawa. Asunin dey kiinsifaas es barwa. <verse eid="MAT 15:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 15:19"/>Mangunon safaro, asunin woru, soolo, gerkesa, wiiso, esha zaalni mako, asuni sunni mangsu zuuttera asuni nibsintu kesfawa <verse eid="MAT 15:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 15:20"/>Asunin kiinsifaas dey es bartano kushu masonoy muustawa.»<verse eid="MAT 15:20"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Kene'aki Mashkasuni Amanto</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 7:24-30">Mar. 7:24-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 15:21"/>Yesus estan kesse Tirosni katamaassinawa Sidonani katamaassina hami. <verse eid="MAT 15:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 15:22"/>Estak isa kene'aki mashkasu Yesusniki yaara: «Dawitni Naa Daamiiso! Naanaas kiina ayyanak oottera akamanon mettedifar sinna boor'a taak kenashtefaywa» yit chaagi.<verse eid="MAT 15:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 15:23"/>Sinuntano Yesus isa wuzane wolgunoy shaakki. Es kabaasik nawobaasakito barki tai'sere: «Han asus inno orfoose yaafaafa chaaget faar sinna boor'a geggessifaywa» yit mamussete. <verse eid="MAT 15:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 15:24"/>Yesus wolgire: «Ta wostera yaanaas fantunimato tishire fe Israelni meyaktano oomni meyak aane yootwa» yi.<verse eid="MAT 15:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 15:25"/>Sinuntano asus yaara wochobaassi kaa'nera: «Daamiiso! Taan argasaywa» yi.<verse eid="MAT 15:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 15:26"/>Sinuntano Yesus barik wolgire: «Naanggotaasi daabbonon ephphe kanak ha'u aane sholsifawe» yi. <verse eid="MAT 15:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 15:27"/>Bar dey wolgira: «Futowa, Daamiiso! Kanaasikitonu daambaysakitoni sillawotan zigtefa fufuntoosontu maasefawa» yi.<verse eid="MAT 15:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 15:28"/>Es kabaasik Yesus wolgire: «Han asuse! Amantonees akamawe. Sholeta bar neek sinungwe» yi. Nawubaas dey es sa'atiistak fari.<verse eid="MAT 15:28"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesus Showo Mettannin Fati</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 15:29"/>Yesus estan kabire Galiilaki baarisi tesha yeere den aamaasta kesse hamme di. <verse eid="MAT 15:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 15:30"/>Showo asuni meya laafaasakitonin aaftishusakitonin engitiisin, nibtaatosakitoninnawa oom showo mettanni meyanonna ephpheteshshere basa wochoossi kunusseten bar dey baassotin fati. <verse eid="MAT 15:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 15:31"/>Es bari boor'a daraas nibtaatoos wollefeen, laafaas farifeen, engitiis kaanne kutifeen, aaftishuus biifeen biisere diinqok Israelni Ha'ooson galattesete.<verse eid="MAT 15:31"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesus Acheech Kum Asunin Maasi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 15:32"/>Yesus nawobaasakitonin teegere: «Daraas taneen ane keez wona feeshete sinna boor'a muusone wuza aafa sinna boor'a baassok kenashtefawungwa; uguntak makak mikishere gandosonoytemato afurbesiise gafkuk aane sholefatwa» yi.<verse eid="MAT 15:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 15:33"/>Nawobaasakito dey: «Eekin han effatena daraasin gausuni tusha han ichma daassik ayin dananirinso?» yisete. <verse eid="MAT 15:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 15:34"/>Yesus: «Apun daabbonso nittoki faari?» yi. Baasso dey: «Naafun muuma daabbonewa garo garo kiisku kurxumminetu innokik faarwa» yisete. <verse eid="MAT 15:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 15:35"/>Esseen orfo daraas daasta duusonek ajaje. <verse eid="MAT 15:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 15:36"/>Naafun muuma daabboosewa garo garo kiisku kurxummiise asin ephphe Ha'o galattefaat batte nawobaasakitonik imi. Baasso dey daraasik woshete. <verse eid="MAT 15:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 15:37"/>Zuuttambesiise meesere gawuseten fu'te battooson naafun masa zuutisete. <verse eid="MAT 15:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 15:38"/>Meese baasso mashkasusewa naanggotaase faadtonoynaron acheech kum arqasu sinone. <verse eid="MAT 15:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 15:39"/>Daraasin geggessinanneen orfo goonuussi diire Megdon yiste daa hami.<verse eid="MAT 15:39"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 15"/>
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="MAT 16"/>
  <para style="s1">Biistera Artonoy Wuzni Biyak Mamuste Mamsu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 8:11-13">Mar. 8:11-13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 12:54-56">Luqa. 12:54-56</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 16:1"/>Ferisawini meenawa Sedukawini meena Yesusniki yeesere barin fattanok sholsefaat: «Den saman biistera artonoy wuza innok besuwa» yit mamussete. <verse eid="MAT 16:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 16:2"/>Sinuntano Yesus wolgire: [«Waalin samaas she'in biifeti kabaasik: ‹Noi'sunirwa› yifeti. <verse eid="MAT 16:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 16:3"/>E'so dey: ‹Samaas gumalla karayen biifeti kabaasik hawung akama iro ichnirwa› yifeti. Ese samaasi gitonon aruk chimtir. Sinuntano neyaasi besonon aruk aane chimefeti?] <verse eid="MAT 16:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 16:4"/>Mangunewa amanamtonoy koontoos besotu sholefawa? Sinuntano raajju Yonasni besostan ooma beso aafa imtona wuza.» Estan Yesus baassotin beyye hami.<verse eid="MAT 16:4"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ferisawini Meenawa Sadukawini Meeni Masoni Beso</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 8:14-21">Mar. 8:14-21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 16:5"/>Nawoni meya baariison finefe kabaasik daabboni epha daagsete. <verse eid="MAT 16:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 16:6"/>Yesus baassotin: «Ese arutiwa, Ferisawini meenawa Sadukawini meena asi masoossin teetnitiison oodtiwa» yi.<verse eid="MAT 16:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 16:7"/>Baasso dey: «Daabbo epha daageni boor'atongwa» yiset baassotna baassotna wolumsete.<verse eid="MAT 16:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 16:8"/>Yesus baasso safaraason arifaat: «Amantonti yo'ina nitto awuni boor'a nittotna nittotna ‹Daabbo epha beyni boor'atongwa› yit wolumsefetiso? <verse eid="MAT 16:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 16:9"/>Hashnu aane yaadatowetinoso? Uuch muuma daabbooson uuch kum asusik hooren fu'te battooson apun masa zuutisetimato aane yaadatowetinoso? <verse eid="MAT 16:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 16:10"/>Esiismato dey naafun muuma daabbooson acheech kum asusik hooren apun masa zuutisetimato aane yaadatowetinoso? <verse eid="MAT 16:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 16:11"/>Eekin ta makenaas daabboni chowa sina beybaason aakkak yaadato beytiso? Hashnu Ferisawini meenawa Sedukawini meena asi masoossin teetnitiison oodtiwa?»<verse eid="MAT 16:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 16:12"/>Estan nawobaasakito dey Yesus teetnitiison oodtiwa yinaas daabboossi girifa masoos sinnoynaron Ferisawini meenawa Sedukawini meena asi assuussin teetbesiison oodosonek sinbaason yaadatesete.<verse eid="MAT 16:12"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Phexiros Yesus Muudto Sinnamato Ammanon Make</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 8:27-30">Mar. 8:27-30</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:18-21">Luqa. 9:18-21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 16:13"/>Yesus Filiphoos Qesariya yistefa daa kar'naase nawobaasakitonin: «Asuni meya Asuni Naanin oowa yisefeso?» yit mamsi.<verse eid="MAT 16:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 16:14"/>Baasso dey: «Isa isaas ‹Haphqife Yohanniswa› yisefe. Oomiis dey ‹Eliyaswa› yisefe. Oomiis ‹Ermiyaswa wedey raajjuni meyaassin isaaswa› usotu yisedifewa» yisete. <verse eid="MAT 16:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 16:15"/>Yesus dey: «Eekin nitto Taan oowa yifetiso» yi. <verse eid="MAT 16:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 16:16"/>Simon Phexiros wolgire: «Ne hayewa Ha'oosi Naa Kiristooswa» yi.<verse eid="MAT 16:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 16:17"/>Yesus wolgire: «Yonani naa Simonno! Ne suustowa. Han baron neek ammanon besiis samaki fe Abataasteno ashnewa harinnetawa. <verse eid="MAT 16:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 16:18"/>Ta dey neek ekka yifawungwa, ne phexiroswa<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">16:18 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Phexiros uus: «Kaa'o» uu.</char></note> han kaa'oosta betekiristaninaason keer'anarwa. Es betekiristaniison kituni hugnaas meronak aafa chimanawuza. <verse eid="MAT 16:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 16:19"/>Samaki taatosi gachosikitonon neek imanawa. Ne han daastak taar'ta bar den samak taatotu sinana. Han daastak kotta bar den samak kottotu sinana.» <verse eid="MAT 16:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 16:20"/>Estan Yesus nawobaasakitonik bar Kiristoos sinbaason ooniknu maksonoytemato ajaje.<verse eid="MAT 16:20"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesus Kituna Baron Zeemme Make</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 8:31-33">Mar. 8:31-33</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:22-27">Luqa. 9:22-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 16:21"/>Es wononeen kabire Yesus nawobaasakitonik: «Yerusalem hamanak sholsifawa. Estak dey kur'uni meyakin, maagni gaanynyanikin, Museni tumaasi assinynyanikin shana tayista kar'ana. Dey worsoner. Sinuntano keezsinari wono kitun kabuna» uu ephi.<verse eid="MAT 16:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 16:22"/>Phexiros dey Yesusnin oor kisire: «Daamiiso! Han bar isanne neyista aafawa kar'anawuza» yit ke'u ephi.<verse eid="MAT 16:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 16:23"/>Sinuntano Yesus phexironiki yerqere: «Tayistan ek hamma! Ne Sexana! Asuniisontano Ha'oosi fiqadinon aane safarefe sinna boor'a taak tuusa sintiwa» yi.<verse eid="MAT 16:23"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Kiristoosnik Zoonustok Teetniison Beya Sholsifa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 8:34">Mar. 8:34</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:1">9:1</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:23-27">Luqa. 9:23-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 16:24"/>Estan orfo Yesus nawobaasakitonik: «Taneen ane hamak sholefe bar teetbaason beyye mesqelibaason wor'e taneen ane yowowa. <verse eid="MAT 16:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 16:25"/>Kaabaason fu'onak sholefe bar zuuttere tishkuna. Sinuntano ta boor'a kaabaason tishki bar zuuttere danana. <verse eid="MAT 16:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 16:26"/>Asu han daastak barik sholsi wuzason zuutire danfaat kaabaason tishkifaanane awu barik ke'nirinso? wedey asu kaabaasi soolak aro wuza kaasunak chimnirinso? <verse eid="MAT 16:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 16:27"/>Asuni Naa Ababaasa ulfinak wosibaasneen ane yoonirwa. Es kabaasik zuuttambaase asik wostobesisimato baassok kaasuna. <verse eid="MAT 16:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 16:28"/>Futok nittok makefawungwa; Asuni Naa taatobaasi ulfinak yeefeen biyone kabaneen hanta yere baassossin kitunoy asuni meya feeseterwa» yi.<verse eid="MAT 16:28"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 16"/>
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="MAT 17"/>
  <para style="s1">Yesusni Gitoosi Soolto</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 16:2-13">Mar. 16:2-13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:28-36">Luqa. 9:28-36</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 17:1"/>Issun wonaneen orfo Yesus Phexirosnin, Yaqobninnawa Yaqobni ay Yohannisninna asin ephphe isa dicha aamaasta baasso baassotin zoonsire kesi. <verse eid="MAT 17:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 17:2"/>Estak baasso sinak gitobaas sooltera sinbaas dey awanimato chaare. Maybaas dey forera chaarefnimato palpali. <verse eid="MAT 17:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 17:3"/>Musenawa Eeliyasna dey Yesusneen ane wolumsefeen biyesete. <verse eid="MAT 17:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 17:4"/>Estan Phexiros Yesusnin: «Daamiiso! Hanta fo innok ma'arwa. Ma'i iyaatane isaron neek, isaron Musenik, isaron Eliyasnik sini keez hafo keer'anawa» yi.<verse eid="MAT 17:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 17:5"/>Phexiros es baron makefeen palpalifa shaaru yaara baassotin yini. Dey es shaaruussin: «Barik girefana Naataas haniiswa. Barin odotiwa» yifa kaama odte.<verse eid="MAT 17:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 17:6"/>Nawobaasakito dey es kaamaason odesere akamanon digsete boor'a sinbesiisik daasta gandesete. <verse eid="MAT 17:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 17:7"/>Sinuntano Yesus baassoki tai'sere ta'ifaat: «Kabutiwa, digotiitawa!» yi. <verse eid="MAT 17:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 17:8"/>Baasso dey kaanne biyeten Yesusnintano oom ooninnu aane biyoto.<verse eid="MAT 17:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 17:9"/>Aamaastan kersefeen Yesus: «Asuni Naa kitun kabunanneen han biiti baron ooknu makotiitawa» yire nawobaasakitonin ajaje.<verse eid="MAT 17:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 17:10"/>Nawobaasakito dey: «Eekin Museni tumaasi assinynyani meya awuni boor'a zeemme Eeliyas yoonak sholsifawa yisefeso?» yit mamussete.<verse eid="MAT 17:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 17:11"/>Yesus wolgire: «Futowa, Eeliyas zeemme yeere zuuttambaase asin mai'suna. <verse eid="MAT 17:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 17:12"/>Sinuntano ta nittok makefawungwa; Eeliyas sina zeemme yewa; asuni meya dey aane arsoto sinna boor'a sholsete baron zuutire basaasta zagsete. Esiisimato dey Asuni Naa baasso kushusi shana ephphetoonak sholsifawa» yi.<verse eid="MAT 17:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 17:13"/>Es kabaasik nawobaasakito Yesus makena bar haphqife Yohannisni chowaason sinnamato arsete.<verse eid="MAT 17:13"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesus Kiina Ayyana Ephna Naasin Fati</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 9:4-29">Mar. 9:4-29</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:37-43">Luqa. 9:37-43</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 17:14"/>Yesusnawa keez nawobaasakitona daraaski wolle yeesefe kabaasik isa asu Yesusniki tai'sere wochobaassi kaa'nefaat: <verse eid="MAT 17:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 17:15"/>«Daamiiso! Naataasik kenashtefaywa; ephpha ha'ifa meroos mangunon shana besit faarwa. Showo wona akasinawa geesina gansir. <verse eid="MAT 17:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 17:16"/>Ne nawooski ephpha yaan; sinuntano fatuk aane chimoto» yi. <verse eid="MAT 17:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 17:17"/>Yesus wolgire: «Nitto amanonoy elinga koonto, aageneen kar'anso nittoneen ane foonari? Aageneen kar'anso nittotin fakunari? Naasin hang taaki teshshotiwa» yi. <verse eid="MAT 17:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 17:18"/>Yesus kiina ayyanaason ke'in basaassin kesi. Naas dey es kabaasik fari.<verse eid="MAT 17:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 17:19"/>Estan nawobaasakito baasso baasso Yesusniki tai'sere: «Inno kiina ayyanaason kisu chima beyniis awuni boor'anso?» yisete. <verse eid="MAT 17:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 17:20"/>Yesus dey wolgire: «Nitto amantoos yo'ina boor'awa. Futo nittok makefawungwa; fi'fi'oni gaanane fa amantonti faafaanane han aamaason ‹Hantan kabira ek hamme› iyaatine hamanawa. Nittok chimtonoywuza isanne aafawa. <verse eid="MAT 17:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 17:21"/>Sinuntano han effatena kiina ayyanaas soomere shiiphoktano baak aafawa kesana wuza» yi.<verse eid="MAT 17:21"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesus Kituna Baronnawa Kitun Kabuna Baronna Hepsa Wolle Make</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 9:30-32">Mar. 9:30-32</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:43-45">Luqa. 9:43-45</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 17:22"/>Nawobaasakito Galiilak zuuttesere feeseten Yesus baassok: «Asuni Naa asuni meeni kushusi aattere imtonirwa; <verse eid="MAT 17:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 17:23"/>Baasso dey worsoner; sinuntano keezsinari wono kitun kabuna» yi. Nawobaasakito es chowaasik dey akamanon suumesete.<verse eid="MAT 17:23"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Betemeqdesini Girboni Kaasuni Chowa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 17:24"/>Yesusnawa nawobaasakitona Kifirnahom kar'efe kabaasik betemeqdesini girbo zuutife asuni meya phexirosniki tai'sere: «Nitto assinynyaas betemeqdesik giribtefa girbooson aane girbefenoso?» yit mamussete. <verse eid="MAT 17:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 17:25"/>Phexiros wolgire: «Girberwa» yi. Estan Phexiros keer girifena kabaasik Yesus zeemme: «Simon phexiros; neek awu sinna bestefaso? Han daastaki taate meya karaxa wedey girbo zuutisefees ookininso? Naanggotbesiiskiningwa wedey irbanikininso?» yi. <verse eid="MAT 17:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 17:26"/>Phexiros dey: «Irbaaskingwa» yire wolgi. Yesus dey: «Ese naanggotbesiisikito girbo aaffa kaasusone wuza. <verse eid="MAT 17:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 17:27"/>Sinuntano baassosta tuusa sinnoynimato hamfaat kurxummiisi eshmiyanon baariissi ha'uwa. Estan zeemma ootte kurxummiisi noononon shoo'sifata kabaasik birri danata. Taamma dey ta sunaasiknawa ne sunaasikna kaasuwa» yi.<verse eid="MAT 17:27"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 17"/>
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="MAT 18"/>
  <para style="s1">Zuuttambaase Asiistan Arkunir Oonso?</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 9:33-37">Mar. 9:33-37</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:46-48">Luqa. 9:46-48</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 18:1"/>Es kabaasik nawobaasakito Yesusniki tai'sere: «Samaki taatoossi zuuttambaase asiistan arkir oonso?» yit mamussete. <verse eid="MAT 18:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 18:2"/>Yesus dey: Isa daaga nawa teegere baasso ganeyaassi yeeti. <verse eid="MAT 18:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 18:3"/>Ekka dey yi: «Futo nittok makefawungwa; soolto shakatinenawa han daaga naanggotaasne feer sina shakaatinena samaki taatoossi isanne aafawa giruti wuza. <verse eid="MAT 18:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 18:4"/>Es bari boor'a han daaga nawaasimato teetbaason daa ephfe bar den samaki taatoossi arkirwa. <verse eid="MAT 18:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 18:5"/>Esiisimato haniisne fe daaga nawaason ta sunaasik ephpheteefe bar taan ephphetoona.»<verse eid="MAT 18:5"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Asunik Tuusa Sinaastan Teetni Ooda</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 9:42-48">Mar. 9:42-48</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 17:1-2">Luqa. 17:1-2</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 18:6"/>Dey Tusire: «Oonu han taak amanefe garo garoosasin isaasin tuusa'sife bar wooni shu'a suutbaasta taatera baarisi tir'maassi ha'tefaanane ma'arwa. <verse eid="MAT 18:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 18:7"/>Asuni meya tuusa'osonek zaguni wuzaasik han daas haybubawungwa! Tuusa'suni wuzaas aafawa yobeyana wuza. Sinuntano es tuusaasik ugna sinni asus haybubawowa! <verse eid="MAT 18:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 18:8"/>Es bari boor'a wochonees wedey kushunees tuusa'sunir sinfaanane kar'a ha'uwa. Hep kushune wedey hep wochone faafaan koi'ba foonto geesi ha'toneestan dungu wedey engit sinna koi'ba foonto kaa danne wayyawa. <verse eid="MAT 18:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 18:9"/>Aafnees tuusa'sunir sinfaanane wo'ira ha'uwa. Hep aafne faafaan geeni tir'maassi ha'toneestan isa aafne faafaan kaa danfaatane wayyawa. <verse eid="MAT 18:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 18:10"/>Den samak baassok hoorera faase Ha'oosi wosiyanikito samak fe Abataasa sinanon wonna wonna biyeter sinna boor'a han garo garoosasin isaasinnu kashshunoytimato arutiwa. [<verse eid="MAT 18:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 18:11"/>Asuni Naa dey yeenaas tishi baassotin fu'okwa.»]<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">18:11 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Isa isa zeemoti matsafaassi faadba 11 daysir. Kaambaas dey Luqa. 10 fayiisne faar.</char></note><verse eid="MAT 18:11"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Tishira Beste Fantuusi Beso</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 15:3-7">Luqa. 15:3-7</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 18:12"/>Dey Yesus: «Awu sinna nittok bestefaso? Isa asu tiya fantuba faafaananenawa es barissin isar tishifaanane izginasire izgineeson aamaasta beyfaat tishi baron sholok aafanoso hamana wuza? <verse eid="MAT 18:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 18:13"/>Futo nittok makefawungwa; danfena kabaasik tishunoy izginasire izgineestan es tishira beste bariktu akamanon girefe. <verse eid="MAT 18:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 18:14"/>Esiisimato dey han garo garoosasin isar tishunak den samak fe Abantiisa safaratawa» yi.<verse eid="MAT 18:14"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Miir'efe Asusik Awu Zagunik Sholsifanamato</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 18:15"/>Dey tusire: «Aynees neen miir'efaanane neneen barneen ane faatiista neen miir'ena baron makowa. Odefaanane wolgira ayne zagutawa. <verse eid="MAT 18:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 18:16"/>Sinuntano odo shakaanane hep wedey keez zaalniktu chowaas futo sinfa sinna boor'a hep wedey keez asunin ephpha barki hamma. <verse eid="MAT 18:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 18:17"/>Baassotin odo beyfaanane betekiristaniisik makowa. Betekiristaniison dey odo beyfaanane Ha'ooson amanonor wedey boor'inynyana zagira faaduwa. <verse eid="MAT 18:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 18:18"/>Ta futok nittok makefawungwa; han daastak taar'efeti bar samak dey taatotu sinana. Han daasta kotfeti bar samak dey kottotu sinana. <verse eid="MAT 18:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 18:19"/>Dey nittok makefawungwa; nittoossin heppiis han daastak aaffa wuzaasiknu sinun isar sinne shiiphsefaatene samaki fe abataas baassok zaguna. <verse eid="MAT 18:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 18:20"/>Hep wedey keez sinne ta sunaasik zuuttesefe dimaasta ta baasso ganeyaassi foonawa» yi.<verse eid="MAT 18:20"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Feeshun Uni Chowa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 18:21"/>Estan Phexiros Yesusniki yeere: «Daamiiso! Aytaas taan miir'efaanane apuna wolla feeshun unarinso? naafuna wollanoso?» yi. <verse eid="MAT 18:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 18:22"/>Yesus wolgire: «Naafunasira wolla naafunetano naafuna wolla koi'bawa aafawa unawuza. <verse eid="MAT 18:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 18:23"/>Esiisimato den samaki taatoos wostinynyabaasakitoni kushusi fa waagbaason faadunak shole taatone faarwa. <verse eid="MAT 18:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 18:24"/>Es waagbaason faadu ephfena kabaasik asir kuma mekiliti<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">18:24 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Isa mekiliti uus isa wostinynya isa wonak wosten wostinynyaasik kaastefa asire uuchche woggani wostoni waaga</char></note> sinni kowa basaasta faana isa asunin barki ephphe yeesete. <verse eid="MAT 18:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 18:25"/>Es wostinynyaas kaasuna waaga turkifaan barneen asubaasneen naanggotbaasneen fa waagbaas zuuttera kessa waagtera kowa kaastonak daambaas ajaje. <verse eid="MAT 18:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 18:26"/>Sinuntano wostinynyaas daambaasa wochosi kaa'nere: ‹Daamiiso, taak fakuwa, zuuttambaase asin kaasunawa› yit shiiphe. <verse eid="MAT 18:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 18:27"/>Daambaas dey barik kenashtefaat gafki. Kowaason dey kaasto beyi.<verse eid="MAT 18:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 18:28"/>«Sinuntano es wostinynyaas estan kesse hamfeen wostoni zomoba sinarik tiya diinari<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">18:28 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Isa diinari uus isa wostinynya isa wonak wosten wostinynyaasik kaastefa isa wonni damoza.</char></note> liqsinarin danne: ‹Liqsina waagnaason kaasuwa› yit zatte geer'i. <verse eid="MAT 18:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 18:29"/>Es wostoni zomoba sina wostinynyaas dey wochobaassi kaa'nere: ‹Taak fakuwa, zuuttambaase asin kaasunawa› yit shiiphe. <verse eid="MAT 18:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 18:30"/>Sinuntano asus aane ma'i uwe. Kowaason kaasunanneen taamme taatoni keer taati. <verse eid="MAT 18:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 18:31"/>Es sina baron wostoni zomoba sina oom wostinynyaasakito bar zagina baron biyefaat akamanon suumesete. Hamere dey sina baron zuutire daambesiisik maksete. <verse eid="MAT 18:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 18:32"/>Estan daambaas es wostinynyaasin teegsire: ‹Ne mangu wostinynya, taan shiiphen es effatena kowaason zuutira neek beyin.› <verse eid="MAT 18:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 18:33"/>Eekin ta neen fakinaasimato zomone sina es wostinynyaasin fakutak aane sholsifanoso? <verse eid="MAT 18:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 18:34"/>Daambaas gi'tere kowaason zuutire kaasunanneen shana biyanak taatoni keyaason ha'sife baassok aatire imi.<verse eid="MAT 18:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 18:35"/>«Ese nitto dey isa isarnitiis aynitisakitonin nibnitiissin koi'sira feeshun uu shakaatine den samak fe abataas dey nittoosta esiisimatotu zagunawa.»<verse eid="MAT 18:35"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 18"/>
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="MAT 19"/>
  <para style="s1">Yesus Ephnewa Girune Asi Chowa Assi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 10:1-12">Mar. 10:1-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 19:1"/>Yesus es baron makere koi'sinanneen orfo Galiilan kesse Yordanosni yesalo fa Yuudani daasta hami. <verse eid="MAT 19:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 19:2"/>Showo dara basa orfoose hami. Baassossin dey mette asuni meyanon estak fati.<verse eid="MAT 19:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 19:3"/>Ferisawini meya dey yeesere barin fattanok sholsefaat: «Asu sina chowa aaffarik sinun asubaason teetba kotte gafkunak faqqadtonoso?» yit mamussete.<verse eid="MAT 19:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 19:4"/>Yesus wolgire ekka yi: «Ha'oos zeemma arqarnawa mashkare zagira tesinamato aane feretuwetinoso? <verse eid="MAT 19:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 19:5"/>‹Es bari boor'a asu Ababaasinnawa intobaasonna beyye asubaasneen isar sinana. Hepobesiise dey isa atu sinone› <verse eid="MAT 19:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 19:6"/>Ese baasso hanneen ekalo isa atutano hep atutawa. Ha'oos isar zagina baassotin asu oor kisunaatawa» <verse eid="MAT 19:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 19:7"/>Ferisawini meya dey wolgire: «Eekin Muse awuni boor'a ‹Teetni kotni ticha imme teetba kotowa› yire ajajeso?» yisete.<verse eid="MAT 19:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 19:8"/>Yesus wolgire: «Nitto nibaasi chimni boor'atu asuntiisikitonon teetba kotta gafkutik maketeno tesustaneen ekkatawa.<verse eid="MAT 19:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 19:9"/>«Sinuntano ta nittok makefawungwa: ‹Isa asu gerkesni chowak sinnoynaron asubaason teetba kotte gafkaat ooma asu ephfaanane gerkesiwa.› » <verse eid="MAT 19:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 19:10"/>Nawobaasakito dey: «Abanewa intone asi chowaas ekka sinfaanane ephnewa girune asin beyaas ma'arwa» yisete.<verse eid="MAT 19:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 19:11"/>Sinuntano Yesus wolgire: «Imtena baassoktano han effatena assus asu zuuttambesiise asik aafa chimtona wuza. <verse eid="MAT 19:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 19:12"/>Intobesiisi keensin arqarbesi foonto sinne koonter feeseter. Dey asu arqarbesiison kar'nar feeseter. Samaki taatoosikwa iyaat arqarbesi foontone feer sinar feeseter. Ephphetook chimni bar ephphetoowowa» yi.<verse eid="MAT 19:12"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesus Daaga Naanggotaason Suusi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 10:13-16">Mar. 10:13-16</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:15-17">Luqa. 18:15-17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 19:13"/>Estan Yesus kushubaason barikitoniista ta'ire shiiphonak asuni meya daaga naanggotaason Yesusniki ephphe yeesete. Sinuntano Nawobaasakito kalesete. <verse eid="MAT 19:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 19:14"/>Sinuntano Yesus: «Samaki taatoos han naanggotaasne fayiisik sinna boor'a daaga naanggotaason beyfaani taaki yoosonwa, kalatiitawa» yi. <verse eid="MAT 19:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 19:15"/>Kushubaason naanggotaasta ta'ire suusaat estan aatte hami.<verse eid="MAT 19:15"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Han Daastaki Otmaasewa Samaki Taatoose</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 19:16"/>Isa asu Yesusniki yeere: «Assinynyano! Koi'ba foonto kaa dananak aro ma'a wuza zagunarinso?» yit mamsi. <verse eid="MAT 19:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 19:17"/>Yesus wolgire: «Ma'a wuzni chowa awuniron taaki mamsifatso? Ma'ar sinaas isa Ha'oos koi'bawa. Kaani keer giruk sholefaatane ajajiisikitonon oodwa» yi.<verse eid="MAT 19:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 19:18"/>Asus dey wolgire: «Aaffa ajajiisikitonso?» yi.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 19:18">Yesus barik: «Asuni worutaata, gerkesataata, wiisotaata, esha zaala makotaata <verse eid="MAT 19:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 19:19"/>Abanesinnawa intoneesonna ulfinsu, Wolkoneesin teetneeson shunfataasimato shun» yifa ajajiisikitowa. <verse eid="MAT 19:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 19:20"/>Na'o asus dey: «Es baron zuutira ooddatu fawungwa, ooma yo'ir aambanso?» yi.<verse eid="MAT 19:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 19:21"/>Yesus dey: «Tuum sinatak sholefaatane hamma fa wuzneeson kisira waagera tukamni meyak imma. Samak otma danatawa; eekaat yeen taneen ane hamniwa» yi. <verse eid="MAT 19:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 19:22"/>Sinuntano na'o asus akama otumba faana boor'a es kaamaason odenayse suumet hami. <verse eid="MAT 19:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 19:23"/>Yesus nawobaasakitonik: «Futo nittok makefawungwa; otum asunik samaki taatoossi giruus akamanon fayawa. <verse eid="MAT 19:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 19:24"/>Dey nittok makefawungwa; otum asu Ha'oosi taatosi girubaastan gaala marufni kattosi kamo aatfaanane kashowa» yi. <figure style="fig" alt="Man leading unloaded camel" file="LB00039B.tif" size="span" ref="19:24">Asu fechonoy gaala kalle hamdifer </figure> <verse eid="MAT 19:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 19:25"/>Nawobaasakito es baron odeseteyse akamanon diinqesefaat: «Eekin oonso faruk chimniri?» yisete. <verse eid="MAT 19:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 19:26"/>Yesus dey baassoki biyaat: «Han bar asunik aafa chimtona wuza. Sinuntano Ha'oosik zuuttambaase chimtonawa» yi. <verse eid="MAT 19:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 19:27"/>Es kabaasik Phexiros wolgire: «Ese inno zuuttambaase asin beyya neek zoonusteniwa; eekin awu danungeniso?» yi. <verse eid="MAT 19:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 19:28"/>Yesus baassok ekka yi: «Futo nittok makefawungwa; Asuni Naa ulfinni zigimubaasta duuna gaddo yooni daastak; taak zoonustesefe nitto dey asire heppe Israelni zigimoosta duusotiwa. Asire heppe Israelni asteserista dey mangsu kar'atiwa. <verse eid="MAT 19:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 19:29"/>Ta sunaasikwa iyaat keyaasikitonon wedey ayisakitonin wedey eetisikitonon wedey ababaasinnawa intobaasonna wedey naanggotaason wedey bulooson beya bar zuuttambaase tiya kushunontu danana. Koi'ba foonto kaa dey danana. <verse eid="MAT 19:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 19:30"/>Sinuntano zeema baasso showobesiis orfotir sinone. Orfotir sina baasso zeemar sinone.»<verse eid="MAT 19:30"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 19"/>
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="MAT 20"/>
  <para style="s1">Wayinini Dimaastaki Wostinynyani Meeni Beso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 20:1"/>Tusire dey Yesus ekka yi: «Samaki taatoos wayinini akakiltini dimaasta wostesefe wostinynyani sholok e'so wonsak kesa wayinini akakiltiisi abane faarwa. <verse eid="MAT 20:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 20:2"/>Bar wostinynyaasakitonik isa wonak isa diinari kaasunak wollere wayinini akakiltini dimaasta wosi. <verse eid="MAT 20:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 20:3"/>Dey keez sa'atiista kesse oom wosto foonto meya yaboosta yerse asuni meyanon bi. <verse eid="MAT 20:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 20:4"/>Es baassok dey: ‹Nitto dey ek wayinini akakiltiini dimaasta hamfaat wostotiwa. Nittok sholsi waagaason kaasuna› yi. <verse eid="MAT 20:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 20:5"/>Baasso dey wayinini akakiltiisi dimta hamete. Dey issun sa'atiisanawa izgin sa'atiistana kesse esiisimato zagi. <verse eid="MAT 20:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 20:6"/>Asire isse sa'atiista kesse oom asuni meya yersefeen biyaat: ‹Nitto dey wosto foonto wonaason zuutira awuni boor'a hanta yeretirinso?› yi. <verse eid="MAT 20:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 20:7"/>Baasso dey: ‹Innotin wosussuni asunin turkira yerenirwa› yisete. Bar dey: ‹Ek wayinini akakiltiisi dimaasta hamfaat wostotiwa› yi. <verse eid="MAT 20:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 20:8"/>Waalfana kabaasik wayinini akakiltiisi daam wosussife barin: ‹Wostinynyaasakitonin teegera orfoti baassostan kabgira siinaki baassosta kar'ana kabaneen wostesete wostoosi waaganon kaasuwa› yi. <verse eid="MAT 20:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 20:9"/>Asire isse sa'atik wostoosi giri baasso yeesere isa isarbesiis isa diinari ephete. <verse eid="MAT 20:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 20:10"/>Zeemme wostoosi giri baasso dey yeesere orfoti baassostan daytonon ephonenne faar sinna baassok beste. Sinuntano baasso dey isa isarbesiis isa diinari ephete. <verse eid="MAT 20:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 20:11"/>Waagbesiison epheteese wayiniisi akakiltini abanita ekka yit unyisete. <verse eid="MAT 20:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 20:12"/>‹Han orfo giri baasso isa sa'atinintu wosussete. Wonaason zuutira noi'sak kiichchere feesha innoneen isa kixxe kaasitwa› <verse eid="MAT 20:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 20:13"/>Wayiniisi akakiltini aba wostinynyaasakitonisin isaasik: ‹Zomotaaso! Ta neen aane miir'otwa. Wonaasik isa diinari kaasunaktanoso neneen ane wollenari? <verse eid="MAT 20:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 20:14"/>Ese ne haa'ooson ephpha hamma. Han neek imnaasimato orfoti barik imanak sholefawungwa. <verse eid="MAT 20:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 20:15"/>Waagnaasta shunnaron zagunak aafanoso chimanawuza? Wedey garam asu sinna boor'a ne taan koonetoso?› » <verse eid="MAT 20:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 20:16"/>Estan Yesus: «Zeema baasso orfotir sinone; Orfoti baasso dey zeemar sinone» yi.<verse eid="MAT 20:16"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesus Kituna Baronnawa Kitun Kabuna Baronna Uuchsha Wolle Make</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 10:32-34">Mar. 10:32-34</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:31-34">Luqa. 18:31-34</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 20:17"/>Esseen orfo Yesus Yerusalem hamefet ugnaastak asire heppe nawobaasakitonin baasso baassotin barki tai'sire: <verse eid="MAT 20:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 20:18"/>«Ese Yerusalem hamanirwa; Asuni Naa dey maagni gaanynye meyaknawa Museni tumaasi assinynyani meyakna aattere imtona. Baasso dey kituni mangsuni kar'a basaasta kar'oner. <verse eid="MAT 20:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 20:19"/>Kanyosonek, ichosoneknawa suutosonekna Aazabni meyak aatire imone. Sinuntano bar keezsinari wono kitun kabuna» yi.<verse eid="MAT 20:19"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Zebdewosni Naanggotiisa Intoni Shiipho</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 10:35-45">Mar. 10:35-45</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 20:20"/>Estan Zebdewosni naanggotiisa into naanggotisneen ane Yesusniki yaara sinba kaa'nera bar barik isa wuza zagunak shiiphe. <verse eid="MAT 20:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 20:21"/>Yesus dey: «Awu sholefaasse?» yi. Bar dey: «Han hep naanggottaas ne taatoossi isaas o'itneesta; isaas dey alidneesta duusonak zaguwa!» yi.<verse eid="MAT 20:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 20:22"/>Sinuntano Yesus wolgire: «Nitto shiiphefeti wuzason aane arifeti. Ta ushanak fa shanani toofoosi ushaason ushatik chimatiroso?» Baasso dey: «Aa chimaniwa» yisete. <verse eid="MAT 20:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 20:23"/>Bar dey: «Taa shanani toofoosi ushanon ushatiwa; Sinuntano o'itnaastanawa alidnaastana duuson Abataas hoossina baassoteno duusonek zaguniis tatewa» yi.<verse eid="MAT 20:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 20:24"/>Es baron ode oom asir nawoni meya es hep ayna ayna asiista haaresete. <verse eid="MAT 20:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 20:25"/>Sinuntano Yesus baassotin barki teegere ekka yi: «Aazabni meeni gaanynye meya darabesiisa ha'sinynyawa. Baassotin zoonsisefe meya dey baassosta ha'suni hugnabesi faanamato arsefeti. <verse eid="MAT 20:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 20:26"/>Nitto ganeyaassi ekka sinanak aane sholsifawa. Sinuntano oonu nittoossin arkir sinanak sholefaanane nitto wostinynya sinowa. <verse eid="MAT 20:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 20:27"/>Esiisimato dey nittoossin denalo sinak sholefe bar nitto boz sinowa. <verse eid="MAT 20:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 20:28"/>Asuni Naa dey oomiisik wostonaknawa showoni meyanon fatuk kaabaason aatire imaktu yeeteno baasso barik wostosonek aane yowewa» yi.<verse eid="MAT 20:28"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesus Hep Aaftishuni Meyanon Fati</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 10:46-52">Mar. 10:46-52</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:35-43">Luqa. 18:35-43</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 20:29"/>Esseen orfo Iyyarikon kesse hamefeen showo dara Yesusneen ane hamete. <verse eid="MAT 20:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 20:30"/>Estak dey ugunni teshta diise hep aaftishuni meya Yesus baassoki esta kamo aatbaason odeseteyse: «Daamiiso! Dawitni Naaso! Innotin fakifaywa!» yit chaagete.<verse eid="MAT 20:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 20:31"/>Daraas dey: «Shaakkutiwa» yit ke'isete. Sinuntano baasso: «Daamiiso! Dawitni Naaso! Innotin fakifaywa!» yit aatamsire chaagete. <verse eid="MAT 20:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 20:32"/>Yesus dey yerere baassotin barki teegere: «Nittok awu zagunak sholefetiso?» yi. <verse eid="MAT 20:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 20:33"/>Baasso dey: «Daamiiso! Aafniis gachchonak zagaywa» yisete. <verse eid="MAT 20:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 20:34"/>Yesus baassok kenashtefaat aaffesiison ta'i. Geregere dey aafbesiis biin Yesusneen ane hamete.<verse eid="MAT 20:34"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 20"/>
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="MAT 21"/>
  <para style="s1">Yesus Akama Ulfinak Yerusalem Giri</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 11:1-11">Mar. 11:1-11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 19:28-40">Luqa. 19:28-40</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 12:12-19">Yoha. 12:12-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 21:1"/>Yesusnawa nawobaasakitona Yerusalem tai'sesete. Dabrazayitini kumaasta fa Beetefage yistefa ke'eessi kar'efe kabaasik nawobaasasin heppin ekka yit wosi: <verse eid="MAT 21:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 21:2"/>«Ek sinnitiista fa ke'eessi hamti; estak tuptera yere hanya nawubaneen yerefeen danati. Kotta taaki ephpha yoosoti. <verse eid="MAT 21:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 21:3"/>Oonu ‹Awuniron barikitonon kottifetirinso?› iyaanane ‹Daamiis barikitonon sholefawungwa› uti. Bar dey geregere hanyaasikitonon gafkuna» yi. <verse eid="MAT 21:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 21:4"/>Es bar dey sinnaas raajjuni meyaki kamo ekka yistera makte bar sinanakwa.<verse eid="MAT 21:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 21:5"/>«Tsiyonni katama yistefa Yerusalemuk:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 21:5">‹Ne taatoos garam sinne;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 21:5">hanyaasi naatana diire;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 21:5">neeki yoonirwe› yira makoti» yi.<verse eid="MAT 21:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 21:6"/>Nawobaasakito dey hamere Yesus ajajenaasimato zagsete. <verse eid="MAT 21:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 21:7"/>Hanyaason dey naabaasneen ephphe yeesete. Maybesiison dey hanyaasikitoni geshota kunusseten Yesus barista di. <verse eid="MAT 21:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 21:8"/>Daraasa ganesin showobesiis maybesiison ugnaasta yiir'ete. Oomiis dey i'oni tosha kiir'taafe ugnaasta yiir'et feeseter. <verse eid="MAT 21:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 21:9"/>Sina zeema baassotnawa orfoose hamefe baassotna: «Hosana Dawitni naasik sinfawungwa. Daamiisa sunak yeefe bar suustowa. Hosana den Samak» yit chaagete. <verse eid="MAT 21:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 21:10"/>Yesus Yerusalemni katamaassi girifena kabaasik asuni meya zuuttere: «Haniis oonso?» uuk shorkesete. <verse eid="MAT 21:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 21:11"/>Daraas dey: «Haniis Galiilani daasta fa Naaziret katamaassin ye raajju Yesuswa» yisete.<verse eid="MAT 21:11"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesus Betemeqdesiissi Nagadesefe Baassotin Kalle Kisi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 11:15-19">Mar. 11:15-19</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 19:45-48">Luqa. 19:45-48</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 2:13-22">Yoha. 2:13-22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 21:12"/>Esseen orfo Yesus dey betemeqdesiissi girire kisire waagsefe baassotinnawa geron waagsefe baassotinna zuutire kalle kisi. Waaga soolefe baasso tarabbezasonnawa nakalo waagsefe baasso kodaasonna shelgire ha'i. <verse eid="MAT 21:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 21:13"/>« ‹Ta keyaas shiiphoni keya yisteratu teegtona› yistera tichchewa. Sinuntano nitto bo'inynyani meeni dugadug zagsetiwa» yi.<verse eid="MAT 21:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 21:14"/>Yesus betemeqdesiissi feen aaftishuni meenawa engitni meena barki yeeseten fati. <verse eid="MAT 21:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 21:15"/>Sinuntano maagni gaanynye meenawa Museni tumaasi assinynyaasna Yesus zagina biistera artonoy wuzaasewa betemeqdesiissi «Hosana Dawitni naasik» yit chaaget fa naanggotaasonna biyeteese gi'tesete. <verse eid="MAT 21:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 21:16"/>Baasso dey: «Han naanggotaas maksefana baron aane odefenoso?» yisete. Yesus dey: «Odedifawungwa: ‹Daaga naanggotaaskinnawa tama tamfa daaga naanggotaasi kaamsinna galata ne teetaasik hoossitwa› yifa kaamaason isanne aane feretira biyetinoso?» yi. <verse eid="MAT 21:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 21:17"/>Baassotin beyye katamaassin kesse Bitaniya yistefa ke'eessi hamme esta ha'i.<verse eid="MAT 21:17"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesus Erwina Belesini I'o</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 11:12-14">Mar. 11:12-14</ref>, <ref loc="MRK 11:20-24">20-24</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 21:18"/>Yesus e'so wonsak wolle katama hamfet makte. <verse eid="MAT 21:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 21:19"/>Ugnaasi teshta di isa belesini i'o biyaat ek barki hamin tosha toshatano isa gaanane aane dane. Estan ekka yi: «Hawungneen ekalo neekin isa gaanane bestonaatawe» yi. I'oos dey es kabaasik geregere ichimi. <verse eid="MAT 21:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 21:20"/>Nawobaasakito es baron biyefaat: «Han belesiisi i'oos geregere aakkak ichimiso!» yiset diinqesete. <verse eid="MAT 21:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 21:21"/>Yesus dey wolgire: «Futo nittok makefawungwa; amantonti faafaananenawa awuzakne uu shakaatinena han Belesiista sina barne faaron zagu koi'ba sinnoynaron han aamaasonnu: ‹Waatera yeet baariissi ha'towe› iyaatine sinanawa. <verse eid="MAT 21:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 21:22"/>Amanera shiiphefeti baron zuutira ephphatootiwa» yi.<verse eid="MAT 21:22"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesus Aro Ha'suni Hugnak Wostefenamato Mamuste Mamsu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 11:27-33">Mar. 11:27-33</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:1-8">Luqa. 20:1-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 21:23"/>Yesus betemeqdesiissi girire assifeen maagni gaanynye meenawa daraasa kur'uni meena barki yeesere: «Han baron aro ha'suni hugnakinso zagidifatari? Han ha'suni hugnaason dey neek imaas oonso?» yit mamussete. <verse eid="MAT 21:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 21:24"/>Yesus wolgire: «Isa mamsu nittotin mamsunawa. Es baron taak wolgaatine ta dey han baron aro ha'suni hugnak zagifanamato nittok makonawa. <verse eid="MAT 21:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 21:25"/>Yohannisni haphquus ayin yaarinso? Ha'ooskiningwa wedey asunikininso?» yi. Baasso dey baassotna baassotna ekka yit merkesete: « ‹Ha'ooskingwa› iyaanine ‹Eekin awuni boor'a barik amano beytiso?› yirwa. <verse eid="MAT 21:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 21:26"/>Dey: ‹Asunikingwa› iyaanine asu zuuttambaase Yohannisnin raajju zagire biyefe boor'a daraasin digeniwa» yisete. <verse eid="MAT 21:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 21:27"/>Estan Yesusnik wolgire: «Aane arifeniwa» yisete. Bar dey wolgire: «Ese ta dey aro ha'suni hugnak han baron zuutira zagifanamato aafawa nittok makona wuza» yi.<verse eid="MAT 21:27"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Hep Naanggotiisakitoni Beso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 21:28"/>Tusire Yesus dey ekka yi: «Nittok awu sinna bestefaso? Isa asu hep naanggotba feer. Isaaski tai'sere: ‹Naataaso, hash hawung hamma wayinini akakilti dimaasta wostowa› yi. <verse eid="MAT 21:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 21:29"/>Naas dey wolgire: ‹Beyin, aafa hamana wuza› yi. Sinuntano orfo gaabbere wostok hami. <verse eid="MAT 21:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 21:30"/>Dey hepsaaski tai'sere esiisimato maken naas wolgire: ‹Ma'iwa, hamanawa daamtaaso› yi. Sinuntano aane wostok hame. <verse eid="MAT 21:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 21:31"/>Ese han heppiisasin ababaasa ajajinon zagiis aafferinso?» yi. Baasso dey: «Tesuni barwa» yisete. Yesus dey ekka yi: «Futok nittok makefawungwa; girbo zuutife baassonawa gerkesefe baassotna Ha'oosi taatoossi giruk nittoostan zeemonewa. <verse eid="MAT 21:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 21:32"/>Yohannis ookoni ugnaason nittok besuk yeen barik aane amanoweti. Sinuntano girbo zuutife baassonawa gerkesefe baassona barik amanesete. Nitto es baron biira boor'nitiison harmira aane barik amanoweti.»<verse eid="MAT 21:32"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Wayinini Akakiltini Bulinynyani Beso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 21:33"/>Dey Yesus ekka yi: «Ooma beso dey odotiwa; wayinini akakilti toka isa asu feer. Bar dey biratobaason oja ojje wayinini usha ti'una doo'a yiishshe hoossi. Toolo keer'e bulinynyani meyak imaat ooma daa hami. <verse eid="MAT 21:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 21:34"/>Wayiniis gaanana wona kar'fana kabaasik basa haa'ooson ephphe yoosonek wostinynyabaasakitonin bulinynyani meyaki wosi. <verse eid="MAT 21:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 21:35"/>Bulinynyani meya wostinynyaasakitonin ephphe isaasin ichete; isaasin worsete; oomiisin dey shu'ak ichete. <verse eid="MAT 21:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 21:36"/>Wayinini akakiltiisi aba sinatiistan oom showo wostinynyanin dey wosi. Bulinynyani meya dey zeemotiisimato zagsete. <verse eid="MAT 21:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 21:37"/>Koi'baasta dey Wayiniisi aba: ‹Naataasin digsonewa› iyaat naabaasin wosi. <verse eid="MAT 21:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 21:38"/>Sinuntano bulinynyani meya naasin biyeteese baassotna baassotna: ‹Foshaason tooniis han barwa. Yaani woraat foshaason innor zaguniwa› yisete. <verse eid="MAT 21:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 21:39"/>Naasin dey ephere wayiniisi foshni gerakalo kissere worsete.<verse eid="MAT 21:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 21:40"/>«Eekin wayinini akakiltiisi daam yeefena kabaasik es bulinynyani meyaasta awu zagunirne faar sinna nittok bestefaso?» <verse eid="MAT 21:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 21:41"/>Baasso dey wolgisere: «Es mangu asuni meyanon mangu woru woraattu wayinini akakiltini dimanon wonba wonbaasik gaanbaason imni oom bulinynyani meyak imanawa» yisete.<verse eid="MAT 21:41"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 21:42"/>Tusire dey Yesus baassok Korto matsafaassin ekka yi:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 21:42">« ‹Shu'ni keyaason oo'efe baasso kashshisete shu'aas;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 21:42">keyaasik kajjabaasta duuni shu'a siniwa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 21:42">es bar dey Daamiiskintu siniwa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 21:42">inno aafaasiknu diinqiwa›</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 21:42">yistera tichche baron; aane feretuwetinoso?<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:42 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 118:22-23">Gaama. 118:22-23</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="MAT 21:42"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 21:43"/>«Es bari boor'a nittok makefawungwa; Ha'oosi taato nittoostan oottera gaana gaanni daraasik imtonirwa. [<verse eid="MAT 21:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 21:44"/>Es shu'aasta gande bar eestona; shu'aas basaasta gandona bar zuuttere fichintona.]<verse eid="MAT 21:44"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 21:45"/>«Maagni gaanynye meenawa Ferisawini meena es besoson odesefaat baassosta makenamato arsete. <verse eid="MAT 21:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 21:46"/>Es bari boor'a ephosonek sholsete. Sinuntano daraas raajju zagire biyeter sinna boor'a digsete.»<verse eid="MAT 21:46"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 21"/>
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="MAT 22"/>
  <para style="s1">Sargini Kootaasi Beso</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 14:15-24">Luqa. 14:15-24</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 22:1"/>Hepsa dey Yesus besok ekka yit make: <verse eid="MAT 22:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 22:2"/>«Samaki taatoos naabaasik sargini koota koote taatone faarwa. <verse eid="MAT 22:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 22:3"/>Taatoos teegte asuni meya kootaaski yoosonek wostinynyabaasin baassoki wosi. Sinuntano baasso kootaaski yoosonek aane sholsoto.<verse eid="MAT 22:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 22:4"/>«Hepsa dey taatoos oom wostinynyani meyanon wosire teegte asuni meyaki hamfaat: ‹Ese sargini kootaason hoossin; omorusewa faru moonaase shuktera zuuttambaase hoore. Han sargisi kootaki yootiwa› yira makoti» yi. <verse eid="MAT 22:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 22:5"/>Sinuntano baasso hantaki wuzane unoy beyere isaas bulobaasi; oomiis nagadbaasi hami. <verse eid="MAT 22:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 22:6"/>Oomiis dey wostinynyani meyanon ephphe salphsire ichche worsesete. <verse eid="MAT 22:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 22:7"/>Estan taatoos gi'tere meya taar'osakitonin wosire es wori baassotin worsonek zagi. Katamabesiison dey geyak kiichchonak zagi. <verse eid="MAT 22:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 22:8"/>Estan wostinynyabaasakitonik ekka yi: «Sargini kootaas hoore; sinuntano teegte baasso kootaasik sholsunor sinete. <verse eid="MAT 22:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 22:9"/>Ese ek ari ugnaasta kesfaat danti asusin zuutira han sargini kootaaski teegotiwa» yi. <verse eid="MAT 22:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 22:10"/>Wostinynyani meya dey ari ugnaasta kesere danete baassotin mangusin; ma'aasin zuutire teegsere sargini keyaason tuunisete.<verse eid="MAT 22:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 22:11"/>«Sinuntano taatoos teegte irbaasakitonin biyak keer girifena kabaasik sargini maya maynoy isa asunin estak bi.<verse eid="MAT 22:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 22:12"/>«Estan ekka yi: ‹Zomotaaso; sargini maya maynoy aakkak hansi girisso?› yin asus dey shaakki.<verse eid="MAT 22:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 22:13"/>«Taatoos dey wostinynyabaasakitonin: ‹Kushubaasewa wochobaase asin taar'a gerakalo fa talmaassi kisira ha'utiwa. Estak waasnewa ay'ni koyne sinanawa› » yi. <verse eid="MAT 22:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 22:14"/>Tusire dey Yesus: «Teegte asuni meya showo; kortertes dey garowa.»<verse eid="MAT 22:14"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Girboni Ghowak Mamuste Mamsu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 12:13-17">Mar. 12:13-17</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:20-26">Luqa. 20:20-26</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 22:15"/>Estan Ferisawini meya hamere Yesusnin wolumbaaski kamo aakkak chowusi gedonemato merkesete. <verse eid="MAT 22:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 22:16"/>Baasso nawoni meyanon Herodisni keen sina asuni meyaneen Yesusniki wossere: «Assinynyano! Ne futonir sintamatonawa Ha'oosi ugnanon futok assifatamatona arifeniwa. Asuni digak zagifata wuza aafa. Asunin dey aane korife. <verse eid="MAT 22:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 22:17"/>Ese innok makebbo; neek awu sinna bestefaso? Keesarnik girboni girbo sholsungwa wedey sholsutanso?» yisete. <verse eid="MAT 22:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 22:18"/>Yesus baasso manguuson arifaat: «Sinnoy sinne bestesefe nitto, awuniron taan fattanefetiso? <verse eid="MAT 22:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 22:19"/>Girbo kaastefa birriison taak besibbetiso!» yi. Baasso dey isa diinari teshshere besisete. <verse eid="MAT 22:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 22:20"/>Bar dey: «Han barista fa gitoosewa baristaki fa tichaase oonirinso?» yi. <verse eid="MAT 22:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 22:21"/>Baasso wolgire: «Keesarnirwa» yisete. Bar dey: «Ese Keesarniison keesarnik Ha'oosiron dey Ha'oosik imtiwa» yi. <verse eid="MAT 22:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 22:22"/>Baasso dey es baron odeseteyse wolumbaasik diinqesefaat barin beyere hamete.<verse eid="MAT 22:22"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Kitun Kabuni Chowaasik Mamuste Mamsu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 12:18-27">Mar. 12:18-27</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:27-40">Luqa. 20:27-40</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 22:23"/>Es wono: «Kitun kabu aafa» yisefe Sedukawini meya Yesusniki yeesere ekka yit mamussete: <verse eid="MAT 22:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 22:24"/>«Assinynyano! Muse: ‹Isa asu nawuba koonunoy kitifaanane aybaas es asuson ephphe es kiti aybaasik zalba fu'owowa› yiwa. <verse eid="MAT 22:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 22:25"/>Naafun ayna ayna innoki feeseter. Baassossin arkiis asu ephaat nawa koonunoy kiti. Es bari boor'a ate aybaas es asuson ephi. <verse eid="MAT 22:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 22:26"/>Esiisimato dey hepsaas keezsaas hamma naafunsa kar'ananneen es asuson ephaat kitisete. <verse eid="MAT 22:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 22:27"/>Zuuttambesiise kitisetenneen orfo asus dey kiti. <verse eid="MAT 22:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 22:28"/>Ese naafunobesiise asuson ephetewa, kitun kabuni wono naafuniisasin aafferikinso asu sinanari?»<verse eid="MAT 22:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 22:29"/>Yesus wolgire: «Korto matsafaasikitononnawa Ha'oosi hugnanonna aane arifeti sinna boor'a daagefetiwa. <verse eid="MAT 22:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 22:30"/>Kitun kabsefe kabaasik asuni meya samak faase Ha'oosi wosiyane feertu sinonetano asu aafa ephosone wuza dey aafa girusone wuza. <verse eid="MAT 22:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 22:31"/>Sinuntano kitun kabuni chowaasik Ha'oos nittok makena baron aane feretuwetinoso? <verse eid="MAT 22:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 22:32"/>Ekkatu yiwa: ‹Ta Abrahamni Ha'o, Isaaqni Ha'o, Yaqobni Ha'owa› Es bari boor'a bar hayewni meeni Ha'otano kituni meeni Ha'otawa.» <verse eid="MAT 22:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 22:33"/>Daraas dey es baron odesere assubaasik diinqesete.<verse eid="MAT 22:33"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Zuuttambaase Asiistan Arki Ajaji</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 12:28-34">Mar. 12:28-34</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 10:25-28">Luqa. 10:25-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 22:34"/>Yesus Sedukawini meyanon maksone wuza turuksire shaakkusonek zaginamato Ferisawini meya odeseteyse isarik zuuttesete. <verse eid="MAT 22:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 22:35"/>Baassossin isa Museni tumaasi aru Yesusnin fattanok sholefaat ekka yit mamsi: <verse eid="MAT 22:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 22:36"/>«Assinynyano! Tumaassin aaffa ajajisinso arkiri?» <verse eid="MAT 22:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 22:37"/>Yesus barik wolgire: «Daama Ha'oneeson tuuma nibneesik, tuuma kaaneesik, tuuma safaraneesik keeshtowa. <verse eid="MAT 22:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 22:38"/>Zuuttambaase asiistan denalonewa tesuni ajajiise esiiswa. <verse eid="MAT 22:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 22:39"/>Esiisne fa hepsaniis dey: ‹Asunin ne neen keeshtefataasimato keeshtowa› yifa barwa. <verse eid="MAT 22:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 22:40"/>Tumaasi assunewa raajjuni meeni assuse es hep ajajiistatu kapta zagiwa.»<verse eid="MAT 22:40"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Kiristoos Bar Oo Sinnamato</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 12:35-37">Mar. 12:35-37</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:41-44">Luqa. 20:41-44</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 22:41"/>Ferisawini meya zuuttesere feeseten Yesus ekka yit mamsi: <verse eid="MAT 22:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 22:42"/>«Kiristoosni chowaas nittok awu sinna bestefaso? Bar ooni naaso?» Baasso dey wolgire: «Dawitni naawa» yisete. <verse eid="MAT 22:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 22:43"/>Yesus ekka yi: «Eekin Dawit Ha'oni Ayyanak tuumme aakkak ‹Daamta› yire teegeso?<verse eid="MAT 22:43"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 22:44"/>« ‹Ha'oos, Daamtaasin; <note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:44 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 110:1">Gaama. 110:1</ref>.</char></note></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 22:44">gumaneesin wochoneesi sikalosi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 22:44">yer'atak zagunanneen;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 22:44">hoi'ta teshnaasta duwa› yiwa.<verse eid="MAT 22:44"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 22:45"/>«Dawit teetbaasik: ‹Daamta› yire teegenanneen eekin Kiristoos aakkak nawuba sinnirinso?» yi. <verse eid="MAT 22:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 22:46"/>Baassossin isa kaamanu wolguk chimar oonu aafe. Es wononeen barin mamsuk chimar oonu aafe.<verse eid="MAT 22:46"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 22"/>
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="MAT 23"/>
  <para style="s1">Museni Tumaasi Assinynyani Meenawa Ferisawini Meena Asi Mangu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 12:38-39">Mar. 12:38-39</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 11:43-46">Luqa. 11:43-46</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:45-46">20:45-46</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 23:1"/>Esseen orfo Yesus daraasiknawa nawobaasakitonikna ekka yire make: <verse eid="MAT 23:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 23:2"/>«Museni tumaasi assinynyanawa Ferisawini meena Museni kodaasta diisetewa. <verse eid="MAT 23:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 23:3"/>Es bari boor'a baasso maksefe baron zuutira zagsoti dey oodti. Sinuntano baasso maksefe baron wostota aane feeshisefe sinna boor'a wostesefe baron zagutiita. <verse eid="MAT 23:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 23:4"/>Faya dey wor'ak chimtonoy ba'a taar'e asuni ogogta wossisefe. Sinuntano baasso kushubesiisi waa'aknu ta'uk isanne aane sholsefe. <verse eid="MAT 23:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 23:5"/>Asu baassotin biyanaktu wostobesiison wostesefe. Kur'amabesiison<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">23:5 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Israelni meya Ha'obesiisi ajajinon safarok es kur'amaassi tichisere suutbesiissinawa sinbesiistana taar'efe.</char></note> taggisere shiiphoni kabak maytefa maambesiisi fashanon dey dichisefe. <verse eid="MAT 23:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 23:6"/>Koota maastefanaasta ulfinto dima, Ayhudni shiiphoni keyaassik dey ulfinni kodta duuktu sholsefe. <verse eid="MAT 23:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 23:7"/>Gabaastak asu baassotin naga ooshshonaknawa: ‹Assinynyano!› yire teegsoneknatu sholsefe. <verse eid="MAT 23:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 23:8"/>Sinuntano nitto assinynyantiis isar sinna boor'anawa nitto zuuttamnitiise dey ayna ayna sineti boor'ana ‹Assinynya› yistera teegtotiitawa. <verse eid="MAT 23:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 23:9"/>Den samak fe Abantiis isar sinna boor'a han daastak ooninnu: ‹Aabba› yira teegotiitawa. <verse eid="MAT 23:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 23:10"/>Nitto arki assinynyantiis isa Kiristoos sinna boor'a ooniknu ‹Arki assinynya› yistera teegtotiitawa. <verse eid="MAT 23:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 23:11"/>Nittoossin denalo sina bar nitto wostinynya sinowa. <verse eid="MAT 23:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 23:12"/>Teetbaason den teggife bar daa hatona. Teetbaason daa hatessife bar den teguna.»<verse eid="MAT 23:12"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesus Tumaasi Assinynyani Meyanonnawa Ferisawini Meyanonna Ke'i</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 12:40">Mar. 12:40</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 11:39-42">Luqa. 11:39-42</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 11:44">44</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 11:52">52</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:47">20:47</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 23:13"/>Dey Yesus ekka yi: «Asu samaki taatosi girunoynamato gamalaason kulfife sinnoy sinne bestefe Museni tumaasi assinynyani meenawa Ferisawini meena haybuntiwa! Nitto teetaasik giruk aane sholefeti dey giruni baassotin aane gedfetiwa.<verse eid="MAT 23:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 23:14"/>[«Nitto sinnoy sinne bestefe Museni tumaasi assinynyani meenawa Ferisawini meena shiiphontiison dichuk dicha asusikitoni keyaason maara turuksifeti boor'a haybuntiwa. Ese akama mangsuni kar'atu ephphatootiwa.]<verse eid="MAT 23:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 23:15"/>«Sinnoy sinne bestefe Museni tumaasi assinynyani meenawa Ferisawini meena haybuntiwa. Isa asu nitto amantooson ephphetoonak zaguk Baariistanawa ichma daastana biratesefeti. Ma'i yire ephpheteenanneen orfo nittoostan denalo hep kushunon geeni tir'maassi girunak hoorer zagsefeti.<verse eid="MAT 23:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 23:16"/>«Nitto aaftishu zoonsino! Haybuntiwa! ‹Asu betemeqdesiisik teyifaanane aafa aguna wuza› yifeti. Sinuntano ‹Betemeqdesiissiki fa warqeesik teyifaanane es teyyaasik ootterwa› yifeti. <verse eid="MAT 23:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 23:17"/>Nitto gowwa dey aaftishu; warqesingwa warqeeson korto zagi betemeqdesinoso wayyayi? <verse eid="MAT 23:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 23:18"/>Esiisimato dey: ‹Asu shoo'aasik teyifaanane aafa aguna wuza; Sinuntano barista kuni maa'aasik teyifaanane es teyyaasik ootterwa› yifeti. <verse eid="MAT 23:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 23:19"/>Nitto aaftishu; maa'aasingwa maa'aason korto zagi shoo'asinso wayyayi? <verse eid="MAT 23:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 23:20"/>Es bari boor'a shoo'aasik teyife bar shoo'aasiknawa shoo'aasta kuni maa'aasiknatu teyifewa. <verse eid="MAT 23:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 23:21"/>Betemeqdesiisik teyife bar betemeqdesiisiknawa barissi fa wuzasiknatu teyifewa. <verse eid="MAT 23:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 23:22"/>Samaasik teyife bar Ha'oosi zigimuknawa barista diifa bariknatu teyifewa.<verse eid="MAT 23:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 23:23"/>«Sinnoy sinne bestefe Museni tumaasi assinynyani meenawa Ferisawini meena haybuntiwa. Azmachakin, insilaalikinnawa kemunikinna asiriissin isaron imfeti. Sinuntano tumaassi fa inya inya wuzasikitonon beyfeti. Es barikito dey futoni mangsuni kar'a, fakiya, amanto asu sinne bestooswa. Ek baron beynoy han baron dey zagutik sholsifawa. <verse eid="MAT 23:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 23:24"/>Nitto aaftishu zoonsino! Ushfeti wuzaassin kolachooson naalla kisira ha'aat gaalane fa inya wuzason koor'fetiwa.<verse eid="MAT 23:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 23:25"/>«Sinnoy sinne bestefe Museni tumaasi assinynyanawa Ferisawini meena habuntiwa. Sikalobesiis bo'onewa tiittanne tuumma feentu toofosewa koranaase asi tukanon kayimsifetiwa. <verse eid="MAT 23:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 23:26"/>Ne aaftishu Ferisawi! Zeemma toofosewa koranaase asi sikalonon massa kaynuwa. Estan gerakalobaasneen kayma sinanawa.<verse eid="MAT 23:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 23:27"/>«Sinnoy sinne bestefe Museni tumaasi assinynyani meenawa Ferisawini meena yerefawutiwa. Sikalobesiis kituni meeni megaknawa kiinakna tuumma feen gerakalobesiis boorok maattera keeshira kuni moogasne feeseterwa. <verse eid="MAT 23:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 23:28"/>Esiisimato nitto dey gerok asunik ookone feer sinnatu biistefetiwa. Sinuntano sikalontiis sinnoy sinne bestoknawa mangukna tuumma faarwa.<verse eid="MAT 23:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 23:29"/>«Sinnoy sinne bestefe Museni tumaasi assinynyani meenawa Ferisawini meena habuntiwa. Raajjuni meeni moogaason shu'ak keer'etir, ookoni meeni moogaason dey keeshshira ma'issetir.<verse eid="MAT 23:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 23:30"/>« ‹Zeemoti abaniisa meeni neyak inno faani sinfaanane raajjuni meeni hannaason baassoneen ane sinna wuukuni kabatawa› yifetiwa. <verse eid="MAT 23:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 23:31"/>Ese raajjuni meyanon wori baasso naanggota sinnitiison nitto teetaasik zaala maketiwa. <verse eid="MAT 23:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 23:32"/>Ese nitto abaasakito gatisete baron nitto koi'sitiwa. <verse eid="MAT 23:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 23:33"/>Nitto zawa, ufoni naanggota geeni tir'maasi ke'osin aakkak eella kesak chimatirinso? <verse eid="MAT 23:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 23:34"/>Es bari boor'a ta raajjuni meyanon, techumni meyanon, assinynyani meyanon nittoki wosunawa. Baassotin dey worsoti, suutati, Ayhudni shiiphoni keyaassik ichati. Isa katamaassin ooma katamaassi kabgira kofkuti. <verse eid="MAT 23:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 23:35"/>Es bari boor'a ooko sina Abelni hannaastan kabira betemeqdesiissinawa maa'a imtefana shoo'aasi ganesi worseti Berakiyyani naa Zakkariyasni hannaasta kar'ananneen han daasta wuukte ookoni meeni hannaasik ke'o nittoosta kar'nirwa. <verse eid="MAT 23:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 23:36"/>Futok nittok makefawungwa, han ke'oos zuuttambaase han koontoosta kar'nirwa» yi.<verse eid="MAT 23:36"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesus Yerusalemik Waasi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 23:37"/>Tusire dey Yesus: «Yerusalemne Yerusalemne! Raajjuni meyanon worifa ne! Neeki wostere ye baassotin shu'ak ichfa ne! Ako nawubaasikitonon kosobaassi zuutifanaysimato ta dey naanggotneesikitonon zuutunak apuna wolla sholense! Sinuntano nitto aane sholoweti. <verse eid="MAT 23:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 23:38"/>Ese keentiis ona sinnatu ha'tona. <verse eid="MAT 23:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 23:39"/>Nittok makefawungwa, ‹Daamiisa sunak yeefe bar suustowa› utinneen hanneen ekalo taan aafawa biyati wuza.»<verse eid="MAT 23:39"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 23"/>
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="MAT 24"/>
  <para style="s1">Yesus Betemeqdesiis Boktonamato Raaji Make</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 13:1-2">Mar. 13:1-2</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:5-6">Luqa. 21:5-6</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 24:1"/>Yesus betemeqdesin kesse hamfeen nawobaasakito shu'ak keete betemeqdesiison besuk barki tai'sesete. <verse eid="MAT 24:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 24:2"/>Sinuntano Yesus wolgire: «Han baron zuutira biitiyoso? Futo nittok makefawungwa; boktonoy shu'aas shu'aasta diira fui'tonir aafawa.»<verse eid="MAT 24:2"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Daamiis Yoonanneen Zeemma Kar'ni Kabugtonewa Shanane</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 13:3-13">Mar. 13:3-13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:8-19">Luqa. 21:8-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 24:3"/>Bar Dabrazayitini kumaasta diifen nawobaas baasso baasso barki tai'sesere: «Innok makowa; han bar aagenso sinanari? Ne yoosewa han daasi koi'ni besone aambanso?» yit mamussete.<verse eid="MAT 24:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 24:4"/>Yesus wolgire: «Oonu nittotin eshanaatawa! <verse eid="MAT 24:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 24:5"/>Showobesiis ‹Ta Kiristooswa!› yit ta sunaasik yoosone. Showobesiisin dey eshone. <verse eid="MAT 24:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 24:6"/>Neebonewa neeboni odune odoti. Es bar dey sinanak sholsu sinna boor'a digotiita. Sinuntano koi'baas hanneengwa. <verse eid="MAT 24:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 24:7"/>Daraas daraasata; taatoos taatoosta kabuna. Maknewa daani shorkone showo dimsi sinana. <verse eid="MAT 24:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 24:8"/>Es bar zuuttera kophoni merosi keektone faarwa. <verse eid="MAT 24:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 24:9"/>Es kabaasik asuni meya nitto shana ephphatootik aatire imone dey worsone. Ta sunaasi boor'a dara zuuttambaase asi sina oomtester sinati. <verse eid="MAT 24:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 24:10"/>Es kabaasik showoni meya tuusa'sere orfo wolsone. Isaas oomiisin aatire imana. Asuni meya dey baassotna baassotna wal oomtososone. <verse eid="MAT 24:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 24:11"/>Showo esh raajjuni meya kabsone. Showo meyanon dey eshone. <verse eid="MAT 24:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 24:12"/>Manguusi aatamtan kabi chowa showoni meeni keeshtanaas koochona. <verse eid="MAT 24:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 24:13"/>Sinuntano koi'ba kar'ananneen chimme yere bar faruna. <verse eid="MAT 24:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 24:14"/>Dara zuuttambaase asik zaala sinanak Ha'oosi taatoni misirachchuni kaamaas daa zuuttambaase asiista maktona. Es kabaasiktu koi'baas yoona.<verse eid="MAT 24:14"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Digsu Shana</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 13:14-23">Mar. 13:14-23</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:20-24">Luqa. 21:20-24</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 24:15"/>«Ese raajju Danielnik maktenaasimato ‹Kiinsuni mangu wuzaas› korto dimaasta yerefeen biifena kabaasik feretife bar yaadatowowa. <verse eid="MAT 24:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 24:16"/>Es kabaasik Yuuda feese baasso den aamaaski eelosotowa. <verse eid="MAT 24:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 24:17"/>Keyaasi tukta fe bar keyaassi fa wuzason ephanak keronaata. <verse eid="MAT 24:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 24:18"/>Bulota fe bar maybaason ephanak orfo wolunaata. <verse eid="MAT 24:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 24:19"/>Es kabaasik naaner asusikitonewa tama tanifa barikitone haybubawungwa. <verse eid="MAT 24:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 24:20"/>Ese eelati wonaas yeeshu wedey beysani wonak sinnoynamato shiiphsoti. <verse eid="MAT 24:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 24:21"/>Es kabaasik han daas testenanneen kabira hawung kar'a sinnor hanneen ekalo dey isanne sinnor akama shana sinanawa. <verse eid="MAT 24:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 24:22"/>Es wonaasikito kawuna shaki sinfaanane asha mayoos zuuttere fui'tona kabatawa. Sinuntano kortere fe asuni meeni boor'a es wonaasikito kawunana.<verse eid="MAT 24:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 24:23"/>«Es kabaasik oonu: ‹Ese Kiristoos hanta feer› wedey ‹Ekesta feer yifaanane amanotiitawa› <verse eid="MAT 24:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 24:24"/>Eshni Kiristoosni meenawa eshni raajjuni meena kabsone. Baassok chimtefaanane kortere feese baassotinnu daagsuk akama akama biistera artonoy wuznewa diinqine bessone.<verse eid="MAT 24:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 24:25"/>«Ese han baron zuutira zeemma nittok makengwa. <verse eid="MAT 24:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 24:26"/>Es bari boor'a: ‹Zaboossitu fewa› yisefaatene kesatiita. ‹Aacho dimsitu fewa› yisefaatene amanotiitawa. <verse eid="MAT 24:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 24:27"/>Kawuna kawunna awakesnarkin awagirinarki biistefanaasimato Asuni Naani yoos dey esiisimatotu sinana. <verse eid="MAT 24:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 24:28"/>Kitu wuza faanaastatu arikasaas zuuttefa.<verse eid="MAT 24:28"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Kiristoosni Hepsa Wolle Yoo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 13:24-27">Mar. 13:24-27</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:25-28">Luqa. 21:25-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 24:29"/>«Es shanani wonaasikito aatnanneen orfo geregere awaas talmona; assaas dey chaarefbaason kalana; baakuraasikito dey samastan kere woottona; samaastaki hugnaasikito shorkona. <verse eid="MAT 24:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 24:30"/>Estan Asuni Naani beso samaasta bestona. Es kabaasik han daasta fe daraas zuuttere waassone. Asuni Naa dey akama hugnaknawa akama ulfinakna shaaruusikitota yeefeen biyone. <verse eid="MAT 24:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 24:31"/>Akama markatani kaama odsuni Ha'oosi wosiyaasikitonon wosuna. Baasso dey samaasi diltan hamma dilbaasta kar'a fa acheech fashaassi hamere barik kortere feese baassotin zuutusone» yi.<verse eid="MAT 24:31"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Belesini I'oosi Beso</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 13:28-31">Mar. 13:28-31</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:29-33">Luqa. 21:29-33</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 24:32"/>Tusire dey Yesus: «Han belesini i'oosi besostan biira aruti. Waa'baas boodera tosha kotfana kabaasik begani assa ta'baason arutiwa. <verse eid="MAT 24:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 24:33"/>Esiisimato nitto dey es baron zuutira biyefeti kabaasik wonaas yaara finynyi tai'namato arutiwa. <verse eid="MAT 24:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 24:34"/>Futo nittok makefawungwa; es bar zuuttera sinana kabaneen han koontoos aafa aatana wuza. <verse eid="MAT 24:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 24:35"/>Samaasewa daase aatana; sinuntano kaamnaasikito isanne aafa aatana wuza.»<verse eid="MAT 24:35"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Daamiis Yoona Wonaasewa Sa'atiise Oonu Aane Arife</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 13:32-37">Mar. 13:32-37</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 17:26-30">Luqa. 17:26-30</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 17:34-36">34-36</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 24:36"/>Dey Yesus: «Es wonaasewa es sa'atiise asin Abaasteno samaki wosiyaasnu sinun Naaso sino oonu arifer aafe. <verse eid="MAT 24:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 24:37"/>Noohni neyaasik sinnaasimato Asuni Naani yoos dey ekkatu sinana. <verse eid="MAT 24:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 24:38"/>Es neyaasik tishuni akaastan zeemma Nooh Merkebiissi girina wononeen asuni meya meetnawa ushetna; ephetnawa giritna feeseter. <verse eid="MAT 24:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 24:39"/>Tishuni akaas yaara zuuttambesiise asin tishkunanneen aane arsoto. Asuni Naani yoos dey esiisimatotu sinana. <verse eid="MAT 24:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 24:40"/>Es kabaasik hep asuni meya buloni dimta ane wostosone. Isaas oottona; isaas fui'tona. <verse eid="MAT 24:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 24:41"/>Hep mashkasu isa dimta meya ni'ona; isaas oottona isaas fui'tona. <verse eid="MAT 24:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 24:42"/>Ese nitto Daamiis aro sa'atita yoonamato aane aruweti sinna boor'a guzira oodti. <verse eid="MAT 24:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 24:43"/>Sinuntano isa wuza arutiwa; keeni abaas waalaasi aaffa sa'atiista wiis yoonamato ari sinfaanane guzire keebaas dey yiishtonoynamato kalana kabawa. <verse eid="MAT 24:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 24:44"/>Esiisimato Asuni Naa dey nitto arunoyti sa'atiista yoonir sinna boor'a hoorera oodtiwa.»<verse eid="MAT 24:44"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Amanamto Wostinynyaasnawa Mangu Wostinynyaasna Asi Beso</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 12:41-48">Luqa. 12:41-48</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 24:45"/>Dey Yesus: «Muubesiison sholsinaastak imonek daambaas keerki fe asusata taassina amanamto dey nibbare yere wostinynyaas oonso? <verse eid="MAT 24:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 24:46"/>Daambaas yeefena kabaasik ekka zagifeen danana es wostinynyaas suustowa. <verse eid="MAT 24:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MAT 24:47"/>Futo nittok makefawungwa; es wostinynyaasin fa waagba zuuttambaase asiistatu taassunawa. <verse eid="MAT 24:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MAT 24:48"/>Sinuntano es mangu wostinynyaas: ‹Daamtaas wokketu yoonawa› yit nibbaassi safarefaananenawa, <verse eid="MAT 24:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MAT 24:49"/>Wostoni zomoba sina baassotin ichak kabifaananena zayini meyaneen ane meere ushfaanane; <verse eid="MAT 24:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="MAT 24:50"/>Es wostinynyaasa daam bar arunoyna wonaknawa oodnoyna sa'atikna yoona. <verse eid="MAT 24:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="MAT 24:51"/>Es wostinynyaasin heppik kalasire ixabaason dey sinnoy sinne bestesefe baassoneen ane zaguna. Estak waasnewa ay'ni koyet foone sinana» yi.<verse eid="MAT 24:51"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 24"/>
  <chapter number="25" style="c" sid="MAT 25"/>
  <para style="s1">Asir Durba Naanggotaasikitoni Beso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 25:1"/>Tusire dey Yesus: «Es kabaasik samaki taatoos tonbesiison ephere mariisin ephak hoorera kesa asir durba naanggotane faarwa. <verse eid="MAT 25:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 25:2"/>Baassossin uuchiis gowwa; uuchiis dey techumba faanar. <verse eid="MAT 25:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 25:3"/>Gowwaasikito tonbaason ephefanaknu ooma fu'tana zayiti aane ephowa. <verse eid="MAT 25:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 25:4"/>Techumba faana barikito tonaasneen ane ooma dayto zayiti ephese. <verse eid="MAT 25:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 25:5"/>Mariis wokbaase zuuttere afay' ephaan kunesete.<verse eid="MAT 25:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 25:6"/>«Wassi daani kixxe sinfana kabaasik: ‹Ese mariis ye kessa ephoti› yifa womo odte. <verse eid="MAT 25:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 25:7"/>Es kabaasik es durba naanggotaasikito zuuttera kabi tonbaason hoossise. <verse eid="MAT 25:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 25:8"/>Gowwa durba naanggotaasikito techumba faana barikitoki: ‹Inno tonaas tishunir sinna boor'a nitto zayitiistan innok imotiwe› yise. <verse eid="MAT 25:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 25:9"/>Sinuntano techumba faana durba naanggotaas wolgira: ‹Nittoknawa innokna hooroni zayiti innoki aafa; ek hamma waagtefana keyaassin nittoron waagsoti› yise. <verse eid="MAT 25:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 25:10"/>Gowwa durba naanggotaas waagonak hamefana kabaasik mariis ye. Hoorera fa durba naanggotaas mariisneen ane sargisi koota faanaasta girsete; gamalaas dey kulufte.<verse eid="MAT 25:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 25:11"/>«Orfo fu'te durba naanggotaasikito yaasera: ‹Daamiiso! Daamiiso! Innok gachaywa› yise. <verse eid="MAT 25:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 25:12"/>Sinuntano bar wolgire: ‹Futo nittok makefawungwe; ta nittotin aane arifat› yi. <verse eid="MAT 25:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 25:13"/>Ese wonaasewa sa'atiise aane arifeti sinna boor'a guzira oodti.»<verse eid="MAT 25:13"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Mekiliti Imtena Keez Wostinynyani Meeni Beso</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 19:11-27">Luqa. 19:11-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 25:14"/>Tusire dey Yesus ooma beso make: «Samaki taatoossi giruni chowaas ekkatu sinana; ooma daa hamak kesa isa asu wostinynyabaasakitonin teegere fa waagbaason imnaaysimatowa. <verse eid="MAT 25:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 25:15"/>Es Daamiis isa isarbesiisik hugnabaasimato isaasik uuch mekiliti; hepsaasik hep mekiliti, keezsaasik isa mekiliti imaat hami. <verse eid="MAT 25:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 25:16"/>Uuch mekiliti epha bar hamme nagadere ooma uuch mekiliti buu'si. <verse eid="MAT 25:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 25:17"/>Esiisimato hep mekiliti epha bar hamme nagadere ooma hep mekiliti buu'si. <verse eid="MAT 25:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 25:18"/>Sinuntano isa mekiliti epha bar daambaasa waaganon taamme daason yiishshe yiiti. <verse eid="MAT 25:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 25:19"/>Showo wonaneen orfo es wostinynyaasakitoni daam yeere baassoneen ane faadu ephi. <verse eid="MAT 25:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 25:20"/>Uuch mekiliti epha bar yeere ooma uuch mekiliti buu'sire: ‹Daamiiso! Ne taak uuch mekilititu imitwa; ese ta ooma uuch mekiliti buui'singwa› yi. <verse eid="MAT 25:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 25:21"/>Daambaas dey: ‹Ne ma'ar dey amanamto wostinynyawa; garo kiisku wuzaasik amanamto sinit sinna boor'a ta akama wuzaasta neen taatsunawa; hang yaara daamneesa girasi giruwa› yi. <verse eid="MAT 25:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 25:22"/>Hep mekiliti epha bar dey tai'sere: ‹Daamiiso hep mekilititu taak imitwa; ese dey ooma hep mekiliti buu'singwa› yi. <verse eid="MAT 25:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 25:23"/>Daambaas dey: ‹Ne ma'ar dey amanamto wostinynya; garo kiisku wuzaasik amanamto sinta boor'a ta akama wuzaastatu neen taatsunawa. Yaara daamneesa girasi giruwa› yi. <verse eid="MAT 25:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 25:24"/>Isa mekiliti epha bar tai'sere: ‹Daamiiso buknoyta dimaastan kar'tar; sikonoyta dimaastan zuutitar; ne keena budu asu sinneeson aringwa. <verse eid="MAT 25:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 25:25"/>Es bari boor'a digefaattu hamma dey waagneeson daason yiishsha yiitingwa. Esewa; waagnees hanifawa› yi. <verse eid="MAT 25:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 25:26"/>Daambaas dey wolgire: ‹Ne mangu dey awuja wostinynya; ta buknoyna dimaastan kar'ar; sikonoyna dimaastan zuutinar sinnaason aritar sinnanneen; <verse eid="MAT 25:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 25:27"/>Ese waagnaason nagadere buu'suni baassok imit sinfaanane ma'ar sinanan kabawa; estan ta dey yaara mekilitinaason buu'baasneen ane ephana kabawa. <verse eid="MAT 25:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 25:28"/>Ese waagaason basa kushuussin ephpha asir mekiliti faana barik imtiwa. <verse eid="MAT 25:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 25:29"/>Faana barik dayistona dey arkuna; sinuntano garo kiisku faana barkin es fa barnu basaastan oottona. <verse eid="MAT 25:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 25:30"/>Han ke'noy wostinynyaasin ek gero fa talmaassi kisira ha'utiwa; estak waasnewa ay'ni koyne sinana› yi.<verse eid="MAT 25:30"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Han Daasi Koi'ni Wono Sinni Mangsuni Kar'a</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 25:31"/>«Asuni Naa Ha'oosi wosiya zuuttambaaseneen ane ulfinbaasik yeefena kabaasik ulfinni zigimubaasta duuna. <verse eid="MAT 25:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 25:32"/>Dara zuuttere barki sina zuuttosone. Keemeriis fantuuson fizoossin korifenaasimato bar dey daraasin baassotna baassotna asin koruna. <verse eid="MAT 25:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 25:33"/>Fantuusikitonon hoi'ta teshbaasta fizoosikitonon dey alda teshbaasta yeetuna. <verse eid="MAT 25:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 25:34"/>Estan taatoos dey ho'itbaasta yere baassok ekka una: ‹Abataas suusna nitto yootiwa. Han daas testenanneen kabira nittok hoorera fa taatooson ephphatootiwa. <verse eid="MAT 25:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 25:35"/>Maktena maasiti; iktena ushiti; Irba sinna nittoki yaana irbasiti. <verse eid="MAT 25:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 25:36"/>Atatu kutina maysiti; mettena mamsiti; taatena yaara mamsiti.› <verse eid="MAT 25:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 25:37"/>Ookoni meya dey wolgire ekka usone: ‹Daamiiso ne makten biira aage maasiniso? Wedey ikten biira aage ushiniso? <verse eid="MAT 25:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 25:38"/>Irba sinna yeen aage neen irbasiniso? Wedey atatu kutifeen biira aage neen maysiniso? <verse eid="MAT 25:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 25:39"/>Metten wedey taaten aage neeki yaara mamsiniso?› <verse eid="MAT 25:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 25:40"/>Taatoos dey wolgire: ‹Futok nittok makefawungwa; zuuttambesiise asiistan ater sina han aytaasakitonisin isaasik zagiti bar taaktu zagitiwa› una. <verse eid="MAT 25:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 25:41"/>Estan alda teshaasta yerse baassok dey ekka una: ‹Nitto erwutto; dabulosniknawa wosibaasikitokna hoore koi'ba foonto geyaassi hantan hamtiwa. <verse eid="MAT 25:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 25:42"/>Maktena aane maasuweti; Iktena aane ushuweti. <verse eid="MAT 25:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 25:43"/>Irba sinna yaana aane irbasuweti; atatu kutina aane maysuweti; mettena dey taatena aane mamsuweti› <verse eid="MAT 25:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 25:44"/>Baasso dey wolugsere: ‹Daamiiso makten wedey ikten; irba sinna yeen wedey atatu sinna kutifeen; metten wedey taaten biira aage argasu beynisso?› usone. <verse eid="MAT 25:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 25:45"/>Taatoos dey: ‹Futo nittok makefawungwa; zuuttambesiise asiistan ater sina han aytaasakitonisin isaasik zagu beyti bar taak zagu beytimatowa› yire wolguna. <verse eid="MAT 25:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 25:46"/>Es bari boor'a es baasso koi'ba foonto ke'oni keer hamone; sinuntano ookoni meya dey koi'ba foonto kaani keer hamone.»<verse eid="MAT 25:46"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 25"/>
  <chapter number="26" style="c" sid="MAT 26"/>
  <para style="s1">Ayhudni Meya Yesusnin Woruk Chowa Sholsete</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 14:1-2">Mar. 14:1-2</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:1-2">Luqa. 22:1-2</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 11:45-53">Yoha. 11:45-53</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 26:1"/>Yesus es kaamaason zuutire makere koi'sinaase nawobaasakitonik: <verse eid="MAT 26:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 26:2"/>«Hep wonaneen orfo faasikani heeboos sinanamato aridifeti. Asuni Naa dey suuttonak aattere imtonirwa» yi.<verse eid="MAT 26:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 26:3"/>Es kabaasik maagni gaanynye meenawa daraasa kur'uni meena Keyyaffa yistefe maagni gaanynye meeni gaanynyaasa ojni keerkalo zuuttesete. <verse eid="MAT 26:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 26:4"/>Estak dey Yesusnin aacho ugnak ephoneknawa worsonekna merkesete. <verse eid="MAT 26:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 26:5"/>Sinuntano: «Daraasa ganesi naga tishuna boor'a heeboni wonaasik aafa sinanawuza» yisete.<verse eid="MAT 26:5"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Isa Mashkasu Yesusnin Shitto Woshshi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 14:3-9">Mar. 14:3-9</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 12:1-8">Yoha. 12:1-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 26:6"/>Yesus zeemo sinak awataatoni mettan sina Bitaniyaki Simonni keertu fe. <verse eid="MAT 26:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 26:7"/>Estak muu muunak tai'sere feen isa mashkasu waagba akama chima shitto albastiros yiste bilqadisi tuumanon ephpha barki yaara teetbaasta wuuki. <verse eid="MAT 26:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 26:8"/>Nawobaasakito es baron biire haaresefaat: «Han shitoos awuni boor'a baak ke'nor siniso? <verse eid="MAT 26:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 26:9"/>Hamma akama waagsi waagtera tukamni meyak imtona kabawa» yisete. <verse eid="MAT 26:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 26:10"/>Yesus es baron arifaat ekka yi: «Bar taak ma'a wuzatu zagiwa. Asuson awuniron hopsidifetirinso? <verse eid="MAT 26:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 26:11"/>Tukamni meya wonna wonna nittoneen anetu foosonewa. Sinuntano ta wonna wonna nittoneen ane aafawa foona wuza. <verse eid="MAT 26:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 26:12"/>Bar han shittooson atunaasta wuukinaas ta moogsi kabbartonak hoossukwa. <verse eid="MAT 26:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 26:13"/>Futo nittok makefawungwa; aytaknu sinun han Misirachchuni kaamaas daa zuuttambaase asiistak maktefana kabaasik bar taak zagina bar dey baron safarok maktettu foonawa.»<verse eid="MAT 26:13"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yuuda Yesusnin Aatire Imanak Merke</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 14:10-11">Mar. 14:10-11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:3-6">Luqa. 22:3-6</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 26:14"/>Es kabaasik Askorotki Yuuda yistefe asire heppe nawobaasasin isaas maagni gaanynye meyaki hamme: <verse eid="MAT 26:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 26:15"/>«Ta Yesusnin aatira nittok imaanane awu taak imatirinso?» yi. Baasso dey keezasir shu'ni birri imete. <verse eid="MAT 26:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 26:16"/>Es sa'atiistan kabire aatire imana ma'a ugna sholet feer.<verse eid="MAT 26:16"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesus Ayhudni Meeni Faasikaason Wosini Meyaneen Ane Me</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 14:12-21">Mar. 14:12-21</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:7-14">Luqa. 22:7-14</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 22:21-23">21-23</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 13:21-30">Yoha. 13:21-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 26:17"/>Kixxa maastefana heeboosi tesuni wono nawobaasakito Yesusniki tai'sesere: «Faasikani heeboosi meeta'unon muutak ay hoossunik sholefatso?» yisete. <verse eid="MAT 26:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 26:18"/>Bar dey: «Ek katamaassi hamfeti kabaasik danati asusa keer hamfaat: ‹Assinynyaas: sa'atinaas yaara kar'i; nawotaasakitoneen ane faasikani heeboosi meeta'unon neeki keertu zagunawa yifewa› utiwa» yi. <verse eid="MAT 26:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 26:19"/>Nawobaasakito dey Yesus ajajenaasimato zagsete. Faasikani heeboosi meeta'unon dey hoossisete. <verse eid="MAT 26:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 26:20"/>Waalfana kabaasik Yesus asire heppe nawobaasakitoneen ane muuk diisesete. <verse eid="MAT 26:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 26:21"/>Meesefeen Yesus: «Futo nittok makefawungwa, nittoossin isaas taan aatire imnirwa» yi. <verse eid="MAT 26:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 26:22"/>Isa isarbesiis akamanon suumesere: «Daamiiso; tawa iyaatoso?» yiset mamussete. <verse eid="MAT 26:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 26:23"/>Yesus wolgire: «Taneen ane koranaassi dukife bartu taan aatire imnirwa. <verse eid="MAT 26:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 26:24"/>Asuni Naa barik tichchenaasimato kituk hamnirwa. Sinuntano Asuni Naanin aatire imni bar haybubawowa. Es asus koonto shaki sinfaanane barik wayyawa» <verse eid="MAT 26:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 26:25"/>Aatire imni Yuuda dey wolgire: «Assinynyano; tawa iyaatoso?» yi. Yesus dey: «Ne maketaasimatowa» yi.<verse eid="MAT 26:25"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Daamiisa Meeta'uni Tuma</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 14:22-26">Mar. 14:22-26</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:15-20">Luqa. 22:15-20</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 26:26"/>Meesefeen Yesus tushaason ephphe galattefaat batte nawobaasakitonik: «Esewa, muutiwa; haniis ashnaaswa» yi. <verse eid="MAT 26:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 26:27"/>Toofooson dey ephphe galattefaat: «Zuuttamnitiise han toofoossin ushtiwa. <verse eid="MAT 26:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 26:28"/>Haniis showo asuni meeni boor'aas feeshun ustonak wuuktoni gaddo teyyaasi harinnaaswa. <verse eid="MAT 26:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 26:29"/>Sinuntano nittok makefawungwa; abataasa taatosi nittoneen ane han gaddo wayinini gaanni ushanon ushananneen hawungneen ekalo hepsi aafawa ushanawuza» yi. <verse eid="MAT 26:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 26:30"/>Gaama gaametenneen orfo den Dabrazayitini kumaasta kesete. <figure style="fig" alt="Jesus eating last supper with disciples" file="CN01803B.tif" size="span" ref="26:26">Yesus nawobaasneen ane koi'ni meeta'uson meedife </figure><verse eid="MAT 26:30"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Phexiros Mormonamato Yesus Zeemme Make</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 14:27-31">Mar. 14:27-31</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:31-34">Luqa. 22:31-34</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 13:36-38">Yoha. 13:36-38</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 26:31"/>Estan Yesus: « ‹Keemeriisin ichana; fantuusi wodo dey siktona› yistera tichchera faar sinna boor'a hawungti waalaasik zuuttamnitiise taan mormotiwa. <verse eid="MAT 26:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 26:32"/>Sinuntano kitun kabinanneen orfo nittoostan zeemma Galiilatu hamana» yi.<verse eid="MAT 26:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 26:33"/>Phexiros wolgire: «Oomiis zuuttere neen mormesefeknu ta neen aafa mormona wuza» yi. <verse eid="MAT 26:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 26:34"/>Yesus: «Futo neek makefawungwa; hawungti waalaasik ako oorunoyfeen; keeza wolla taan mormotawa» yi. <verse eid="MAT 26:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 26:35"/>Sinuntano Phexiros dey: «Neneen ane kitu sholsifaananenu isanne aafawa neen mormona wuza» yi. Oom Nawobaasakito dey esiisimato maksete.<verse eid="MAT 26:35"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesus Getesemani Yistefa Dimaastak Shiiphe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 26:36"/>Estan Yesus nawobaasakitoneen Getesemani yistefa dimaasta hami. Estak nawobaasakitonin: «Ta ek hamma shiiphonar sinna boor'a nitto hanta footiwa» yi. <verse eid="MAT 26:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 26:37"/>Yesus Phexirosninnawa hep Zabdewosni naanggotiisinna zoonsire hami. Tiir'o barin ephaan suumo ephi. <verse eid="MAT 26:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 26:38"/>Ekka dey yi: «Kaanaas kituta kar'ananneen akamanon suumewa. Nitto hanta faafaat taneen ane chimtiwa» yi. <verse eid="MAT 26:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 26:39"/>Baassostan garonon eksefaat kaa'nere ekka yit shiiphe: «Abataaso; chimtefaanane han shanani toofoos tayistan aatungwa. Sinuntano ne shuntamato sinanaastano ta shunnamatotawa» yi.<verse eid="MAT 26:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 26:40"/>Es keez nawobaasakitoniki wolle yeere kunefeen dani. Phexirosnin: «Taneen ane isa sa'atine guzuk aane chimetinoso? <verse eid="MAT 26:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 26:41"/>Fatanasi girunoytimato guzira shiiphotiwa. Ayyanaas hooreratu fa, sinuntano ashaas hopiyawa» yi.<verse eid="MAT 26:41"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 26:42"/>Hepsa dey hamme ekka yit shiiphe: «Abataaso! Han shanani toofoos ushanon ushnoy faana aatak chimtonor sinfaanane ne shunta bar sinungwa» <verse eid="MAT 26:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 26:43"/>Wolle yeere kar'in nawobaasakitoni aafaas afay'nik fayfaan kunefeen dani. <verse eid="MAT 26:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 26:44"/>Dey baassotin beyye hamme keezsa ukkotiisimato shiiphe. <verse eid="MAT 26:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 26:45"/>Estan nawobaasakitoniki yeere: «Hashneen kar'a kunfetiyoso? Dey beysa ephtifetiyoso? Ese Asuni Naa boor'ni meeni kushusi aattere imtona sa'atiis kar'iwa. <verse eid="MAT 26:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 26:46"/>Kabseni hamniwa. Taan aatire imni bar tai'sewa» yi.<verse eid="MAT 26:46"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesusni Aattere Imtonewa Oottone</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 14:43-50">Mar. 14:43-50</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:47-53">Luqa. 22:47-53</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:3-12">Yoha. 18:3-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="MAT 26:47"/>Es baron makefeen asire heppe nawobaasasin isaas sina Yuuda ye. Barneen ane dey siifonewa mukne epho showo dara yeesete. Baasso dey maagni gaanynye meyakinnawa daraasa kur'uni meyakinna wostere yeeseter. <verse eid="MAT 26:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MAT 26:48"/>Aatire imni Yuuda: «Ta daamona barintu ephatiwa» yire baassok beso imme feer.<verse eid="MAT 26:48"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="MAT 26:49"/>Yuuda geregere Yesusniki tai'sere: «Assinynyano! Naga neek sinfawungwa» yit daame. <verse eid="MAT 26:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="MAT 26:50"/>Yesus: «Zomotaaso! Ese yaata chowaason koi'suwa?» yi. Estan asuni meya Yesusniki tai'sesere ephete. <verse eid="MAT 26:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="MAT 26:51"/>Es kabaasik Yesusneen ane fe baassossin isaas kushubaason shongere siifoson kisire maagni gaanynye meeni gaanynyaasa wostinynyani odonon kace. <verse eid="MAT 26:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="MAT 26:52"/>Sinuntano Yesus barik ekka yi: «Siifo kisife baasso zuuttere siifoktu tishusone sinna boor'a siifoneeson zanbaassi wolgira gedwa. <verse eid="MAT 26:52"/><verse number="53" style="v" sid="MAT 26:53"/>Abataasin shiiphefaanane bar showo kumsi faadtoni meya taar'o Ha'oni wosiya wosuk hopunirne faar sinna nittok bestefawoso? <verse eid="MAT 26:53"/><verse number="54" style="v" sid="MAT 26:54"/>Ekka sinar sinfaanane: ‹Shana ephphetoonak sholsifa› yifa korto matsafaasi kaama aakkak sinanak chimnirinso?»<verse eid="MAT 26:54"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="MAT 26:55"/>Es kabaasik Yesus daraasik: «Bo'inynyani ephni asunimato siifonewa mukne ephpha taan ephatik yaatiyoso? Wonna wonna betemeqdesiissi assit nittoneen ane faana kabaasik aane taan epheti. <verse eid="MAT 26:55"/><verse number="56" style="v" sid="MAT 26:56"/>Sinuntano han bar zuuttambaase sinnaas raajjuni meeni matsafaassi tichchera kuni bar sinanakwa» yi. Es kabaasik nawobaasakito zuuttambesiise barin beyere eelesete.<verse eid="MAT 26:56"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesus Shonggosta Oottere Hami</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 14:53-65">Mar. 14:53-65</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:54-55">Luqa. 22:54-55</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:13-14">Yoha. 18:13-14</ref>, <ref loc="JHN 18:19-24">19-24</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="MAT 26:57"/>Yesusnin epha asuni meya maagni gaanynye meeni gaanynya sina Keyyaffaniki taamete. Estak dey Museni tumaasi assinynyanawa kur'uni meena zuuttere feeseter. <verse eid="MAT 26:57"/><verse number="58" style="v" sid="MAT 26:58"/>Sinuntano Phexiros maagni gaanynye meeni gaanynyaasa ojni keerkalo kar'ananneen woksok orfobaase hami. Sinni chowaasi ko'anon biyanak keerkalo girire tasoni meyaneen di. <verse eid="MAT 26:58"/><verse number="59" style="v" sid="MAT 26:59"/>Maagni gaanynye meenawa Ayhudni shonggota diisefe baassotna zuuttere Yesusniista kituni mangsuni kar'a katusonek esh zaalnin sholset feeseter. <verse eid="MAT 26:59"/><verse number="60" style="v" sid="MAT 26:60"/>Showo esh zaalni meya tai'sisefeknu Yesusnin kituta katuni zaala aane danoto. Koi'baasta dey hep zaal tai'sere: <verse eid="MAT 26:60"/><verse number="61" style="v" sid="MAT 26:61"/>«Han asus: ‹Betemeqdesiison bogaat keezsinari wono wolgira keer'anawa› yiwa» yit maksete.<verse eid="MAT 26:61"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v" sid="MAT 26:62"/>Maagni gaanynye meeni gaanynyaas kabire: «Han asuni meya neyista maksefe zaalaason aane wolgifenoso?» yi. <verse eid="MAT 26:62"/><verse number="63" style="v" sid="MAT 26:63"/>Sinuntano Yesus shaakki. Maagni gaanynye meeni gaanynyaas dey: «Hayewa Ha'oosi sunak neen teysifawungwa! Ne Ha'oni naa Kiristoos sinneeson innok makowa» yi. <verse eid="MAT 26:63"/><verse number="64" style="v" sid="MAT 26:64"/>Yesus: «Ne maketaasimatowa; nittok makefawungwa, hawungneen ekalo Asuni Naa hugnaba faana Ha'oosi ho'itta diifen biyatiwa. Esiisimato dey samaki shaaruusikitota yeefeen biyatiwa» yi. <verse eid="MAT 26:64"/><verse number="65" style="v" sid="MAT 26:65"/>Es kabaasik maagni gaanynye meeni gaanynyaas maybaason karasaat: «Ha'oosta mei'ni kaama makewa. Nittonu me'baason odetiwa. Haniistan ooma zaala awuniron sholsunirinso?» yi. <verse eid="MAT 26:65"/><verse number="66" style="v" sid="MAT 26:66"/>Eekin nittok awu sinna bestefaso? Baasso dey: «Kitutu barik sholsuwa» yit wolgisete.<verse eid="MAT 26:66"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="67" style="v" sid="MAT 26:67"/>Es kabaasik sinba tujeset, ki'eset, bocheset: <verse eid="MAT 26:67"/><verse number="68" style="v" sid="MAT 26:68"/>«Kiristoosno! Neen ichaas oonso? Raaji innok makebbo» yiset feeseter.<verse eid="MAT 26:68"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Phexiros Yesusnin Morme</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 14:66-72">Mar. 14:66-72</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:56-62">Luqa. 22:56-62</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:15-18">Yoha. 18:15-18</ref>, <ref loc="JHN 18:25-27">25-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="69" style="v" sid="MAT 26:69"/>Phexiros ojni keerkalo diifen isa keerki wostinynya barki tai'sera: «Ne dey Galiilaki Yesusneen ane faatarwa» yi. <verse eid="MAT 26:69"/><verse number="70" style="v" sid="MAT 26:70"/>Sinuntano Phexiros: «Ne makefata baron aane arifatwe» yit zuuttambesiise asi sinak morme. <verse eid="MAT 26:70"/><verse number="71" style="v" sid="MAT 26:71"/>Finynya kesfeen ooma keerki wostinynya dey barin biyaat esta fe baassok: «Han bar Naaziretki Yesusneen ane feerwa» yi. <verse eid="MAT 26:71"/><verse number="72" style="v" sid="MAT 26:72"/>Hepsa dey Phexiros teyire: «Es makefata asusin aane arifatwe» yi. <verse eid="MAT 26:72"/><verse number="73" style="v" sid="MAT 26:73"/>Garo sa'atineen orfo esta yere asuni meya tai'sere Phexirosnin: «Wolumnees assidifawa, futok ne baasso ganeyaassin isaaswa» yisete. <verse eid="MAT 26:73"/><verse number="74" style="v" sid="MAT 26:74"/>Es kabaasik Phexiros: «Ta es asusin aane arifatwa» yit bar barin wolgire erwuknawa tewukna kabi. Estan geregere ako oori. <verse eid="MAT 26:74"/><verse number="75" style="v" sid="MAT 26:75"/>Phexiros dey: «Ako oorunoyfeen keeza wolla mormotawa» yit Yesus makena bar nibbaassi keji. Gerakalo kesse dey akamanon suumere waasi.<verse eid="MAT 26:75"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 26"/>
  <chapter number="27" style="c" sid="MAT 27"/>
  <para style="s1">Yesus Pilatosniki Oottere Hami</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 15:1">Mar. 15:1</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:1-2">Luqa. 23:1-2</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:28-32">Yoha. 18:28-32</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 27:1"/>E'so wonsak maagni gaanynye meenawa daraasa kur'uni meena zuuttere Yesusniista kituni mangsuni kar'a katusonek merkesete. <verse eid="MAT 27:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 27:2"/>Estan Yesusnin taar'e ephphe taamme ha'sife Pilatosniki aatire imete.<verse eid="MAT 27:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 27:3"/>Yesusniista mangsu katenamato aatire ima Yuuda biyaat gaabbe. Keezasir shu'ni birriison dey maagni gaanynye meyaknawa kur'uni meyakna wolgire imi. <verse eid="MAT 27:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 27:4"/>«Kayim asusin kituk aatire imnaasik boor'a wostengwa» yi. Sinuntano baasso: «Eekin innotin aamba tiir'e? Ne girowa» yisete. <verse eid="MAT 27:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 27:5"/>Yuuda dey keezasir shu'ni birriison betemeqdesiissi taamme ha'aat hamme geetere kiti.<verse eid="MAT 27:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 27:6"/>Maagni gaanynye meya keezasir shu'ni birriison ephere: «Han bar harinni waaga sinna boor'a betemeqdesiisik imte waagaassi woi'sunik sholsutawa» yisete. <verse eid="MAT 27:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 27:7"/>Estan merkesere irbani mooga sinanak koda ooi'fe basa daanon waagsete. <verse eid="MAT 27:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 27:8"/>Es bari boor'a es daas hash hawungneen kar'a: «Harinni daa» yisteratu teegtefa.<verse eid="MAT 27:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 27:9"/>Esiisik: «Israelni naanggotaasikito gammatesete barik sinni waaga keezasir shu'ni birriison ephete. <verse eid="MAT 27:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 27:10"/>Daamiis taan ajajenaasimato koda ooi'fe basa daasik kaassete» yistera raajju Ermiyasniki kamo makte bar sini.<verse eid="MAT 27:10"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesus Pilatosniki Sina Ta'i</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 15:2-5">Mar. 15:2-5</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:3-5">Luqa. 23:3-5</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:33-38">Yoha. 18:33-38</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 27:11"/>Yesus daa ha'sife Philaxosni sina ta'i. Bar dey: «Ne Ayhudni taatonoso?» yit mamsi. Yesus wolgire: «Ne maketaasimatowa» yi. <verse eid="MAT 27:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 27:12"/>Maagni meeni gaanynyasakitonawa kur'uni meena barin malassefeen isa wuzane aane wolguwe. <verse eid="MAT 27:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 27:13"/>Estan Pilatos: «Apun wuza neyista teshshere malassedifemato aane odefenoso?» <verse eid="MAT 27:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 27:14"/>Daa ha'sife bar akamanon diinqonanneen teshshesete malataasik isa kaamanu aane wolguwe.<verse eid="MAT 27:14"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesusniista Kituni Mangsu Kate</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 23:13-25">Luqa. 23:13-25</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:39-40">Yoha. 18:39-40</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:1-16">19:1-16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 27:15"/>Daason ha'sife bar faasika fasikaasik daraas isa taato kottonak mamsinaysimato taatoos kotin dostere feeseter. <verse eid="MAT 27:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 27:16"/>Es kabaasik manguk arto Barbaan yiste taato feer. <verse eid="MAT 27:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 27:17"/>Baasso zuuttere feeseten Pilatos: «Barbaaniningwa wedey Kiristoos yiste [Yesusnin] kotanak sholefetiso?» yi. <verse eid="MAT 27:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 27:18"/>Pilatos ekka yinaas baasso manguk aatire imobesiison arire feer sinna boor'awa. <verse eid="MAT 27:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 27:19"/>Pilatos mangsuni kar'ni kodaasta diifen basa asus: «Han asusa chowanon waalin miitok akama shana biingwa. Han kayim asusata isa wuzane zagutaatawa» yira wosi. <verse eid="MAT 27:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 27:20"/>Sinuntano maagni gaanynye meenawa kur'uni meena Barbaan kottonaknawa Yesus wortonakna mamsusonek daraasin kiitisete. <verse eid="MAT 27:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 27:21"/>Daa ha'sife bar wolgire: «Heppiisasin aafferin kotanak sholefetiso?» yit daraasin mamsi. Baasso dey: «Barbaannintu kotatak sholefeniwa» yisete. <verse eid="MAT 27:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 27:22"/>Pilatos: «Eekin Kiristoos yistefe Yesusnin awu zagunarinso?» yi. Zuuttambesiise: «Suuttowowa» yisete. <verse eid="MAT 27:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 27:23"/>Ha'sife bar: «Aamso? Bar mangsina wuza aambanso?» yi. Sinuntano baasso: «Suuttowowa» yit chaaga arkissisete. <verse eid="MAT 27:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 27:24"/>Pilatos biin naga turuksunir sinbaase aka barik teshshosonek zagire daraasa sina kushubaason maset: «Ta han asusa harinsik aafotwa. Nittotu mamustonirwa» yi. <verse eid="MAT 27:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 27:25"/>Daraas zuuttere: «Han asusa hanna innoostanawa naanggotniistana sinun» yire wolgisete.<verse eid="MAT 27:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 27:26"/>Es kabaasik Barbaannin kotte gafkaat Yesusnin alanggak ishshire suuttonak aatire imi.<verse eid="MAT 27:26"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Meya Taar'oni Meya Yesusnin Kanyesete</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 15:16-20">Mar. 15:16-20</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:2-3">Yoha. 19:2-3</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 27:27"/>Es kabaasik ha'sife basa meya taar'osakito Yesusnin ephphe ha'sife basa ojaasi keerkalo taamete. Meya taar'osakitonin dey Yesusni biratoosta zuutisete. <verse eid="MAT 27:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 27:28"/>Maambaason gaa'efaat she'a maama maysisete. <verse eid="MAT 27:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 27:29"/>Seer'a ma'ire teetbaasta guufsisete. Hoi'ta kushubaassi sobboqoni haaro ootisefaat sinba kaa'nesere: «Ayhudni taatono! Naga neek sinfawungwa» yit kanyesete. <verse eid="MAT 27:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 27:30"/>Tujeset haarooson dey kushubaassin ephere teetbaason icheset feeseter. <verse eid="MAT 27:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 27:31"/>Kanyesetenneen orfo she'a maamaason gaa'efaat basa maamaason wolgire maysisere suuttonak ephphe hamete.<verse eid="MAT 27:31"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesusni Suutto</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 15:21-32">Mar. 15:21-32</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:26-43">Luqa. 23:26-43</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:17-27">Yoha. 19:17-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 27:32"/>Ha'sife basa ojaasi keerkalon kesefe kabaasik Simon yistefe Qerenaki asunin danesere mesqeliison wor'anak giddisisete. <verse eid="MAT 27:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 27:33"/>Esseen orfo kotbaas dey: «Teetni mega» yistera teegtefa Golgota kar'ete. <verse eid="MAT 27:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 27:34"/>Estak tisha woi'to wayinini usha ushanak imete. Bar dey bechchire biyaat ushanak aane sholowe. <verse eid="MAT 27:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 27:35"/>Suutetenneen orfo maambaasta ixa ha'sere haa'esete. <verse eid="MAT 27:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 27:36"/>Esta diisefaat oodet feeseter. <verse eid="MAT 27:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 27:37"/>«Han bar Ayhudni taato Yesuswa» yifa malatni ticha den mesqeliisi teetta yeetisete. <verse eid="MAT 27:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 27:38"/>Es kabaasik hep bo'inynyanin isaasin oi'ta teshbaasta, isaasin dey alda teshbaasta Yesusneen ane suutete. <verse eid="MAT 27:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 27:39"/>Esta kamo aatfe asuni meya dey kashshuk teetbesiison shorkisefaafe me'esete: <verse eid="MAT 27:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 27:40"/>«Betemeqdesiison bogaat keezsinari wono keer'ni ne ese teetneeson fu'owa! Ha'oni Naa sinfaatane mesqelistan kerowa» yisete.<verse eid="MAT 27:40"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 27:41"/>Esiisimato dey maagni gaanynye meya, Museni tumaasi assinynyanawa kur'uni meena isarik ekka yiset kanyet feeseter: <verse eid="MAT 27:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 27:42"/>«Oomiisin fu'e, sinuntano teetbaason fu'ok aane chime. Israelni taato sinfaanane hash mesqelistan kerowowa. Inno dey barik amanoniwa. <verse eid="MAT 27:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 27:43"/>Bar Ha'oosik amanewa. ‹Ta Ha'oni Naawa› yiwa. Ese Ha'oos barin shunar sinfaanane hash barin fu'ongwa.» <verse eid="MAT 27:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 27:44"/>Esiisimato dey barneen ane suutte bo'inynyani meya dey me'eset feeseter.<verse eid="MAT 27:44"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesusni Kitu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 15:33-41">Mar. 15:33-41</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:44-49">Luqa. 23:44-49</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:28-30">Yoha. 19:28-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 27:45"/>Issun sa'atiistan kabira hamma izgin sa'ati kar'ananneen daa zuuttambaase asiista talma sini. <verse eid="MAT 27:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 27:46"/>Izgin sa'atiistak Yesus: «Elohe! Elohe! lamasebeqtani!» yire akama kaamak chaagi. Kotbaas dey: «Ha'onaase! Ha'onaase! Awuni boor'a taan beyitse» uu. <verse eid="MAT 27:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MAT 27:47"/>Esta yerse asuni meya odesefaat «Han bar Eliyasnintu teegedifewa» yisete. <verse eid="MAT 27:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MAT 27:48"/>Geregere baassossin isar eelle sefinegi ephphetesshere suqaro wayini tuunire sobboqoni haaroni fashta duusire ushanak imi. <verse eid="MAT 27:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MAT 27:49"/>Sinuntano oomiisakito «Beytiwa, Eeliyas yeere barin fu'obane biyaniwa» yisete. <verse eid="MAT 27:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="MAT 27:50"/>Yesus hepsak akama kaamak chaagge kaabaason aatire imi.<verse eid="MAT 27:50"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="MAT 27:51"/>Es kabaasik betemeqdesiisi yinu denun kabira daa kar'a heppik karate. Daas dey shorke. Daastaki kaa'oos dey kalate. <verse eid="MAT 27:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="MAT 27:52"/>Moogaasikito dey gachchen sir kunse kortoni meyaassin showoni meya kitun kabsete. <verse eid="MAT 27:52"/><verse number="53" style="v" sid="MAT 27:53"/>Moogaassin kesere Yesus kitun kabinanneen orfo korto katama Yerusalem girsete. Estak dey showo asuni meyak bestesete. <verse eid="MAT 27:53"/><verse number="54" style="v" sid="MAT 27:54"/>Tii meya taar'oni meeni gaanynyaasnawa barneen ane Yesusnin oodet feese baassotna daasi shorkononnawa sina chowaasonna biyeseteyse akamanon digsere: «Han bar futok Ha'oni Naawa» yisete. <verse eid="MAT 27:54"/><verse number="55" style="v" sid="MAT 27:55"/>Yesusnin argasit Galiilan basa orfoose hama showo mashka meya woksok yersefaat biyet esta feeseter. <verse eid="MAT 27:55"/><verse number="56" style="v" sid="MAT 27:56"/>Baassossin Megdelawitki Maarami, Yaqobnawa Yosefna asi into Maarami, Zebdewosni naanggotiisa into dey esta feeseter.<verse eid="MAT 27:56"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesusni Kabbarto</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 15:42-47">Mar. 15:42-47</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:50-56">Luqa. 23:50-56</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:38-42">Yoha. 19:38-42</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="MAT 27:57"/>Waalfana kabaasik Yosef yiste isa otum asu Armatiyasni kataman ye. Bar dey Yesusni nawo. <verse eid="MAT 27:57"/><verse number="58" style="v" sid="MAT 27:58"/>Es bar Pilatosniki tai'sere Yesusni dugnooson ephanak mamsi. Pilatos dey imtonak ajaje. <verse eid="MAT 27:58"/><verse number="59" style="v" sid="MAT 27:59"/>Yosef dugnooson kayma maamak zuuti. <verse eid="MAT 27:59"/><verse number="60" style="v" sid="MAT 27:60"/>Shu'ak katera hoorera kuni Yosefni gaddo moogsi taamme kabbare. Estan moogaasi noonota inya shu'a bukalsire ukaat hami. <verse eid="MAT 27:60"/><verse number="61" style="v" sid="MAT 27:61"/>Megdelawitki Maaraminewa ooma Maaramine moogaasi sinta diisefer.<verse eid="MAT 27:61"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v" sid="MAT 27:62"/>Wonotirik beysani wonaasi hooroneen orfo maagni gaanynye meenawa Ferisawini meena isarik Pilatosniki hamere ekka yisete: <verse eid="MAT 27:62"/><verse number="63" style="v" sid="MAT 27:63"/>«Daamiiso! Han eshinynyaas zeemo kaak feena kabaasik: ‹Keezsinari wono kitun kabunarwa› yina bar nibniista kejiwa. <verse eid="MAT 27:63"/><verse number="64" style="v" sid="MAT 27:64"/>Es bari boor'a nawobaasakito waalin yeesere dugnooson wiisefaat daraasik: ‹Kitun kabiwa› usonoytemato keez wona kar'ananneen moogaason oodosonek ajajowa. Es bar sina shakaanane orfoti daagsuus sinatiistan akamanon mangu sinarwa» yisete. <verse eid="MAT 27:64"/><verse number="65" style="v" sid="MAT 27:65"/>Pilatos wolgire: «Oodni meya taar'oni meya feeseter sinna boor'a ephpha hamfaat arifetimato oodsutiwa» yi. <verse eid="MAT 27:65"/><verse number="66" style="v" sid="MAT 27:66"/>Baasso dey hamere moogaasi noononon shu'ak kulfaat tukbaasta maatamak ichche oodni asunin oodsisete.<verse eid="MAT 27:66"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 27"/>
  <chapter number="28" style="c" sid="MAT 28"/>
  <para style="s1">Yesusni Kitun Kabu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 16:1-10">Mar. 16:1-10</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 24:1-12">Luqa. 24:1-12</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 20:1-10">Yoha. 20:1-10</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 28:1"/>Beysani wonaas aatnanneen orfo torbaniisi tesuni wono wonsa she'u feteetifana kabaasik Megdelawitki Maaraminewa ooma Maaramine moogaason biyak hamete. <verse eid="MAT 28:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 28:2"/>Daamiisa wosiya den saman kerena boor'a akama daani shorko sini. Bar dey tai'sera moogaas uktera kunna shu'aason bukalsaat barista di. <verse eid="MAT 28:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 28:3"/>Daamiisa wosiyani gito dey kawunanimato chaaret faar. Maybaas dey ironi she'animato foro. <verse eid="MAT 28:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 28:4"/>Tasoni meya dey Daamiisa wosiyanon digak korkit kitune feer sinete. <verse eid="MAT 28:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 28:5"/>Sinuntano Daamiisa wosiya mashka meyak: «Nitto digotiitawe, suutte Yesusnin sholefetimato aringwe. <verse eid="MAT 28:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 28:6"/>Bar hantak aafe, makenaasimato kitun kabi. Kunna dimaason hani yaasefaat biyotiwe. <verse eid="MAT 28:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 28:7"/>Taptera hamfaat: ‹Kitun kabiwa, Ek Galiila zeemme hamnir. Estak uphotiwa› yira nawobaasakitonik makotiwe. Ese ta nittok maken» yi.<verse eid="MAT 28:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 28:8"/>Estan digaknawa akama girakna taptesere moogaasi teshan nawoni meyak makok eelesete. <verse eid="MAT 28:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 28:9"/>Yesus uguntak baassok uphere: «Naga nittok sinfawungwe» yi. Baasso dey barki tai'sesere wochobaason ephphe sagadesete. <verse eid="MAT 28:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 28:10"/>Es kabaasik Yesus: «Digotiitawe! Hamfaat Galiila hamonek aytaasakitonik maksoti. Estak taan biyosone» yi.<verse eid="MAT 28:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 28:11"/>Mashka meya hamefeen meya taar'oni meyaassin isa isaas katamaassi hamere sina chowaason zuutire maagni gaanynye meyak maksete. <verse eid="MAT 28:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 28:12"/>Maagni gaanynye meya kur'uni meyaneen zuuttere merkesetenneen orfo meya taar'osakitonik akama waaga imefaat ekka yisete: <verse eid="MAT 28:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 28:13"/>« ‹Inno kunfeni wassi nawobaasakito yeesere dugnooson wiisetewa› yira daraasik makotiwa. <verse eid="MAT 28:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 28:14"/>Han chowaason ha'sife bar odefaanane inno barik mai'sira makoni. Dey rakko nittoosta kar'noynamato zaguniwa» yisete. <verse eid="MAT 28:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 28:15"/>Meya taar'osakito waagaason ephefaat baassok maktenaasimato zagsete. Es chowaas dey hawungneen kar'a Ayhudni meeni ganeyaassi maktettu faafa.<verse eid="MAT 28:15"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesus Nawoni Meyak Ammanon Beste</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 16:14-18">Mar. 16:14-18</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 24:36-49">Luqa. 24:36-49</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 20:19-23">Yoha. 20:19-23</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 1:6-8">Wos. 1:6-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 28:16"/>Asire isse nawobaasakito Yesus hamonek makena Galiilaki fa aamaasta hamete. <verse eid="MAT 28:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 28:17"/>Yesusnin biyeteese barik sagadesete. Sinuntano baassossin isa isaas «Han wuzaas futota» yisete. <verse eid="MAT 28:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 28:18"/>Yesus baassoki tai'sere: «Samaknawa han daastakna ha'suni hugna zuuttera taak imtewa; <verse eid="MAT 28:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 28:19"/>Ese hamfaat han daasta fe daraasin zuutira aba, Naa, Korto Ayyanaasi sunak haphqira ta nawo zaguti; <verse eid="MAT 28:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 28:20"/>Ta nittok ajajena baron zuutire oodosonek assuti. Ta han daasi ko'a kar'ananneen wonna wonna nittoneen anetu fawungwa» yi.<verse eid="MAT 28:20"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 28"/>
</usx>
